#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.GENERIC"
