msgstr "Это старая статуя."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE2"
