#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_COLD"
msgid "Brrr... w-when did it get so cold?"
msgstr "Бр-р-р... С-с чего это вдруг стало так холодно?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_COMPASS_OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_COMPASS_OUT"
msgid "I'm not sure how this simple mechanism managed to break, but..."
msgstr "Не понимаю, как такой простой механизм вообще может сломаться, но..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_COZY_SLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_COZY_SLEEP"
msgid "Ah, I feel fit as a fiddle!"
msgstr "Чувствую себя просто чудесно!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_CRAFTING_FAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_CRAFTING_FAIL"
msgid "Oh botheration. I forgot something again, didn't I?"
msgstr "Вот ведь неудобство. Я опять про что-то забыла, да?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_DAMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_DAMP"
msgid "A little water shouldn't be anything to worry about."
msgstr "Ничего страшного в легкой влажности нет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_DEERCLOPS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_DEERCLOPS"
msgid "Oh botheration, is it that time of year already?"
msgstr "Ну что за неудобство! Неужто опять настало это время года?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_DESPAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_DESPAWN"
msgid "Wait, stop! I need more time--!"
msgstr "Нет! Стой! Мне нужно больше вре..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_ATTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_ATTACK"
msgid "Whew, I don't know what came over me..."
msgstr "Фух! Даже не знаю, что на меня нашло."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_ELECTRICATTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_ELECTRICATTACK"
msgid "I'll miss having electricity at my fingertips."
msgstr "Мне будет не хватать электричества на кончиках пальцев."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_MOISTUREIMMUNITY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_MOISTUREIMMUNITY"
msgid "Oh botheration, I was getting used to being waterproof."
msgstr "Вот неудобство. Я уже привыкла не мокнуть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_PLAYERABSORPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_PLAYERABSORPTION"
msgid "I'm suddenly feeling a bit unprotected..."
msgstr "Я вдруг почувствовала себя беззащитной..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_SLEEPRESISTANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_SLEEPRESISTANCE"
msgid "I guess I can't avoid sleeping forever."
msgstr "Что ж, всю жизнь без сна не проживешь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_WORKEFFECTIVENESS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_WORKEFFECTIVENESS"
msgid "No! I can't slow down now!"
msgstr "Нет! Нельзя замедляться!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_DIG_DISEASE_WARNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_DIG_DISEASE_WARNING"
msgid "It looks better already."
msgstr "Это уже выглядит неплохо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_DISCHARGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_DISCHARGE"
msgid "only_used_by_wx78"
msgstr "only_used_by_wx78"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_DUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_DUSK"
msgid "I need to hurry, I'm losing daylight."
msgstr "Нужно торопиться, скоро стемнеет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_EAT.COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_EAT.COOKED"
msgid "only_used_by_warly"
msgstr "only_used_by_warly"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_EAT.DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_EAT.DRIED"
msgid "only_used_by_warly"
msgstr "only_used_by_warly"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_EAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_EAT.GENERIC"
msgid "Mmm!"
msgstr "М-м-м!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_EAT.INVALID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_EAT.INVALID"
msgid "I'm not eating that!"
msgstr "Я такое не ем!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_EAT.PAINFUL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_EAT.PAINFUL"
msgid "Ohh... I don't feel well..."
msgstr "О-ох, мне нехорошо..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_EAT.PREPARED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_EAT.PREPARED"
msgid "only_used_by_warly"
