#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_EMPTY"
msgid "Here sappy, sappy, sap."
msgstr "Тут липкий, липкий сок."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_READY"
msgid "Sweet golden sap."
msgstr "Сладкий, золотистый сок."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.WOUNDED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.WOUNDED"
msgid "It looks ill."
msgstr "Выглядит вяло."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG"
msgid "It's a super hairy pig."
msgstr "Это очень мохнатая свинья!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIGELDER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIGELDER.GENERIC"
msgid "I guess you're in charge around here?"
msgstr "Кажется, ты тут за главного?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIGELDER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIGELDER.SLEEPING"
msgid "It's sleeping, for now."
msgstr "Пока что он спит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG_HOUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG_HOUSE"
msgid "It's seen better days."
msgstr "Видал он и лучшие времена."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG_HOUSE_RUBBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG_HOUSE_RUBBLE"
msgid "Some pig's house was ruined."
msgstr "Домик свинок разрушен."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SYRUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SYRUP"
msgid "Adds sweetness to the mixture."
msgstr "Сделает вкус слаще."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO"
msgid "It's red because it's full of science."
msgstr "Он красный, потому что полон науки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO_COOKED"
msgid "Cooking's easy if you understand chemistry."
msgstr "Готовить проще простого, если разбираешься в химии."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO_SEEDS"
msgid "A handful of odd seeds."
msgstr "Горстка странных семян."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TRADER_MERM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TRADER_MERM"
msgid "Maybe they'd be willing to trade."
msgstr "Может, у них есть что-нибудь на продажу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TRADER_MERM2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TRADER_MERM2"
msgid "Maybe they'd be willing to trade."
msgstr "Может, у них есть что-нибудь на продажу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP"
msgid "It's a raw turnip."
msgstr "Это сырая репка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP_COOKED"
msgid "Cooking is science in practice."
msgstr "Кулинария — это наука на практике."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP_SEEDS"
msgid "A handful of odd seeds."
msgstr "Горстка странных семян."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_WHEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_WHEAT"
msgid "It looks a bit grainy."
msgstr "Как-то зернисто."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_WHEAT_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_WHEAT_SEEDS"
msgid "A handful of odd seeds."
msgstr "Горстка странных семян."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.GENERIC"
msgid "A rabbit... or is it?"
msgstr "Это кролик... Ведь правда?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.HELD"
msgid "What am I supposed to do with it now?"
msgstr "Ну и что мне теперь с ним делать?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RABBITHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RABBITHAT"
msgid "A fashion statement?"
msgstr "Последний писк моды?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.GENERIC"
msgid "I'd better watch my step, wouldn't want to fall down a rabbit hole."
msgstr "Надо быть поосторожнее, а то провалюсь в кроличью нору."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.SPRING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.SPRING"
msgid "No more rabbit hole, for now."
msgstr "Сейчас кроличьей норы нет, но пройдет время..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.BURNT"
msgid "Something smells good!"
msgstr "Пахнет чем-то вкусным!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "These carrots stuff themselves full of rabbits."
msgstr "Эта морковка битком набита кроликами."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGHORN"
msgid "It plays a familiar tune."
msgstr "Знакомая мелодия."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGHORN_CHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGHORN_CHEST"
msgid "I hope I don't forget what I put in there."
msgstr "Главное — не забыть, что я туда положила."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGMINION_BUNNYMAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGMINION_BUNNYMAN"
msgid "From a bad litter, indeed."
msgstr "Вероятно, он из плохого помета."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGSPEAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGSPEAR"
msgid "Surprisingly intimidating."
msgstr "Удивительно угрожающая."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_AGGRESSIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_AGGRESSIVE"
msgid "You have a horrible attitude."
msgstr "Характер у тебя не сахар."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_LUCKY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_LUCKY"
msgid "I know I should catch that rabbit!"
msgstr "Этого кролика необходимо поймать, я чувствую!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_PASSIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_PASSIVE"
msgid "What a sweet little fellow."
msgstr "Что за милый пушистик."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RAINCOAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RAINCOAT"
msgid "It keeps me warm and dry."
msgstr "В нем тепло и сухо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RAINHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RAINHAT"
msgid "What a charming rain bonnet!"
msgstr "Какая очаровательная шляпка от дождя!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.BURNT"
msgid "Maybe that was meant to happen."
msgstr "Наверное, этому было суждено произойти."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.GENERIC"
msgid "Pfft. I could just check the weather myself if I felt like it."
msgstr "Пф-ф, можно подумать, я и так не пойму, какая сейчас погода."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RATATOUILLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RATATOUILLE"
msgid "That's a fun name for a bunch of chopped vegetables."
msgstr "Какое забавное название для нарубленных овощей."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RAZOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RAZOR"
msgid "This seems dangerous."
msgstr "Выглядит опасно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RECORD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RECORD"
msgid "Is this that newfangled ragtime music the youth are raving about?"
msgstr "Это тот самый новомодный регтайм, от которого молодежь с ума посходила?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_BALATRO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_BALATRO"
msgid "I've heard it before and I'll hear it again."
msgstr "Я это уже слышала. И еще услышу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_CREEPYFOREST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_CREEPYFOREST"
msgid "Do I look like I have time to sit around listening to records?"
msgstr "Как будто у меня есть время сидеть и слушать эти ваши пластинки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DANGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DANGER"
msgid "I prefer their earlier work."
msgstr "Мне нравятся их более ранние работы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DAWN"
msgid "I prefer their later work."
msgstr "Мне нравятся их более поздние работы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DRSTYLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DRSTYLE"
msgid "I prefer their earlier work."
msgstr "Мне нравятся их более ранние работы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DUSK"
msgid "I prefer their earlier work."
msgstr "Мне нравятся их более ранние работы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_EFS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_EFS"
msgid "I prefer their later work."
msgstr "Мне нравятся их более поздние работы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_END
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_END"
msgid "Do I look like I have time to sit around listening to records?"
msgstr "Как будто у меня есть время сидеть и слушать эти ваши пластинки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_HALLOWEDNIGHTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_HALLOWEDNIGHTS"
msgid "This takes me back."
msgstr "Навевает воспоминания."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_MAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_MAIN"
msgid "I prefer their earlier work."
msgstr "Мне нравятся их более ранние работы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_WORKTOBEDONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RECORD_WORKTOBEDONE"
msgid "I prefer their later work."
msgstr "Мне нравятся их более поздние работы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.REDGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.REDGEM"
msgid "It's amazing how many gems you can find just lying around here."
msgstr "Поверить не могу, сколько тут валяется драгоценных камней."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.REDLANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.REDLANTERN"
msgid "Luckily for me, the flame can't seem to reach the paper surrounding it."
msgstr "К счастью для меня, огонь не сумеет дотянуться до бумаги."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.REDMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.REDMOONEYE"
msgid "I suppose it never hurts to keep an eye out."
msgstr "За некоторыми вещами нужен глаз да глаз."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.REDPOUCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.REDPOUCH"
msgid "There's something jangling around inside."
msgstr "Внутри что-то бренчит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP"
msgid "I'm pretty sure red is the bad color."
msgstr "Почти уверена, что красные грибы — это не к добру."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP_COOKED"
msgid "This seems like a bad idea."
msgstr "Это плохая идея."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.GENERIC"
msgid "Just another mushroom."
msgstr "Гриб как гриб."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.INGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.INGROUND"
msgid "It's just something or other."
msgstr "Что-то ждет своего часа."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.PICKED"
msgid "Maybe it's best if it doesn't grow back."
msgstr "Может, оно и к лучшему, если он не вырастет снова."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.REEDS.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.REEDS.BURNING"
msgid "That's not good..."
msgstr "Это нехорошо..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.REEDS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.REEDS.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm definitely in a marsh."
msgstr "Я точно угодила в болото."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.REEDS.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.REEDS.PICKED"
msgid "No sense in waiting around for it to grow back."
msgstr "Нет смысла стоять тут и ждать, пока он снова вырастет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.REFINED_DUST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.REFINED_DUST"
msgid "It's likely to crumble away at any moment."
msgstr "Кажется, она в любой момент готова рассыпаться."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.REFLECTIVEVEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.REFLECTIVEVEST"
msgid "I don't know if I want to be so easy to spot..."
msgstr "Даже не знаю, хочу ли я быть такой заметной..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RELIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RELIC"
msgid "People back then weren't all that different from us."
msgstr "Наши далекие предки немногим отличались от нас."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.BURNT"
msgid "I was too late to save it."
msgstr "Я не успела ее спасти."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.GENERIC"
msgid "I really want to know what makes it tick..."
msgstr "Очень хочется узнать, что же там внутри..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.BURNT"
msgid "Oh drat."
msgstr "Вот проклятье."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.GENERIC"
msgid "It turns out that science is a lot easier than I thought!"
msgstr "Оказывается, наука куда проще, чем я думала!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.BURNT"
msgid "I'll have to be more careful next time."
msgstr "В следующий раз нужно быть осторожнее."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.GENERIC"
msgid "Shadow magic's just a tool, like anything else."
msgstr "Темная магия — самый обычный инструмент."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.BURNT"
msgid "Now I'll have to spend time making another one..."
msgstr "Теперь придется тратить время и делать все заново..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.GENERIC"
msgid "If it works, it works."
msgstr "Работает — вот и пусть работает."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RESKIN_TOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RESKIN_TOOL"
msgid "It reveals the various possibilities across timelines."
msgstr "Он открывает возможности из других линий времени."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.BURNT"
msgid "I'm trying not to take that as a bad omen."
msgstr "Постараюсь не толковать это как дурной знак."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm all for taking precautions, but does it have to look like that?"
msgstr "Запасной план никогда не помешает, но обязательно ему выглядеть так?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTONE"
msgid "Hopefully I'll never have to use it."
msgstr "Надеюсь, мне не придется его использовать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.REVIVER"
msgid "A bit of insurance, in the unlikely event my own powers aren't enough."
msgstr "Небольшая подстраховка на тот маловероятный случай, если я не справлюсь сама."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RHINODRILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RHINODRILL"
msgid "He's got a nose for this kind of work."
msgstr "У него на такие делишки нюх."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROASTTURKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROASTTURKEY"
msgid "What an enormous turkey leg!"
msgstr "Какая здоровенная ножка индейки!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.GENERIC"
msgid "Some kind of red bird."
msgstr "Какая-то красная птица."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.HELD"
msgid "Well, it's in my pocket. Now what?"
msgstr "Итак, я положила ее в карман. И что теперь?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.GENERIC"
msgid "Some kind of blueish white bird."
msgstr "Какая-то синевато-белая птица."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.HELD"
msgid "Don't peck on my pocket watches while you're in there!"
msgstr "Смотри не лезь клювом в мои карманные часы, слышишь?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "I might need a screwdriver instead of a sewing needle."
msgstr "Тут скорее понадобится отвертка, чем иголка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_PUPPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_PUPPET"
msgid "They're trapped!"
msgstr "Они в ловушке!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK"
msgid "Ooooh a boulder, how unexpected."
msgstr "О-о-о, валун. Как неожиданно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCKS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCKS"
msgid "A handful of stones, absolutely thrilling!"
msgstr "Кучка камней — с ума сойти!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCKY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCKY"
msgid "You keep those claws far away from me!"
msgstr "Только тронь меня своими клешнями!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.BARREN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.BARREN"
msgid "I think it's well past its prime."
msgstr "Думаю, его лучшие дни уже позади."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.BURNING"
msgid "Oh botheration, I needed that!"
msgstr "Вот неудобство-то, он был мне нужен!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.DISEASED"
msgid "It looks pretty sick."
msgstr "На вид кажется больным."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.DISEASING"
msgid "Err, something's not right."
msgstr "Э-э-э, что-то пошло не так."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.GENERIC"
msgid "I've seen a lot of strange things in my time. This is one of them."
msgstr "Я повидала немало диковин, и это одна из них."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.PICKED"
msgid "I'll come back later when there's fruit to pick."
msgstr "Я вернусь позже, когда появятся плоды."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.WITHERED"
msgid "I can't expect it to make fruit in this heat."
msgstr "Он едва ли начнет плодоносить в такую жару."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT"
msgid "That looks like a quick way to chip a tooth."
msgstr "Так можно в два счета сломать себе зуб."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_RIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_RIPE"
msgid "After all that waiting, it's finally somewhat edible."
msgstr "Он стал чуточку съедобным — не прошло и года!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_RIPE_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_RIPE_COOKED"
msgid "I don't know if it was worth the time to cook it."
msgstr "Даже не знаю, стоило ли тратить время на готовку."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_SPROUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_SPROUT"
msgid "There's a new little life forming."
msgstr "Так зарождается новая маленькая жизнь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.GENERIC"
msgid "A frozen chunk of future water."
msgstr "Застывший кусок воды из будущего."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.MELTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.MELTED"
msgid "A puddle of potential ice."
msgstr "Лужица потенциального льда."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE_MELTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE_MELTED"
msgid "A puddle of potential ice."
msgstr "Лужица потенциального льда."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.GENERIC"
msgid "A crusted over lava pit."
msgstr "Все покрылось каменной коркой."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.LOW"
msgid "The lava's crusting over."
msgstr "Лавовый оползень закончился."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.NORMAL"
msgid "Nice and comfy."
msgstr "Здорово и уютно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.OUT"
msgid "Looks fragile."
msgstr "Выглядит хрупким."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_MOON"
msgid "I never would have predicted I'd see a piece of the moon up close."
msgstr "Никогда бы не подумала, что однажды увижу вблизи кусочек луны."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE"
msgid "Frozen in time."
msgstr "Застыло во времени."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE_OLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE_OLD"
msgid "Frozen in time."
msgstr "Застыло во времени."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROOK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROOK"
msgid "I'm not convinced that's proper clockwork."
msgstr "Сомневаюсь, что это настоящий часовой механизм."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROOK_NIGHTMARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROOK_NIGHTMARE"
msgid "How is it still going?"
msgstr "Когда же у него кончится завод?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROPE"
msgid "I'm sure I'll find some use for it sooner or later."
msgstr "Уверена, что рано или поздно она мне пригодится."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROPE_BRIDGE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROPE_BRIDGE_KIT"
msgid "Looks rather shoddy but it beats taking the long way around."
msgstr "Выглядит ненадежно, но все лучше, чем кружным путем."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROSEGLASSESHAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROSEGLASSESHAT.GENERIC"
msgid "More roses... there's been quite a few popping up lately."
msgstr "Снова розы... Частенько их вижу в последнее время."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROSEGLASSESHAT.MISSINGSKILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROSEGLASSESHAT.MISSINGSKILL"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROTTENEGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROTTENEGG"
msgid "It must've been the last one out."
msgstr "Думаю, его снесли последним."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROYAL_JELLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.ROYAL_JELLY"
msgid "Victory is sweet."
msgstr "Сладкий вкус победы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RUBBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RUBBLE"
msgid "Time has broken it down."
msgstr "Время его покалечило."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RUINSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RUINSHAT"
msgid "I'm never taking it off!"
msgstr "Никогда ее больше не сниму!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RUINS_BAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RUINS_BAT"
msgid "It's a bit unwieldy, don't you think?"
msgstr "Какая-то она громоздкая, да?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RUINS_RUBBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RUINS_RUBBLE"
msgid "Whatever it was has been lost to time."
msgstr "Что бы здесь ни было, все давно поглотило время."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "An ancient puzzle! How exciting!"
msgstr "Древняя головоломка! Как увлекательно!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.LOCKED"
msgid "You won't stay locked for long."
msgstr "Надолго ты запертым не останешься."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SADDLEHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SADDLEHORN"
msgid "I'll finally be able to take the saddle off that poor beast!"
msgstr "Наконец-то я смогу снять седло с бедного зверя!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_BASIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_BASIC"
msgid "I've got a saddle, now I just need an animal to ride..."
msgstr "Седло у меня есть — осталось найти, на ком ездить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_RACE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_RACE"
msgid "This should help my beefalo pick up the pace."
msgstr "Теперь-то мой бифало точно начнет шевелить копытами."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_SHADOW"
msgid "If one must sit, they might as well be moving."
msgstr "Сидишь и двигаешься одновременно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WAR"
msgid "Very imposing."
msgstr "Очень впечатляюще."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WATHGRITHR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WATHGRITHR"
msgid "It certainly makes an impression."
msgstr "Оставляет неизгладимое впечатление."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SALSA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SALSA"
msgid "I guess I could spare some time for a quick snack..."
msgstr "Думаю, я найду минутку-другую на перекус..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SALTBOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SALTBOX"
msgid "Some good old-fashioned food storage."
msgstr "Старомодное и надежное хранилище для еды."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK"
msgid "Imagine getting so distracted by a chunk of salt."
msgstr "Кому-то для полного счастья хватает вот такого куска соли."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK_IMPROVED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK_IMPROVED"
msgid "Whatever keeps the beefalo busy."
msgstr "Наконец-то бифало будет чем заняться."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SALTROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SALTROCK"
msgid "A bit of salt on my meals might be nice."
msgstr "Соль не помешает ни одному моему блюду."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GENERIC"
msgid "It's just salt! N-nothing to be bothered over."
msgstr "Это просто соль! Н-нечего волноваться."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GROWING"
msgid "Oh goody, it's growing back."
msgstr "Оюшки, оно отрастает обратно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.MINED_OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.MINED_OUT"
msgid "I feel a bit better now."
msgstr "Теперь на душе чуть спокойнее."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SANDBLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SANDBLOCK"
msgid "The sands of time are so fickle!"
msgstr "Пески времени так переменчивы!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SANDSPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SANDSPIKE"
msgid "I won't have my time cut short by the likes of you!"
msgstr "Не надейся, мой последний час еще не пробил!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.ACTIVE"
msgid "What? I could have sworn it was shorter..."
msgstr "Как? Клянусь, раньше он был меньше ростом..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.INACTIVE"
msgid "Hmm. I remembered it being taller..."
msgstr "Хм-м. А раньше он казался повыше."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.BURNING"
msgid "That's not good..."
msgstr "Это нехорошо..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASED"
msgid "It looks pretty sick."
msgstr "На вид кажется больным."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASING"
msgid "Err, something's not right."
msgstr "Э-э-э, что-то пошло не так."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "For some reason, these ones don't seem to grow any bigger."
msgstr "Они отчего-то так и не становятся больше."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.PICKED"
msgid "Now begins the painfully slow process of growing back."
msgstr "А теперь им придется долго и мучительно вырастать снова."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.WITHERED"
msgid "It won't survive long in this heat."
msgstr "Долго на такой жаре он не простоит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCANDATA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCANDATA"
msgid "It's of no use to me, I won't waste time reading it."
msgstr "Мне это ни к чему. Не собираюсь тратить свое время на то, чтобы в этом разобраться."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNING"
msgid "This might end up being an improvement."
msgstr "Думаю, так стало только лучше."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNT"
msgid "I take back what I said, it's much worse this way."
msgstr "Беру свои слова обратно: стало гораздо хуже."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.GENERIC"
msgid "I think our definition of \"friendly\" differs somewhat."
msgstr "Думаю, под словом «дружелюбное» мы понимаем разные вещи."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCORCHED_SKELETON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCORCHED_SKELETON"
msgid "Their life was snuffed out long ago."
msgstr "Их жизнь давным-давно угасла."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCRAPBOOK_PAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCRAPBOOK_PAGE"
msgid "Did I leave this here?"
msgstr "Это я здесь оставила?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCRAPHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCRAPHAT"
msgid "I like it much better as a hat."
msgstr "Ну вот, отличная получилась шляпа."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCRAP_MONOCLEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCRAP_MONOCLEHAT"
msgid "It never hurts to view things from a wider angle."
msgstr "Иногда полезно посмотреть на вещи под более широким углом."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BLOCK"
msgid "Chipping away at stone is not my idea of a good time."
msgstr "Кому-то обтесывать камни нравится, но точно не мне."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BURNT"
msgid "Well, time to move on."
msgstr "Что ж, пора идти дальше."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.EMPTY"
msgid "I've got more pressing things to do than arts and crafts."
msgstr "У меня слишком мало времени, чтобы заниматься прикладным искусством."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.SCULPTURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.SCULPTURE"
msgid "I don't even want to think about how much time was spent making it."
msgstr "Не хочу даже думать о том, сколько на это ушло времени."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.COVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.COVERED"
msgid "Strange... I don't think it's as old as it looks."
msgstr "Странно... По-моему, она не такая старая, как кажется."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.FINISHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.FINISHED"
msgid "I can't believe I spent so much time on reuniting a couple pieces of marble."
msgstr "Поверить не могу, что столько времени пыталась соединить два куска мрамора."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.READY"
msgid "Did you hear that? It's like there's something scratching inside..."
msgstr "Слышите? Внутри будто кто-то скребется..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.UNCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.UNCOVERED"
msgid "Either the sculptor forgot something, or a piece has been removed."
msgstr "Либо скульптор о чем-то позабыл, либо часть статуи отломили."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPHEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPHEAD"
msgid "What is this doing way out here?"
msgstr "Что это она тут делает?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.COVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.COVERED"
msgid "I can't quite tell what it's supposed to be."
msgstr "Я даже и не пойму, что это такое."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.FINISHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.FINISHED"
msgid "Why did I spend so much time on this?"
msgstr "Ну и зачем я потратила на это столько времени?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.READY"
msgid "Did you hear that? It's like there's something scratching inside..."
msgstr "Слышите? Внутри будто кто-то скребется..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.UNCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.UNCOVERED"
msgid "It's a little better, but there's something missing..."
msgstr "Уже лучше, но чего-то по-прежнему не хватает..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTHEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTHEAD"
msgid "Strange..."
msgstr "Странно..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.COVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.COVERED"
msgid "I'm not sure what to make of it."
msgstr "Даже и не знаю, что с этим делать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.FINISHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.FINISHED"
msgid "It took me ages to put you together, at least look pleased about it!"
msgstr "Я тебя сто лет собирала — имей совесть этому порадоваться!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.READY"
msgid "Did you hear that? It's like there's something scratching inside..."
msgstr "Слышите? Внутри будто кто-то скребется..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.UNCOVERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.UNCOVERED"
msgid "It still doesn't look right."
msgstr "По-прежнему выглядит как-то не так."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKNOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKNOSE"
msgid "Where did this come from?"
msgstr "Откуда это взялось?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.BURNT"
msgid "Oh botheration, now I have to build another one!"
msgstr "Вот неудобство, теперь придется собирать новый!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.GENERIC"
msgid "The ocean is so much more finicky to navigate than the time stream."
msgstr "Ориентироваться в открытом море куда сложнее, чем в потоках времени."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SEAFOODGUMBO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SEAFOODGUMBO"
msgid "Again... is leaving the bones in really necessary?"
msgstr "Опять... Неужели обязательно готовить прямо с костями?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SEASTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SEASTACK"
msgid "Don't you dare hit my boat!"
msgstr "Только попробуй врезаться в мою лодку!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE"
msgid "It's empty."
msgstr "Он пуст."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE_FULL"
msgid "Well, it's caught something. Now what?"
msgstr "Так, эта штука что-то поймала. Что дальше?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SEEDPOUCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SEEDPOUCH"
msgid "Extra pocket space is always welcome."
msgstr "Лишний карман никогда не помешает."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SEEDS"
msgid "Future plants, or a present snack."
msgstr "В будущем это растения, а в эту минуту — закуска."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SEEDS_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SEEDS_COOKED"
msgid "I don't know why I bothered cooking them."
msgstr "Даже не знаю, зачем я их готовила."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SENTRYWARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SENTRYWARD"
msgid "Good, this will help me get the lay of the land quicker."
msgstr "Отлично, теперь я смогу быстрее разведать окрестности."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SEWING_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SEWING_KIT"
msgid "Who has patience for sewing?"
msgstr "Ну кому хватает терпения шить?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SEWING_MANNEQUIN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SEWING_MANNEQUIN.BURNT"
msgid "Time waits for no mannequin."
msgstr "Время беспощадно даже к манекенам."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SEWING_MANNEQUIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SEWING_MANNEQUIN.GENERIC"
msgid "I can't imagine being stuck in one place! Wait..."
msgstr "Не представляю, каково это — застрять на месте. Погодите-ка..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SEWING_TAPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SEWING_TAPE"
msgid "Now this is the way to mend clothes, no fussing with needles and thread!"
msgstr "Вот так и нужно латать одежду — без возни с иголками и нитками!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDANCER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDANCER"
msgid "That's a sight I won't soon forget."
msgstr "Такое не скоро забудешь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDIGGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDIGGER"
msgid "Those things make me nervous..."
msgstr "Что-то мне от них не по себе..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHADOWHEART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHADOWHEART"
msgid "It's still beating..."
msgstr "Оно все еще бьется..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHADOWRIFT_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHADOWRIFT_PORTAL"
msgid "This isn't good..."
msgstr "Это нехорошо..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_HANDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_HANDS"
msgid "Try all you might, you'll never catch me!"
msgstr "Делай что хочешь, тебе меня не поймать!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_HORNS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_HORNS"
msgid "I will not be your dinner!"
msgstr "Я твоим ужином не стану!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_MOUTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_MOUTH"
msgid "It's far too happy!"
msgstr "Больно он довольный!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_PARASITE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_PARASITE"
msgid "Wondered when you'd be showing up."
msgstr "Явилась — не запылилась."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_WINGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_WINGS"
msgid "Shoo! Shoo!!"
msgstr "А ну кыш отсюда!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_BATTLEAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_BATTLEAXE"
msgid "That will fell a tree in no time."
msgstr "Срубит дерево за пару секунд."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_BEEF_BELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_BEEF_BELL"
msgid "A way to reset the clock for my beefalo!"
msgstr "Он вновь заведет часы моего бифало!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_FORGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_FORGE"
msgid "Quite a nice change of pace to have shadows working for me."
msgstr "Для разнообразия я могу использовать тени себе во благо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_FORGE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_FORGE_KIT"
msgid "I'll have it up and running in just a tick."
msgstr "Все будет готово в одну секунду."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHALLOW_GRAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHALLOW_GRAVE"
msgid "Must have been in a hurry."
msgstr "Видимо, в спешке хоронили."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHARK"
msgid "Ah, I almost forgot. Another reason to stay away from the ocean!"
msgstr "Ах да, чуть не забыла. Еще одна причина не соваться в океан!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHARKBOI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHARKBOI"
msgid "A brute if I've ever seen one!"
msgstr "Грубая сила, да и только!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHELL_CLUSTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHELL_CLUSTER"
msgid "Now, what do we have here?"
msgstr "Что это у нас тут такое?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHIELDOFTERROR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHIELDOFTERROR"
msgid "Oh, how alarming... but I'm not one to look a gift shield in the mouth."
msgstr "Крайне подозрительно... Но дареному щиту в зубы не смотрят."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL"
msgid "My clocksmith hands weren't made for this kind of work..."
msgstr "Мои руки часовщика не созданы для такой работы..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL_LUNARPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL_LUNARPLANT"
msgid "An odd, yet extremely efficient design."
msgstr "Странный, но чрезвычайно эффективный дизайн."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHROOMBAIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHROOMBAIT"
msgid "Who or what would want to eat that?"
msgstr "Кто... или что захочет такое съесть?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHROOMCAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHROOMCAKE"
msgid "If it's a cake it can't be too terrible... right?"
msgstr "Торт не может быть скверным по определению... так ведь?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHROOM_SKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHROOM_SKIN"
msgid "That creature must've been half decayed. How horrible!"
msgstr "Да это чудовище наполовину сгнило. Какой ужас!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.BURNT"
msgid "It won't do me much good now."
msgstr "Теперь от него никакой пользы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.GENERIC"
msgid "I could stand to spend a moment or two out of the heat."
msgstr "Было бы неплохо укрыться от солнца на пару минут."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SILK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SILK"
msgid "It's surprisingly durable."
msgstr "На удивление прочный материал."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE3.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE3.GENERIC"
msgid "I love a good knickknack, and a musical one at that!"
msgstr "Люблю славные безделицы, а особенно музыкальные!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE4.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE4.GENERIC"
msgid "I think that would fit nicely in my pocket."
msgstr "Думаю, ей самое место в моем кармане."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE5.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE5.GENERIC"
msgid "What a nice little shell! I wish I had somewhere to display it."
msgstr "Какая славная ракушечка! Было бы здорово куда-нибудь ее поставить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.GENERIC"
msgid "Death should be the farthest thing from a child's mind..."
msgstr "Смерть — последнее, о чем должен думать ребенок..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS"
msgid "I hope she finds some comfort in this."
msgstr "Надеюсь, она сумеет обрести покой."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS_BLOSSOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS_BLOSSOM"
msgid "I don't want to know what's making that noise."
msgstr "Даже знать не хочу, что издает этот звук."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS_EVIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS_EVIL"
msgid "Ugh, my head!"
msgstr "Ох, моя голова!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.SOME_FLOWERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.SOME_FLOWERS"
msgid "Well... I guess it wouldn't take too long to gather a few flowers."
msgstr "Что ж... Думаю, я сумею собрать букет всего за несколько минут."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SKELETON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SKELETON"
msgid "This one's beyond my power to save..."
msgstr "Его не спасти даже мне..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SKELETONHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SKELETONHAT"
msgid "I don't want to put a dead thing on my head!"
msgstr "Еще чего, надевать на голову эту мертвечину!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_NOTPLAYER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_NOTPLAYER"
msgid "These old bones should remind us not to tarry."
msgstr "Промедление смерти подобно — вот о чем напоминают нам старые кости."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.DEFAULT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.DEFAULT"
msgid "%s! You're not going out like this, not on my watch!"
msgstr "%s! Я не позволю этому случиться — твой час еще не пробил!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.FEMALE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.FEMALE"
msgid "%s! You're not going out like this, not on my watch!"
msgstr "%s! Я не позволю этому случиться — твой час еще не пробил!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.MALE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.MALE"
msgid "%s! There might still be time to bring him back!"
msgstr "%s! Еще есть время вернуть его к жизни!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.ROBOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.ROBOT"
msgid "%s! There might still be time to bring them back!"
msgstr "%s! Еще есть время вернуть тебя к жизни!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SKETCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SKETCH"
msgid "An art project? Do I really have time for that?"
msgstr "А у меня точно есть время заниматься искусством?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SKULLCHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SKULLCHEST"
msgid "I'm not sure if I want to open it."
msgstr "Сомневаюсь, что хочу его открыть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLEEPBOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLEEPBOMB"
msgid "Who would want to spend precious time napping?"
msgstr "Кто захочет тратить драгоценное время на сон?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT.GENERIC"
msgid "I think that young man might be more mischievous than he appears."
msgstr "Думаю, этот юноша куда более шаловливый, чем кажется на первый взгляд."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_CONTAINER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_CONTAINER"
msgid "Stockpiling for the future. Good boy!"
msgstr "Припас на будущее. Молодчина!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_DREADSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_DREADSTONE"
msgid "These obviously weren't made with precision in mind."
msgstr "Ни о какой точности тут никто и не думал."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_FREEZE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_FREEZE"
msgid "These obviously weren't made with precision in mind."
msgstr "Ни о какой точности тут никто и не думал."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_GELBLOB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_GELBLOB"
msgid "These obviously weren't made with precision in mind."
msgstr "Ни о какой точности тут никто и не думал."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_GOLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_GOLD"
msgid "These obviously weren't made with precision in mind."
msgstr "Ни о какой точности тут никто и не думал."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_GUNPOWDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_GUNPOWDER"
msgid "These obviously weren't made with precision in mind."
msgstr "Ни о какой точности тут никто и не думал."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_HONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_HONEY"
msgid "These obviously weren't made with precision in mind."
msgstr "Ни о какой точности тут никто и не думал."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_HORRORFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_HORRORFUEL"
msgid "These obviously weren't made with precision in mind."
msgstr "Ни о какой точности тут никто и не думал."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_LUNARPLANTHUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_LUNARPLANTHUSK"
msgid "These obviously weren't made with precision in mind."
msgstr "Ни о какой точности тут никто и не думал."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_MARBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_MARBLE"
msgid "These obviously weren't made with precision in mind."
msgstr "Ни о какой точности тут никто и не думал."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_MOONGLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_MOONGLASS"
msgid "These obviously weren't made with precision in mind."
msgstr "Ни о какой точности тут никто и не думал."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_POOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_POOP"
msgid "It seems sensible enough to me, if a bit unpleasant."
msgstr "По-моему, здравое решение, пусть и не самое приятное."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_PUREBRILLIANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_PUREBRILLIANCE"
msgid "These obviously weren't made with precision in mind."
msgstr "Ни о какой точности тут никто и не думал."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ROCK"
msgid "These obviously weren't made with precision in mind."
msgstr "Ни о какой точности тут никто и не думал."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SCRAPFEATHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SCRAPFEATHER"
msgid "These obviously weren't made with precision in mind."
msgstr "Ни о какой точности тут никто и не думал."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SLOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SLOW"
msgid "Tampering with the timestream, are we? Good lad."
msgstr "Так-так, манипулируем потоком времени? Молодец!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_STINGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_STINGER"
msgid "These obviously weren't made with precision in mind."
msgstr "Ни о какой точности тут никто и не думал."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_THULECITE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_THULECITE"
msgid "These obviously weren't made with precision in mind."
msgstr "Ни о какой точности тут никто и не думал."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTMODKIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTMODKIT"
msgid "Rather innovative for a child."
msgstr "Изобретательно для ребенка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_BAND_MIMIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_BAND_MIMIC"
msgid "Rather innovative for a child."
msgstr "Изобретательно для ребенка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_BAND_PIGSKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_BAND_PIGSKIN"
msgid "Rather innovative for a child."
msgstr "Изобретательно для ребенка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_BAND_TENTACLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_BAND_TENTACLE"
msgid "Rather innovative for a child."
msgstr "Изобретательно для ребенка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_BONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_BONE"
msgid "Rather innovative for a child."
msgstr "Изобретательно для ребенка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_GEMS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_GEMS"
msgid "Rather innovative for a child."
msgstr "Изобретательно для ребенка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_WAGPUNK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_WAGPUNK"
msgid "Rather innovative for a child."
msgstr "Изобретательно для ребенка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_WAGPUNK_0
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_WAGPUNK_0"
msgid "Rather innovative for a child."
msgstr "Изобретательно для ребенка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_JELLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_JELLY"
msgid "Rather innovative for a child."
msgstr "Изобретательно для ребенка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_SILK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_SILK"
msgid "Rather innovative for a child."
msgstr "Изобретательно для ребенка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_STICKY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_STICKY"
msgid "Rather innovative for a child."
msgstr "Изобретательно для ребенка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_VOIDCLOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_VOIDCLOTH"
msgid "Rather innovative for a child."
msgstr "Изобретательно для ребенка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLURPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLURPER"
msgid "I can't decide how I feel about them..."
msgstr "Я еще не решила, как к ним относиться..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLURPERPELT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLURPERPELT"
msgid "Yuck."
msgstr "Фи."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLURPER_PELT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLURPER_PELT"
msgid "Yuck."
msgstr "Фи."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE"
msgid "How do they stand being so slow?"
msgstr "Ну как можно быть такими медленными?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHAT"
msgid "As long as it protects me, I don't care what it looks like."
msgstr "Не так важно, как шлем выглядит, — важно, как он защищает."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHOLE"
msgid "Strange. Anyway, moving on..."
msgstr "Как странно. Что ж, идем дальше..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLURTLESLIME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLURTLESLIME"
msgid "Oh botheration, I think I got some on the bottom of my shoe..."
msgstr "Вот неудобство, к подошве что-то прилипло..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE_SHELLPIECES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE_SHELLPIECES"
msgid "A handful of shattered shell bits."
msgstr "Это кусочки разбитого панциря."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.GENERIC"
msgid "That's no spring chicken."
msgstr "На цыпленка ты не тянешь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.HUNGRY"
msgid "What is it? Do you need to be fed again already?"
msgstr "Что такое? Тебя что, снова пора кормить?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.SLEEPING"
msgid "Thank goodness. I can finally do things uninterrupted."
msgstr "Ну наконец-то меня никто не будет отвлекать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.STARVING"
msgid "Oh no, I forgot to feed you again didn't I?"
msgstr "О нет, я снова забыла тебя покормить?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SMALLGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SMALLGHOST"
msgid "The poor little thing. It's too late for me to help them."
msgstr "Несчастное создание. Я уже не смогу тебе помочь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT"
msgid "A little meat is better than none."
msgstr "Небольшой кусочек мяса лучше, чем ничего."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT_DRIED"
msgid "A bite of tough, dry meat."
msgstr "Кусочек жесткого засохшего мяса."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SNAPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SNAPPER"
msgid "This one's got bite."
msgstr "Вот уж укус так укус!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SNOWBALL_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SNOWBALL_ITEM"
msgid "There's always time for a snowball fight."
msgstr "На битву снежками время всегда найдется."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SNOWMAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SNOWMAN.GENERIC"
msgid "Child's play. Not bad, though."
msgstr "Детская забава. Но забавная."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SNOWMAN.SNOWBALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SNOWMAN.SNOWBALL"
msgid "Must admit I have a few ideas for this one."
msgstr "Признаюсь, воображению тут пока не разгуляться."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SNURTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SNURTLE"
msgid "It's just as slow as the other kind."
msgstr "Такая же медленная, как ее сородичи."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.GENERIC"
msgid "Hopefully this won't take too long."
msgstr "Надеюсь, я управлюсь за пару минут."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.SPOILED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.SPOILED"
msgid "That's good enough, isn't it?"
msgstr "Вроде нормально, да?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.STALE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.STALE"
msgid "This is taking an eternity!"
msgstr "У меня целая вечность на это уйдет!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER_FERMENTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER_FERMENTED"
msgid "I think it's finally done."
msgstr "Похоже, все наконец-то готово."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPAT"
msgid "He's a tough old thing."
msgstr "Это крепкий орешек."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPEAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPEAR"
msgid "Don't think I won't use it if I have to!"
msgstr "Я не побоюсь им воспользоваться!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_GUNGNIR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_GUNGNIR"
msgid "I could do a quick charge with that."
msgstr "То, что надо для быстрой атаки!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_LANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_LANCE"
msgid "It gets to the point."
msgstr "В самую точку!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR"
msgid "...I should try to stay on her good side."
msgstr "...Думаю, с ней лучше не ссориться."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR_LIGHTNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR_LIGHTNING"
msgid "I do hope I'm still on her good side..."
msgstr "Надеюсь, она все еще хорошо ко мне относится..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPICEPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPICEPACK"
msgid "I wonder if it makes time slow down, or if it's just well insulated."
msgstr "Интересно, она замедляет время или просто хорошо изолирована?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPICE_CHILI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPICE_CHILI"
msgid "Best used in minute amounts."
msgstr "Главное — не переборщить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPICE_GARLIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPICE_GARLIC"
msgid "Oh, that smell takes me back."
msgstr "Ох, этот запах навевает воспоминания."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SALT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SALT"
msgid "I'll just toss a pinch over my shoulder for good luck."
msgstr "Брошу-ка щепотку через плечо — на удачу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SUGAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SUGAR"
msgid "Delightfully sweet."
msgstr "Восхитительно сладко."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.DEAD"
msgid "I like them better this way."
msgstr "Так мне они больше нравятся."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.GENERIC"
msgid "Why don't you just run along? Go do spider things."
msgstr "Может, побежишь дальше по своим паучьим делам?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.SLEEPING"
msgid "At least it's not causing any trouble."
msgstr "По крайней мере, он не бедокурит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN"
msgid "I'm not in any hurry to tangle with spiders."
msgstr "Я не намерена влипать в паучьи неприятности."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN_BEDAZZLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN_BEDAZZLER"
msgid "He's certainly got a creative streak, doesn't he?"
msgstr "А у него есть творческий талант, не правда ли?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDEREGGSACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDEREGGSACK"
msgid "I should squish them now, it'll save me the hassle later on..."
msgstr "Надо бы раздавить их прямо сейчас, чтобы потом не возиться..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERGLAND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERGLAND"
msgid "That spider left me a thoughtful parting gift."
msgstr "Паук оставил мне на прощание полезный подарок."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHAT"
msgid "A lovely reminder of that time I was almost eaten by a giant spider."
msgstr "Славное напоминание о том дне, когда меня чуть не сожрал гигантский паук."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE"
msgid "I can hear them skittering inside..."
msgstr "Слышу, как они там шебуршатся..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE_ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE_ROCK"
msgid "I can hear them skittering inside..."
msgstr "Слышу, как они там шебуршатся..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEEN"
msgid "Just whose idea was it to make the spiders here so big?! I'd like to have a word."
msgstr "Сказала бы я пару ласковых тому, кто сделал местных пауков такими здоровыми!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_DROPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_DROPPER"
msgid "You think you can get the drop on me?"
msgstr "Думаешь, меня можно застать врасплох?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER"
msgid "They have terrible bedside manner."
msgstr "Они безобразно ведут себя с больными."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER_ITEM"
msgid "I'm afraid that won't do me any good."
msgstr "Боюсь, это ничем мне не поможет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HIDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HIDER"
msgid "Why don't you just skitter around the other way?"
msgstr "А не уковылять ли тебе восвояси?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.DEAD"
msgid "That's the end of that."
msgstr "Это конец."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.GENERIC"
msgid "I don't think that spider was assembled properly."
msgstr "Кажется, этого паука собрали не по инструкции."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.SLEEPING"
msgid "It's still, for the time being."
msgstr "Прямо сейчас он не шевелится."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_REPELLENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_REPELLENT"
msgid "I wish he used it more often."
msgstr "Почаще бы он ей пользовался."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_SPITTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_SPITTER"
msgid "Leave me alone!"
msgstr "Оставь меня в покое!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.DEAD"
msgid "I chose my survival over his."
msgstr "Моя жизнь мне важнее, чем его."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.GENERIC"
msgid "Oh botheration, I hate the stripy ones."
msgstr "Вот неудобство, терпеть не могу полосатых."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.SLEEPING"
msgid "At least it's not causing any trouble."
msgstr "По крайней мере, он не бедокурит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WATER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WATER"
msgid "Shoo! Why can't you just stay in your tree?"
msgstr "Брысь отсюда! Чем тебя твое дерево не устраивает?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WHISTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WHISTLE"
msgid "Oh, is he throwing a little spider party?"
msgstr "Как интересно, это он так зовет друзей на вечеринку?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FISH"
msgid "Oooh that's rotten!"
msgstr "О-о-ой, она протухла!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FOOD"
msgid "Food that once was."
msgstr "Когда-то это было едой."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.GENERIC"
msgid "At least they brighten things up a bit."
msgstr "Что ж, так здесь хотя бы светлее."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.HELD"
msgid "I hope it doesn't start growing in there."
msgstr "Надеюсь, они не прорастут у меня в кармане."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MOON"
msgid "Careful now..."
msgstr "Осторожно..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.GENERIC"
msgid "Float along now."
msgstr "Улетай восвояси."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.HELD"
msgid "I hope it doesn't start growing in there."
msgstr "Надеюсь, они не прорастут у меня в кармане."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.GENERIC"
msgid "They're looking for a place to latch onto."
msgstr "Ищут, к чему бы им прилипнуть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.HELD"
msgid "I hope it doesn't start growing in there."
msgstr "Надеюсь, они не прорастут у меня в кармане."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SQUID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SQUID"
msgid "Could you light the way without being a nuisance, please?!"
msgstr "А можно просто освещать путь и не путаться под ногами?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STAFFCOLDLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STAFFCOLDLIGHT"
msgid "If it keeps me from dying of heat exposure, I'm happy."
msgstr "Лишь бы он помог мне не умереть от жары."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STAFFLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STAFFLIGHT"
msgid "A tiny star, what could go wrong?"
msgstr "Ну что может быть опасного в маленькой звездочке?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STAFF_LUNARPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STAFF_LUNARPLANT"
msgid "I prefer keeping everything at a distance."
msgstr "Я предпочитаю держать всех на расстоянии."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STAFF_TORNADO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STAFF_TORNADO"
msgid "Oh botheration, I thought it was a compass."
msgstr "Вот неудобство! А я-то думала, это компас."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.AWAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.AWAKE"
msgid "You'll never catch me! I've outsmarted you and your ilk at every turn!"
msgstr "Тебе меня не сцапать! Я таких, как ты, в два счета перехитрю!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.HIDING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.HIDING"
msgid "I know you're hiding in there."
msgstr "Я знаю, что ты там прячешься."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.SITTING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.SITTING"
msgid "I know you're hiding in there."
msgstr "Я знаю, что ты там прячешься."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.STANDING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.STANDING"
msgid "You'll never catch me! I've outsmarted you and your ilk at every turn!"
msgstr "Тебе меня не сцапать! Я таких, как ты, в два счета перехитрю!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE"
msgid "You've seen one rock, you've seen them all."
msgstr "Видел один камень — считай, видел их все."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL"
msgid "Wow, amazing. Let's keep moving shall we?"
msgstr "О-о, потрясающе. Ну что, идем дальше?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STALKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STALKER"
msgid "This was a bad idea. I have regrets."
msgstr "Это была скверная идея. И я о ней жалею."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STALKER_ATRIUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STALKER_ATRIUM"
msgid "This was a VERY bad idea."
msgstr "Это была ОЧЕНЬ скверная идея."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STALKER_MINION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STALKER_MINION"
msgid "Ack! Get out of here!"
msgstr "Фу! Прочь отсюда!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STASH_MAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STASH_MAP"
msgid "It looks like I'm not the only one who forgets where I put things."
msgstr "Кажется, не только я все время забываю, куда вещи кладу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.EMPTY"
msgid "It seemed like a good idea at the time."
msgstr "В тот момент это казалось мне хорошей идеей."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.GENERIC"
msgid "I still haven't figured out who made this..."
msgstr "Я так и не разузнала, кто это сделал..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP"
msgid "It's curious how they all seem to be broken in the same spot..."
msgstr "Любопытно, что все они сломались в одном и том же месте..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP_HEDGESPAWNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP_HEDGESPAWNER"
msgid "There's just something about it..."
msgstr "Что-то меня настораживает..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STATUEMAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STATUEMAXWELL"
msgid "\"Someone\" had far too much time on his hands..."
msgstr "Кое у кого было слишком много свободного времени..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.GENERIC"
msgid "I can gawk at them later, they're not going anywhere."
msgstr "Потом поглазею, никуда они не денутся."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE1"
msgid "I don't have much patience for art."
msgstr "Не могу назвать себя ценителем искусства."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE2"
msgid "I've seen it before and I'll probably see it again."
msgstr "Я это уже видела и наверняка увижу еще."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE3"
msgid "I'm still not sure who left these here."
msgstr "Все еще не знаю, кто их здесь расставил."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL"
msgid "Some things are taken very literally around here."
msgstr "Некоторые вещи здесь воспринимают очень буквально."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL"
msgid "My poor hands are going to get callouses from all this sea-faring."
msgstr "От этого мореплавания на моих бедных ручках одни мозоли."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM"
msgid "I hope I don't forget to add that to the boat."
msgstr "Надеюсь, не забуду прикрепить его к лодке."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STINGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STINGER"
msgid "A bee sting that almost was."
msgstr "Мне не жалко, что это жалко не во мне."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.GENERIC"
msgid "I believe in my time, we called that a chair."
msgstr "В мое время такие штуки назывались стульями."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.OCCUPIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.OCCUPIED"
msgid "It is occupied."
msgstr "Здесь занято."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.GENERIC"
msgid "A table. Will wonders never cease."
msgstr "Ну надо же, стол. Не перестаю удивляться."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.HAS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.HAS_ITEM"
msgid "Yes, there is something on it."
msgstr "На этом столе даже что-то лежит. Фантастика."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.BROKEN"
msgid "Maybe its time had come."
msgstr "Видимо, его время подошло к концу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.GENERIC"
msgid "It certainly saves time."
msgstr "Что ж, это очень экономит время."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STRAWHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STRAWHAT"
msgid "I could dress up like a farmer, how fun!"
msgstr "Можно нарядиться фермершей — вот это веселье!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STUFFEDEGGPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STUFFEDEGGPLANT"
msgid "Vegetables inside and out."
msgstr "Овощи, внутри и снаружи."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STUFFING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.STUFFING"
msgid "I'm never too full for a little extra stuffing."
msgstr "В меня всегда поместится еще немного начинки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED"
msgid "I guess it's technically edible."
msgstr "Ну, технически это съедобно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PLANT"
msgid "I'm afraid I can't stop to admire every bit of scenery."
msgstr "Боюсь, у меня нет времени восхищаться каждой травинкой."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_POTTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_POTTED"
msgid "I can never seem to keep them alive for long."
msgstr "Они у меня почему-то долго не живут."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "A shell this enormous must have something interesting inside."
msgstr "В такой здоровенной ракушке наверняка припрятано много интересного."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.LOCKED"
msgid "Oh botheration! Open up, you!"
msgstr "Вот неудобство! Ну же, откройся!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUPERTACKLECONTAINER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUPERTACKLECONTAINER"
msgid "I could fit an entire bait shop in there."
msgstr "Сюда поместится целый магазин наживок."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR"
msgid "Everything breaks down over time. Well, most things anyway."
msgstr "Все со временем приходит в негодность. Ну или почти все."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_BROKEN"
msgid "Time has not been kind."
msgstr "Время беспощадно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_COMPLETE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_COMPLETE"
msgid "I wonder how long it will last."
msgstr "Интересно, как долго она протянет?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE"
msgid "Everything breaks down over time. Well, most things anyway."
msgstr "Все со временем приходит в негодность. Ну или почти все."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_BROKEN"
msgid "Does anything last?"
msgstr "В этом мире хоть что-то вечно?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_COMPLETE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_COMPLETE"
msgid "Hmph. Time will tell."
msgstr "Хм, время покажет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_SCAFFOLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_SCAFFOLD"
msgid "Oh! I thought that was done already."
msgstr "О, мне казалось, мы это уже достроили."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_SCAFFOLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_SCAFFOLD"
msgid "Oh! I thought that was done already."
msgstr "О, мне казалось, мы это уже достроили."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SURFNTURF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SURFNTURF"
msgid "Perfect for people who can't make up their mind."
msgstr "Лучший выбор тех, кто никак не может определиться."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SWEATERVEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SWEATERVEST"
msgid "It looks like something a pretentious old professor might wear."
msgstr "Что-то подобное обычно носят помпезные старые профессора."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SWEETPOTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SWEETPOTATO"
msgid "An odd recipe, but I can't say I don't enjoy it."
msgstr "Рецепт необычный, но мне вполне по вкусу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SWEETTEA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SWEETTEA"
msgid "Well... I guess there's time for a quick cup of tea."
msgstr "Что ж... Думаю, у меня есть минутка на чашечку чая."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SWORD_LUNARPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SWORD_LUNARPLANT"
msgid "Oh, I quite like that one."
msgstr "О, а это мне нравится."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.BURNT"
msgid "Dinner might have to wait."
msgstr "С ужином придется повременить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.GENERIC"
msgid "An empty table isn't really much to look at."
msgstr "На пустой стол смотреть не очень-то интересно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.HAS_FOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.HAS_FOOD"
msgid "A finely set table."
msgstr "Изысканно накрытый стол."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.WRONG_TYPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.WRONG_TYPE"
msgid "Oh botheration, what time of year is it again?"
msgstr "Вот неудобство, да какое же сейчас время года?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TACKLECONTAINER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TACKLECONTAINER"
msgid "Finally, my poor pockets can be free of hooks and fish bait."
msgstr "Ну наконец-то можно вынуть из моих бедных кармашков крючки и наживку."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TACKLESKETCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TACKLESKETCH"
msgid "I don't think I've seen this type of tackle before. Or maybe I just forgot..."
msgstr "Не думаю, что раньше видела подобную снасть. А может, я просто забыла..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TACKLESTATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TACKLESTATION"
msgid "Fishing is so bothersome, it takes so much time and preparation!"
msgstr "Рыбалка — сплошное неудобство. Столько времени уходит впустую!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TAFFY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TAFFY"
msgid "I'll never forget, baba used to bring these home for us on special occasions."
msgstr "Никогда не забуду те редкие дни, когда папа приносил нам домой такие ириски."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD"
msgid "I wonder how they keep their balance."
msgstr "Интересно, как они сохраняют равновесие?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG"
msgid "A future bird."
msgstr "Будущая птица."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_COOKED"
msgid "It tastes like stolen time."
msgstr "На вкус как украденное время."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.COLD"
msgid "I shouldn't leave it out in the cold."
msgstr "Не стоит оставлять его на холоде."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.GENERIC"
msgid "Did that crack come from the outside or the inside?"
msgstr "Интересно, оно снаружи треснуло или изнутри?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.HOT"
msgid "It's going to be a fried egg soon if I don't cool it down."
msgstr "Если его не остудить, у меня скоро будет яичница."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.LONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.LONG"
msgid "Can you hatch any faster?"
msgstr "А побыстрее нельзя вылупиться?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.SHORT"
msgid "According to my egg timer, it could hatch any moment now!"
msgstr "Мои часы показывают, что птенец вот-вот вылупится!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.GENERIC"
msgid "I spot an egg! Although it looks like it was spotted already."
msgstr "Я приметила яйцо! Впрочем, его явно кто-то пометил до меня."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.PICKED"
msgid "Just an empty nest."
msgstr "Это пустое гнездо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLEGGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TALLEGGS"
msgid "Eggs and breakfast sausage efficiently rolled into one."
msgstr "Яйца и фарш на завтрак — два в одном."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TAMALES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TAMALES"
msgid "They're piping hot!"
msgstr "С пылу, с жару!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.GENERIC"
msgid "When did you dye your feathers?"
msgstr "Когда это ты покрасила перья?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.HUNGRY"
msgid "Oh botheration, I bet you're hungry."
msgstr "Вот неудобство. Наверно, ты проголодалась."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.SLEEPING"
msgid "This is no time for sleeping!"
msgstr "Сейчас не время спать!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.STARVING"
msgid "I think she might actually eat me if I don't feed her soon."
msgstr "Думаю, она меня саму слопает, если ее сейчас не покормить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.GEMS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.GEMS"
msgid "I can't believe how much energy this thing requires to work."
msgstr "Поверить не могу, сколько энергии потребляет эта штуковина."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.VALID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.VALID"
msgid "Well, might as well put it to use."
msgstr "Что ж, почему бы ей и не воспользоваться."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.ACTIVE"
msgid "With this I can surely pass through space and time!"
msgstr "С этим я легко пройду через пространство и время!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.GENERIC"
msgid "This appears to be a nexus to another world!"
msgstr "Это можно смело назвать связующим звеном между измерениями!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.LOCKED"
msgid "There's still something missing."
msgstr "Все еще чего-то не хватает."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.PARTIAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.PARTIAL"
msgid "Soon, the invention will be complete!"
msgstr "Совсем скоро я закончу работу над этим изобретением!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BOX"
msgid "This may control the polarity of the whole universe."
msgstr "Может управлять полярностью целой Вселенной."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_CRANK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_CRANK"
msgid "Tough enough to handle the most intense experiments."
msgstr "Довольно крепкая, чтобы выдержать многие тяжелые опыты."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO"
msgid "This metal potato contains great and fearful power..."
msgstr "Эта металлическая картофелина содержит большую и страшную силу…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_RING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_RING"
msgid "A ring that could focus dimensional energies."
msgstr "Кольцо, фокусирующее пространственную энергию."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TELESTAFF"
msgid "It's a bit clunky, but it'll do for now."
msgstr "Слегка тяжеловат, но пока сгодится."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TENT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TENT.BURNT"
msgid "It looks like nap time is over, permanently."
msgstr "Похоже, теперь мне уже не подремать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TENT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TENT.GENERIC"
msgid "I guess it wouldn't hurt to take a quick little nap..."
msgstr "Пожалуй, можно и вздремнуть часик-другой..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE"
msgid "I'll be avoiding that."
msgstr "Уж лучше обойду стороной."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPIKE"
msgid "Quite a nasty weapon."
msgstr "Довольно мерзкое оружие."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPOTS"
msgid "Such a nice pattern, if only it wasn't so slimy and disgusting."
msgstr "Жаль, что оно такое склизкое и противное: выкройка-то красивая."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN"
msgid "Another thing I probably shouldn't touch."
msgstr "Очередная штуковина, которую не стоит трогать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR"
msgid "I don't think I should touch that."
msgstr "Не думаю, что стоит это трогать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_ARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_ARM"
msgid "Hateful little things!"
msgstr "Какие гадкие вещицы!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_HOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_HOLE"
msgid "There's a whole maze of tunnels down there."
msgstr "Внизу целый лабиринт тоннелей."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.COOLDOWN"
msgid "It's dormant, for the time being at least."
msgstr "Оно в спячке. По крайней мере, на данный момент."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.CRIMSON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.CRIMSON"
msgid "Oh, it didn't take well to shadow magic, did it?"
msgstr "Ой, темная магия ему явно не по нраву."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.ENABLED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.ENABLED"
msgid "Being right all the time is getting old."
msgstr "Постоянна правота — первый признак старости."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.GENERIC"
msgid "Does anyone else feel that shiver of interdimensionality in the air?"
msgstr "Вы тоже это чувствуете? Потянуло ветерком из другого мира."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.SPAWN_DISABLED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.SPAWN_DISABLED"
msgid "It doesn't seem to be active, perhaps now I can tinker with it..."
msgstr "Кажется, не работает. Можно поковыряться в механизме..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.WAITING_FOR_DARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.WAITING_FOR_DARK"
msgid "I have a rather terrible feeling about this..."
msgstr "У меня очень дурное предчувствие..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.BURNT"
msgid "Erased from the timeline."
msgstr "Вот так и стираются вещи и события из истории."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "Dimensional cross-contamination aside, it's quite a lovely chest."
msgstr "Очень милый сундучок, не считая того, что он родом из другого измерения."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.SHIMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.SHIMMER"
msgid "That... seems suspect."
msgstr "Это... довольно подозрительно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.THULECITE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.THULECITE"
msgid "If I could just break it down into more manageable pieces..."
msgstr "Вот бы его разломать на мелкие кусочки..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.THULECITEBUGNET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.THULECITEBUGNET"
msgid "I've seen this before."
msgstr "Я такое уже видела."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.THULECITE_PIECES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.THULECITE_PIECES"
msgid "Just what I was looking for!"
msgstr "Вот это я и искала!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.THURIBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.THURIBLE"
msgid "I don't trust it."
msgstr "Я этой штуке не доверяю."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.ABANDONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.ABANDONED"
msgid "Oh don't look at me like that, it's nothing personal!"
msgstr "И нечего на меня так смотреть. Ничего личного!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.GENERIC"
msgid "Aha! I knew I remembered seeing orange ones!"
msgstr "Ага! Я точно помню, что уже видела таких оранжевых!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.LOST_TRACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.LOST_TRACK"
msgid "Did he lose the trail? Ugh, what a waste of time!"
msgstr "Он сбился со следа? Какое расточительство времени."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NEARBY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NEARBY"
msgid "He seems particularly interested in that area."
msgstr "Он проявляет явный интерес к этому месту."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NOTHING_TO_TRACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NOTHING_TO_TRACK"
msgid "Hmm, I suppose there's nothing around to track."
msgstr "Хм... Видимо, в округе ему нечего выслеживать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.SUCCESS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.SUCCESS"
msgid "You've found something, have you?"
msgstr "Ты что-то нашел, да?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TARGET_TOO_FAR_AWAY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TARGET_TOO_FAR_AWAY"
msgid "Perhaps they're somewhere else."
msgstr "Наверное, енотокотята где-то в другом месте."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING"
msgid "Having an expert around should speed things up."
msgstr "Раз у меня теперь есть эксперт, дела пойдут быстрее."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING_NOT_MINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING_NOT_MINE"
msgid "They seem preoccupied with helping someone else."
msgstr "Он помогает кому-то еще."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED"
msgid "That doesn't look like it belongs..."
msgstr "Больше похоже на сорняк..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TILLWEEDSALVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TILLWEEDSALVE"
msgid "This plant gunk isn't going to do me much good."
msgstr "Эта растительная гадость мне ничем не поможет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.GENERIC"
msgid "I really should have remembered something like you!"
msgstr "Я бы тебя обязательно запомнила!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.RAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.RAGE"
msgid "I think the pendulum just swung in his favor..."
msgstr "Похоже, маятник качнулся в его сторону..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.EMPTY"
msgid "Wasn't there something here before? Or maybe that's later."
msgstr "Здесь же что-то росло, разве нет? А может, вырастет позже."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.GENERIC"
msgid "This feels strangely familiar."
msgstr "Выглядит на удивление знакомо..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.INGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.INGROUND"
msgid "Come on out, don't be shy!"
msgstr "Ну же, вылезай, не стесняйся!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOMATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOMATO"
msgid "A pleasantly plump, juicy tomato."
msgstr "Пухленький и сочный помидор."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_COOKED"
msgid "Oh, it's gone all mushy."
msgstr "Ой, теперь он совсем мягкий."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_OVERSIZED"
msgid "I don't know if I can lift a tomato that size!"
msgstr "Не знаю, сумею ли поднять такой огромный помидор!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_SEEDS"
msgid "Why waste time growing them when I can just eat them now?"
msgstr "Зачем тратить время на то, чтобы что-то из них вырастить, если можно и прямо так съесть?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT"
msgid "I'd look like quite the gentlewoman in that!"
msgstr "В нем я буду выглядеть как дама из высшего общества!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT_MAGICIAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT_MAGICIAN"
msgid "A bit drab for my tastes."
msgstr "Немного напыщенно, как по мне."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TORCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TORCH"
msgid "It'll keep the darkness at bay. For a time, at least."
msgstr "Он поможет отогнать тьму. Хотя бы на время."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOURTIERE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOURTIERE"
msgid "This is exactly what I first imagined a mincemeat pie would be."
msgstr "Таким я себе и представляла мясной пирог."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.ACTIVE"
msgid "Looks like it's ready to go."
msgstr "Похоже, он работает."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.GENERIC"
msgid "A bit redundant, but it'll work in a pinch."
msgstr "Едва ли это незаменимая вещь, но на крайний случай сгодится."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.ACTIVE"
msgid "I might as well use it."
msgstr "Почему бы и не попробовать?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.GENERIC"
msgid "It positively reeks of spacial wib-wobblery."
msgstr "Да от него прямо-таки несет пространственными колебаниями!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAILMIX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAILMIX"
msgid "I prefer the version that has little bits of candy in it..."
msgstr "Мне больше нравится версия с кусочками сладостей..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAILS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAILS"
msgid "He's got a strong arm on him."
msgstr "Бьет он так, что мало не покажется."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRANSISTOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRANSISTOR"
msgid "Is this one of those newfangled electric thinga-ma-whoosits?"
msgstr "Это что, одна из новомодных электрических штуковинок?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAP"
msgid "The trap is fine, it's the part afterwards that makes me sad..."
msgstr "Ловушка-то хорошая, но мне грустно думать о том, что случится дальше..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAP_BRAMBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAP_BRAMBLE"
msgid "If any intruders come by, they'll be in for a thorny surprise."
msgstr "Незваных гостей ждет очень колючий сюрприз."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.CLOSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.CLOSED"
msgid "Ooooh you hateful thing!"
msgstr "Ух, мерзкая ты штука!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm not falling for that again."
msgstr "Нет уж, второй раз я на это не попадусь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH"
msgid "That would be a painful misstep to make."
msgstr "Эта оплошность будет очень болезненной."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH_MAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH_MAXWELL"
msgid "I'll want to avoid stepping on that!"
msgstr "Что-то мне не очень хочется наступать туда!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.BURNT"
msgid "I probably should have seen that coming."
msgstr "Что ж, этого следовало ожидать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "Less cluttering up my pockets means less cluttering up my mind."
msgstr "Чем чище мои карманы, тем чище у меня в голове."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE"
msgid "I can always use more space for trinkets."
msgstr "Чем больше места для безделушек, тем лучше."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_TRAP"
msgid "Did I leave this here? Hm..."
msgstr "Разве это моих рук дело? Хм-м..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TREECLUMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TREECLUMP"
msgid "It's almost like someone is trying to prevent me from going somewhere."
msgstr "Такое ощущение, будто меня нарочно куда-то не пускают."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TREEGROWTHSOLUTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TREEGROWTHSOLUTION"
msgid "I can finally speed up those dreadfully slow trees!"
msgstr "Наконец-то я ускорю эти ужасно медленные деревья!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRIDENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRIDENT"
msgid "It makes such a racket!"
msgstr "Шума-то сколько!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_1"
msgid "They look like candy that was left in someone's pocket for too long."
msgstr "Похожи на сладости, которые слишком долго лежали в чьем-то кармане."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_10
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_10"
msgid "Thankfully my teeth seem to have stayed pretty sturdy in my older years."
msgstr "К счастью, мои зубы в старости по-прежнему в полном порядке."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_11
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_11"
msgid "Oh you would look just darling on a shelf next to some porcelain figurines!"
msgstr "О, да ты же идеально будешь смотреться на полке с фарфоровыми фигурками!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_12
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_12"
msgid "It's stuck in a perpetual state of decay."
msgstr "Оно застыло в процессе разложения."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_13
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_13"
msgid "Oooh, I do love a good knickknack."
msgstr "О-о-о, люблю хорошие безделицы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_14
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_14"
msgid "It's just for display."
msgstr "Просто поставлю ее на полку."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_15
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_15"
msgid "I have no patience for chess, but it looks simple enough."
msgstr "Мне не хватает терпения играть в шахматы, но выглядит это довольно просто."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_16
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_16"
msgid "I have no patience for chess, but it looks simple enough."
msgstr "Мне не хватает терпения играть в шахматы, но выглядит это довольно просто."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_17
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_17"
msgid "Think about how much time I'll save if I only need to use one utensil!"
msgstr "Сколько же времени я сэкономлю, если смогу пользоваться всего одним прибором!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_18
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_18"
msgid "Has history taught us nothing?"
msgstr "Неужели история нас ничему не научила?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_19
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_19"
msgid "Nobody's perfect."
msgstr "Никто не идеален."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_2"
msgid "I can't get a single note out of it."
msgstr "Не могу заставить его сыграть даже нотку."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_20
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_20"
msgid "So this is when it ended up!"
msgstr "Так вот когда она подевалась!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_21
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_21"
msgid "It's seen better days."
msgstr "Видал он и лучшие времена."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_22
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_22"
msgid "I'm neither a cat nor a knitter. Maybe someone else will want it."
msgstr "Я не кошка и не вязальщица. Может, это пригодится кому-то еще."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_23
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_23"
msgid "I'll be able to shave a few seconds off my shoe-changing time."
msgstr "Сэкономлю пару секунд при смене обуви."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_24
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_24"
msgid "I'm not much of a cat person."
msgstr "Не считаю себя кошатницей."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_25
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_25"
msgid "It smells like pine needles. Dead, rotten pine needles."
msgstr "Пахнет хвоей. Гнилой, мертвой хвоей."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_26
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_26"
msgid "Something to sip and snack on all at once!"
msgstr "Можно и пить, и закусывать одновременно!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_27
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_27"
msgid "I would've rather found the coat."
msgstr "Лучше бы я нашла пальто."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_28
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_28"
msgid "It seems like you can't walk too far around here without tripping over a chess piece."
msgstr "Похоже, тут и шагу нельзя сделать, не наступив на шахматную фигуру."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_29
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_29"
msgid "It seems like you can't walk too far around here without tripping over a chess piece."
msgstr "Похоже, тут и шагу нельзя сделать, не наступив на шахматную фигуру."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_3"
msgid "I'm not going to bother trying to untangle it."
msgstr "Даже не буду пытаться его развязать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_30
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_30"
msgid "I wonder whatever happened to the rest of the set. Or the players."
msgstr "Интересно, что стало с остальными фигурами? Да и с игроками."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_31
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_31"
msgid "I wonder whatever happened to the rest of the set. Or the players."
msgstr "Интересно, что стало с остальными фигурами? Да и с игроками."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_32
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_32"
msgid "It'll only show you one possible future."
msgstr "Он покажет лишь одно возможное будущее."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_33
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_33"
msgid "I keep forgetting it's not real!"
msgstr "Все забываю, что паук ненастоящий!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_34
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_34"
msgid "There's no need to be afraid of curses if you're clever enough to outsmart them."
msgstr "Не надо бояться проклятий, если тебе хватает ума их перехитрить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_35
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_35"
msgid "Whatever it held, it's gone now."
msgstr "Что бы ни было раньше внутри, сейчас она пустая."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_36
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_36"
msgid "I don't think it's a good idea to put things we find lying around here in our mouths."
msgstr "По-моему, засовывать в рот то, что валялось на земле, — не очень славная идея."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_37
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_37"
msgid "Somewhere there's a vampire having a very bad day."
msgstr "У какого-то вампира сегодня неважный день."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_38
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_38"
msgid "It helps me see the way ahead."
msgstr "Поможет увидеть, что меня ждет впереди."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_39
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_39"
msgid "I don't think it's from this timeline..."
msgstr "По-моему, это из другой линии времени..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_4"
msgid "Oooh, I do love a good knickknack."
msgstr "О-о-о, люблю хорошие безделицы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_40
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_40"
msgid "The needle moves rather sluggishly."
msgstr "Их стрелка еле ползает."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_41
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_41"
msgid "This is definitely going to contaminate the timeline."
msgstr "Эта штука точно загрязнит линию времени."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_42
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_42"
msgid "...But why does it have a mouse head?"
msgstr "...Но почему у нее мышиная голова?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_43
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_43"
msgid "Ah, youth..."
msgstr "Ах, юность..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_44
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_44"
msgid "Is that plant still alive?"
msgstr "Это растение еще живо?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_45
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_45"
msgid "It keeps making strange sounds."
msgstr "Оно издает странные звуки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_46
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_46"
msgid "How did this get here?"
msgstr "Как это здесь оказалось?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_5"
msgid "How futuristic!"
msgstr "Какой футуризм!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_6"
msgid "One of those electrical doo-hickeys. I'll stick to my gears and pendulums."
msgstr "Одна из этих электрических штуковинок. Мне ближе шестеренки да маятники."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_7"
msgid "I have no time for distractions."
msgstr "У меня нет времени отвлекаться."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_8"
msgid "You never know what might come in handy later."
msgstr "Никогда не знаешь, что и когда пригодится."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_9"
msgid "Each one is charmingly unique."
msgstr "Каждая из них по-своему очаровательна."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNING"
msgid "I would've thought the water from the fishbowl would help douse the flames..."
msgstr "Я бы предположила, что вода из аквариума немного остудит ее пыл..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNT"
msgid "I was too late to save it."
msgstr "Я не успела ее спасти."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.GENERIC"
msgid "That's quite an extravagant fishbowl."
msgstr "Какой экстравагантный аквариум."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.HAS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.HAS_ITEM"
msgid "Weight: {weight}\nCaught by: {owner}"
msgstr "Вес: {weight}\nПоймано: {owner}"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.HAS_ITEM_HEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.HAS_ITEM_HEAVY"
msgid "Weight: {weight}\nCaught by: {owner}\nI'm amazed it fits in there!"
msgstr "Вес: {weight}\nПоймано: {owner}\nПоверить не могу, что она туда помещается!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.OWNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.OWNER"
msgid "It does give one a nice sense of achievement.\nWeight: {weight}\nCaught by: {owner}"
msgstr "Помогает почувствовать себя победителем.\nВес: {weight}\nПоймано: {owner}"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.OWNER_HEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.OWNER_HEAVY"
msgid "Weight: {weight}\nCaught by: {owner}\nSee? I can be patient sometimes!"
msgstr "Вес: {weight}\nПоймано: {owner}\nВидите, иногда мне хватает терпения!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNING"
msgid "Oh! Where did that fire come from?"
msgstr "Ой! А откуда взялся этот огонь?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNT"
msgid "What a waste."
msgstr "Какая потеря."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.GENERIC"
msgid "You would think weight would be easier to manipulate than time..."
msgstr "А ведь казалось бы, весом манипулировать проще, чем временем..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM"
msgid "Weight: {weight}\nHarvested on day: {day}\nInteresting, there's a temporal bubble that keeps it from rotting."
msgstr "Вес: {weight}\nДень сбора: {day}\nКак интересно: временной пузырь защищает еду от гниения."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM_HEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM_HEAVY"
msgid "Weight: {weight}\nHarvested on day: {day}\nInteresting, there's a temporal bubble that keeps it from rotting."
msgstr "Вес: {weight}\nДень сбора: {day}\nКак интересно: временной пузырь защищает еду от гниения."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM_LIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM_LIGHT"
msgid "It won't even tell me the weight? Well that's just rude."
msgstr "Что, даже вес не показывает? Как грубо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_SUMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_SUMMER"
msgid "Quite cozy."
msgstr "Довольно удобно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_WINTER"
msgid "The hair is just as thick on the inside."
msgstr "С внутренней стороны шерсть такая же толстая."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_COOKED"
msgid "You get used to the flavor after a while."
msgstr "Постепенно к этому вкусу привыкаешь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_SUMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_SUMMER"
msgid "Thoroughly cleaned, I hope."
msgstr "Надеюсь, его как следует почистили."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_WINTER"
msgid "In the interest of time, I didn't bother removing the fur."
msgstr "Чтобы сэкономить время, я не стала чистить его от меха."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TUMBLEWEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TUMBLEWEED"
msgid "I'm sure it's seen a lot during its travels."
msgstr "Уверена, оно многое повидало в своих странствиях."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TURFCRAFTINGSTATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TURFCRAFTINGSTATION"
msgid "I've tampered with time, I guess I could tamper with the ground a bit too."
msgstr "Раз уж я ковырялась во времени, то можно и в земле поковыряться."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TURF_ARCHIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TURF_ARCHIVE"
msgid "Slightly more interesting to look at, but still just ground."
msgstr "Это все еще просто земля, хоть на нее и немного интереснее смотреть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TURF_BADLANDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TURF_BADLANDS"
msgid "Why am I wasting time staring at the ground?"
msgstr "Зачем я разглядываю землю? Время можно потратить с большей пользой!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TURF_BEARD_RUG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TURF_BEARD_RUG"
msgid "Why am I wasting time staring at... I'm sorry, is that rug made of whiskers?!"
msgstr "Зачем я трачу время, разглядывая какой-то... Позвольте, он что, из усов?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TURF_CARPETFLOOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TURF_CARPETFLOOR"
msgid "I've missed carpet..."
msgstr "Я скучала по коврам..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TURF_CARPETFLOOR2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TURF_CARPETFLOOR2"
msgid "Oh, what a lovely carpet!"
msgstr "Ах, какой милый коврик!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TURF_CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TURF_CAVE"
msgid "Why am I wasting time staring at the ground?"
msgstr "Зачем я разглядываю землю? Время можно потратить с большей пользой!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TURF_CHECKERFLOOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TURF_CHECKERFLOOR"
msgid "Why am I wasting time staring at the ground?"
msgstr "Зачем я разглядываю землю? Время можно потратить с большей пользой!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TURF_COTL_BRICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TURF_COTL_BRICK"
msgid "You've seen one brick, you've seen them all."
msgstr "Кирпичи как кирпичи."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TURF_COTL_GOLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TURF_COTL_GOLD"
msgid "Surely there's a better use for all that gold?!"
msgstr "Неужели этому золоту не нашлось лучшего применения?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TURF_DECIDUOUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TURF_DECIDUOUS"
msgid "Why am I wasting time staring at the ground?"
msgstr "Зачем я разглядываю землю? Время можно потратить с большей пользой!"

