msgstr "Придется вернуться попозже."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDERS"
msgid "It would be better with more petits chats, non?"
msgstr "Было бы веселее, если бы было больше petits chats, non?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDING_SPOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDING_SPOTS"
msgid "Ah, perhaps I should find a place with more hiding spots."
msgstr "Пожалуй, надо найти место, где будет проще прятаться."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_ONE_GAME_PER_DAY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_ONE_GAME_PER_DAY"
msgid "I'm afraid that's enough playing for one day."
msgstr "Боюсь, на сегодня с меня хватит игр."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.LOCKED_GATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.LOCKED_GATE"
msgid "I'll need a key to get through."
msgstr "Чтобы пройти, нужен ключ."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.MANNEQUIN_EQUIPSWAPFAILED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.MANNEQUIN_EQUIPSWAPFAILED"
msgid "Non, that will not do."
msgstr "Non, не твой фасончик."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOCARNIVAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOCARNIVAL"
msgid "The festivities seem to be over."
msgstr "Кажется, праздник подошел к концу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOKELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOKELP"
msgid "only_used_by_wurt"
msgstr "only_used_by_wurt"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMERM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMERM"
