#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYMODULE.NOTENOUGHSLOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYMODULE.NOTENOUGHSLOTS"
