msgstr "Un moment, судья, видимо, занят."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.ATTUNE.NOHEALTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.ATTUNE.NOHEALTH"
