msgstr "Zut! Не успел!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.CARVEPUMPKIN.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.CARVEPUMPKIN.BURNING"
