msgstr "Пахнет жареным мясом."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.CARVEPUMPKIN.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ACTIONFAIL.CARVEPUMPKIN.INUSE"
