msgstr "Хрустит, не так ли?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.CHOPPED"
msgid "Sliced!"
msgstr "Нарезано!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.GENERIC"
msgid "A coneless arbre."
msgstr "Дерево без шишек."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.EYEBRELLAHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.EYEBRELLAHAT"
msgid "\"Eye\" like it!"
msgstr "Радует глаз!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.EYEMASKHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.EYEMASKHAT"
msgid "I must remember to avoid cutting onions while wearing this."
msgstr "Лук в ней резать явно не стоит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR"
msgid "That eye has a hungry look to it..."
msgstr "У него такой голодный взгляд..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI"
msgid "I'm sure there are tastier things to eat than me!"
msgstr "Я совсем не вкусный, уверяю! Есть блюда и поаппетитнее!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI_GROUNDED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI_GROUNDED"
msgid "Don't make me scramble you!"
msgstr "Не заставляй меня сделать из тебя болтунью!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.EYEPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.EYEPLANT"
msgid "Is that a mouth?"
msgstr "Это что, рот?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET"
msgid "This is my friend, Lazer Oeil!"
msgstr "Это мой друг, Лазерный глаз!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET_ITEM"
msgid "Wake up!"
msgstr "Просыпайся!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.BURNT"
msgid "Stayed in the oven a tad too long."
msgstr "Совсем чуть-чуть передержали на огне."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GENERIC"
msgid "I can grow my own ingredients!"
msgstr "Я сам могу вырастить свои ингредиенты!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GROWING"
msgid "Ah, couldn't be more fresh!"
msgstr "Ах, свежее не бывает!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.NEEDSFERTILIZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.NEEDSFERTILIZER"
msgid "Needs to be fertilized."
msgstr "Нужно удобрить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FARM_HOE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FARM_HOE"
msgid "I'd better get planting if I want some fresh ingredients."
msgstr "Надо бы заняться огородом, если хочется увидеть свежий урожай."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.BURNING"
msgid "It's too soon to start cooking!"
msgstr "Рановато еще его готовить!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL"
msgid "Ready for cooking!"
msgstr "Самое то для готовки!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Mon dieu, it's enormous!"
msgstr "Mon dieu, какое огромное растение!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_WEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_WEED"
msgid "It seems my garden is full of weeds!"
msgstr "Кажется, мой сад заполонили сорняки!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GENERIC"
msgid "My garden."
msgstr "Хороший у меня садик."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GROWING"
msgid "The garden is coming along nicely."
msgstr "У меня в саду все отлично растет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN"
msgid "How very sad."
msgstr "Как печально."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Non! What a terrible waste!"
msgstr "Non! Какая ужасная потеря!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.SEED"
msgid "All good things come with time."
msgstr "Все хорошее требует времени."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW"
msgid "What a handy machine!"
msgstr "Какое удобное устройство!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW_ITEM"
msgid "Now, where to start the garden..."
msgstr "Так, где бы разбить сад..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FARM_SOIL_DEBRIS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FARM_SOIL_DEBRIS"
msgid "There's a bit of unwanted garnish in my garden."
msgstr "У меня в саду появились неуместные украшения."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FEATHERFAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FEATHERFAN"
msgid "Why is it so big?"
msgstr "Почему он такой большой?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FEATHERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FEATHERHAT"
msgid "What am I supposed to do with this?"
msgstr "И что мне с этим делать?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FEATHERPENCIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FEATHERPENCIL"
msgid "Lighter than my meringue."
msgstr "Легче, чем мое безе."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CANARY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CANARY"
msgid "A bird's feather, in lemon yellow."
msgstr "Птичье перо лимонно-желтого цвета."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CROW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CROW"
msgid "A bird's feather, in truffle black."
msgstr "Перо птицы цвета черного трюфеля."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN"
msgid "A bird's feather, in cherry red."
msgstr "Перо птицы вишневого цвета."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN_WINTER"
msgid "A bird's feather, in tuna blue."
msgstr "Перо птицы цвета голубого тунца."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FEM_PUPPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FEM_PUPPET"
msgid "She's trapped!"
msgstr "Она в ловушке!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FENCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FENCE"
msgid "A fence."
msgstr "Изгородь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE"
msgid "Like an oven door."
msgstr "Как дверца духовки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE_ITEM"
msgid "The ingredients for a gate."
msgstr "Ингредиенты для ворот."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ITEM"
msgid "The ingredients for a fence."
msgstr "Ингредиенты для изгороди."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FENCE_JUNK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FENCE_JUNK"
msgid "It's constructed well enough, but it lacks presentation."
msgstr "Неплохое сооружение, но подача могла быть и лучше."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ROTATOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ROTATOR"
msgid "I should poke it into a freshly made fence, to see if it's done."
msgstr "Нужно потыкать ею в забор, чтобы убедиться, что он готов."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FERTILIZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FERTILIZER"
msgid "Sauce for my garden!"
msgstr "Соус для моего сада!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FESTIVEFISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FESTIVEFISH"
msgid "There's always room for new traditions!"
msgstr "Всегда можно привнести новые традиции!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FESTIVE_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FESTIVE_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "Just the right thing for a celebration."
msgstr "Идеально для праздника."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIG"
msgid "You would be delicious in a tart."
msgstr "Пирог получится просто великолепный."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIGATONI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIGATONI"
msgid "I've never had pasta so decadent!"
msgstr "Эта паста просто до неприличия хороша!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIGKABAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIGKABAB"
msgid "Something about being on a stick brings out more of the flavor."
msgstr "Что-то есть такое в палочках. Они помогают лучше раскрыть вкус блюда."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIG_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIG_COOKED"
msgid "It could use a bit of honey, perhaps some cinnamon and nutmeg..."
msgstr "Сюда было бы неплохо добавить меда, корицы и, возможно, мускатного ореха..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIREBALLSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIREBALLSTAFF"
msgid "A portable stovetop."
msgstr "Переносная конфорка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIRECRACKERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIRECRACKERS"
msgid "Like oil splattering in a hot pan."
msgstr "Будто плеснули маслом на раскаленную сковороду."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.GENERIC"
msgid "A dash of glow."
msgstr "Короткая вспышка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.HELD"
msgid "My petit lightbulb pets."
msgstr "Мои маленькие питомцы-лампочки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIREHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIREHOUND"
msgid "Chien, on fire!"
msgstr "Собака в огне!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES"
msgid "What a bother."
msgstr "Как она мне надоела."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIREPEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIREPEN"
msgid "I wonder if anyone has ever cooked with a flaming pen?"
msgstr "Интересно, кто-нибудь пробовал готовить огненной ручкой?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.EMBERS"
msgid "That fire's almost out!"
msgstr "Этот огонь почти погас!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.GENERIC"
msgid "To warm my fingers and roast sausages."
msgstr "Буду греть пальцы и жарить сосиски."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.HIGH"
msgid "Maximum heat!"
msgstr "Максимум жара!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.LOW"
msgid "It's getting low."
msgstr "Он гаснет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.NORMAL"
msgid "Parfait."
msgstr "Превосходно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.OUT"
msgid "I like when it's warm and toasty."
msgstr "Мне нравится, когда тепло и уютно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIRESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIRESTAFF"
msgid "Oven on a stick!"
msgstr "Духовка на палке!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.LOWFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.LOWFUEL"
msgid "Shall I fuel it up?"
msgstr "Может, добавить горючего?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.OFF"
msgid "He's sleeping."
msgstr "Он спит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.ON"
msgid "Make it snow!"
msgstr "Да будет снег!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FISH"
msgid "Poisson!"
msgstr "Рыбка!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FISHINGNET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FISHINGNET"
msgid "Fresh seafood awaits!"
msgstr "Свежие морепродукты ждут!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FISHINGROD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FISHINGROD"
msgid "I believe I prefer the fish market."
msgstr "Боюсь, я бы предпочел сходить на рыбный рынок."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT"
msgid "Doesn't even smell fishy it's so fresh!"
msgstr "Такая свежая, что даже рыбой не пахнет!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_COOKED"
msgid "Could use a squeeze of lemon..."
msgstr "Можно бы сбрызнуть лимонным соком…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL"
msgid "I will honor this ingredient."
msgstr "Нужно отдать должное этому ингредиенту."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_COOKED"
msgid "Could use fresh herbs and butter..."
msgstr "Не помешало бы добавить свежих трав и масла…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FISHSTICKS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FISHSTICKS"
msgid "Crunchy and golden outside, flaky and moist inside!"
msgstr "Хрустящие и золотистые снаружи, слоеные и сочные внутри!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FISHTACOS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FISHTACOS"
msgid "Takes me south of the border!"
msgstr "Уносит меня к югу от границы!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FISH_BOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FISH_BOX"
msgid "Is the fish fresh or canned? I feel rather conflicted."
msgstr "Это считается свежей рыбой или консервированной? У меня противоречивые чувства."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FISH_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FISH_COOKED"
msgid "Could use a squeeze of lemon..."
msgstr "Можно бы сбрызнуть лимонным соком…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FLINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FLINT"
msgid "Sharp as can be!"
msgstr "Острее не бывает!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FLOTATIONCUSHION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FLOTATIONCUSHION"
msgid "It will save me from the brine!"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.GENERIC"
msgid "I love to garnish with edible flowers."
msgstr "Люблю украшать блюда съедобными цветами."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.ROSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.ROSE"
msgid "Confections flavored with rose water, perhaps?"
msgstr "Может, добавить в сладости розовую воду для вкуса?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FLOWERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FLOWERHAT"
msgid "Who doesn't look good in this?!"
msgstr "Это идет всем без исключения!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FLOWERSALAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FLOWERSALAD"
msgid "Edible art!"
msgstr "Съедобное искусство!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE"
msgid "Ah, a light in the dark."
msgstr "Ах, лучик света в темном царстве."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_EVIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_EVIL"
msgid "A terrible omen if I ever saw one."
msgstr "Очень дурной знак. Не помню, правда, много ли я видел дурных знаков."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_WITHERED"
msgid "I only use fresh ingredients in my cooking."
msgstr "В своих блюдах я использую только свежие ингредиенты."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE"
msgid "Feuillage."
msgstr "Листва."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FOOTBALLHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FOOTBALLHAT"
msgid "Made from pork, to protect my melon."
msgstr "Штука из свинины для защиты моей дыни."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS"
msgid "Hm, I don't recall ever seeing a flower like that before."
msgstr "Хм. Я таких цветов не помню."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FORMAL_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FORMAL_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "The beast will look as if it's going out to a fancy dinner party."
msgstr "Животное будет выглядеть так, будто собирается на званый ужин."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_PIECE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_PIECE"
msgid "No marrow left in it."
msgstr "Костного мозга уже не осталось."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.COMPLETE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.COMPLETE"
msgid "That looks about right. Now, what's the secret ingredient?"
msgstr "Вроде все правильно. А что за секретный ингредиент?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.FUNNY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.FUNNY"
msgid "At least it's good for a chuckle."
msgstr "По крайней мере, посмешил."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.GENERIC"
msgid "There are still a few bits missing."
msgstr "Не хватает нескольких частей."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FRESHFRUITCREPES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FRESHFRUITCREPES"
msgid "Is this not a thing of beauty?"
msgstr "Разве это не прекрасно?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FRIENDLYFRUITFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FRIENDLYFRUITFLY"
msgid "This one seems to be friendly."
msgstr "Эти насекомые вроде бы дружелюбные."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FROG.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FROG.DEAD"
msgid "I'll eat your legs for dinner!"
msgstr "Твои лапки я съем на ужин!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FROG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FROG.GENERIC"
msgid "Frog. A delicacy."
msgstr "Лягушка. Деликатес."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FROG.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FROG.SLEEPING"
msgid "Bonne nuit, little snack."
msgstr "Спокойной ночи, маленькая закуска."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL"
msgid "I think I've outdone myself, given the available ingredients."
msgstr "Учитывая, что мне было доступно из ингредиентов… Я превзошел себя."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FROGGLEBUNWICH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FROGGLEBUNWICH"
msgid "Ah, French cuisine!"
msgstr "Ах, французская кухня!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS"
msgid "I am hopping with excitement!"
msgstr "Я просто прыгаю от радости!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_COOKED"
msgid "Could use garlic and clarified butter..."
msgstr "Добавить бы чесночку и топленого масла…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FROGNEWTON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FROGNEWTON"
msgid "A lesser known French recipe."
msgstr "Не самый популярный французский рецепт."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FROZENBANANADAIQUIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FROZENBANANADAIQUIRI"
msgid "There's no better refreshment!"
msgstr "Прекрасно освежает!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.GENERIC"
msgid "Our little friend is not quite ripe."
msgstr "Кажется, эта малышка еще не созрела."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.RIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.RIPE"
msgid "You'd be perfect in a meal!"
msgstr "Ты будешь идеальной добавкой к блюдам."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.SLEEPING"
msgid "Sleep well, you tasty morsel."
msgstr "Спи сладко, лакомый кусочек."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLY"
msgid "Non! Out of my garden!"
msgstr "Non! Вон из моего сада!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLYFRUIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLYFRUIT"
msgid "They seem quite taken with whoever holds this."
msgstr "Они сразу же слетаются к тому, кто держит этот фрукт."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FRUITMEDLEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FRUITMEDLEY"
msgid "Invigorating!"
msgstr "Воодушевляет!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FURTUFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FURTUFT"
msgid "Plush and soft, if a bit dirty."
msgstr "Мягкий и пушистый. Грязный только."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING"
msgid "It does not look friendly!"
msgstr "Выглядит не очень дружелюбно!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING_BOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING_BOMB"
msgid "It's about to pop!"
msgstr "Сейчас взорвется!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_HOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_HOUND"
msgid "I feel strangely uneasy."
msgstr "Как-то мне не по себе."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_WEREPIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_WEREPIG"
msgid "It won't begin to move, will it?"
msgstr "Он же не начнет двигаться, да?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GARLIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GARLIC"
msgid "Ah! The smell of fresh garlic!"
msgstr "О! Запах свежего чеснока!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_COOKED"
msgid "What can I add this to?"
msgstr "К чему бы его добавить?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_OVERSIZED"
msgid "So much garlic! My chef's heart weeps with joy!"
msgstr "Сколько чеснока! Моя поварская душа поет от радости!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_SEEDS"
msgid "What fresh ingredients will grow from these?"
msgstr "Какие свежие ингредиенты можно из них вырастить?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GAZPACHO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GAZPACHO"
msgid "Ah. Perfect on a hot day."
msgstr "О. Идеально для жаркого дня."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GEARS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GEARS"
msgid "The insides of those naughty machines."
msgstr "Потроха этих надоедливых машин."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.GENERIC"
msgid "That is unappetizing."
msgstr "Выглядит неаппетитно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_CHARACTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_CHARACTER"
msgid "There is someone floating in the gelatin."
msgstr "В этом желатине кто-то барахтается."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_ITEM"
msgid "There is something floating in the gelatin."
msgstr "В этом желатине что-то плавает."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_BOTTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_BOTTLE"
msgid "I would not spread that on any toast."
msgstr "На хлеб я бы это не мазал."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.FULL"
msgid "It looks most unappetizing."
msgstr "Выглядит максимально неаппетитно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.GENERIC"
msgid "What a... interesting way to store food."
msgstr "Интересный способ... консервации."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE_KIT"
msgid "Some assembly is required."
msgstr "Нужно объединить ингредиенты."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.GEMS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.GEMS"
msgid "Gem it!"
msgstr "Даешь камушки!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.VALID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.VALID"
msgid "Voilà!"
msgstr "Вуаля!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GESTALT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GESTALT"
msgid "Can you... get me home to dear Maman?"
msgstr "Ты можешь… вернуть меня домой к любимой maman?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.FILLED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.FILLED"
msgid "Something inside!"
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.GENERIC"
msgid "It is empty."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD"
msgid "I think it would be wise to stay out of their way."
msgstr "По-моему, их лучше обходить стороной."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD_EVOLVED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD_EVOLVED"
msgid "I assure you it wasn't personal."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GHOST"
msgid "Could I offer you a ghost pepper?"
msgstr "Предложить вам призрачного перца?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWER"
msgid "Looking at it makes me feel... peaceful."
msgstr "Его вид меня так… умиротворяет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWERHAT"
msgid "I wonder. Do the dead taste?"
msgstr "Интересно, мертвые чувствуют вкус?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_ATTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_ATTACK"
msgid "I'm not sure about some of those ingredients, mademoiselle."
msgstr "Что-то я не уверен насчет этих ингредиентов, мадмуазель."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_FASTREGEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_FASTREGEN"
msgid "I'm not sure about some of those ingredients, mademoiselle."
msgstr "Что-то я не уверен насчет этих ингредиентов, мадмуазель."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_LUNAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_LUNAR"
msgid "I'm not sure about some of those ingredients, mademoiselle."
msgstr "Что-то я не уверен насчет этих ингредиентов, мадмуазель."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_RETALIATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_RETALIATION"
msgid "I'm not sure about some of those ingredients, mademoiselle."
msgstr "Что-то я не уверен насчет этих ингредиентов, мадмуазель."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_REVIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_REVIVE"
msgid "I'm not sure about some of those ingredients, mademoiselle."
msgstr "Что-то я не уверен насчет этих ингредиентов, мадмуазель."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHADOW"
msgid "I'm not sure about some of those ingredients, mademoiselle."
msgstr "Что-то я не уверен насчет этих ингредиентов, мадмуазель."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHIELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHIELD"
msgid "I'm not sure about some of those ingredients, mademoiselle."
msgstr "Что-то я не уверен насчет этих ингредиентов, мадмуазель."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SLOWREGEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SLOWREGEN"
msgid "I'm not sure about some of those ingredients, mademoiselle."
msgstr "Что-то я не уверен насчет этих ингредиентов, мадмуазель."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SPEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SPEED"
msgid "I'm not sure about some of those ingredients, mademoiselle."
msgstr "Что-то я не уверен насчет этих ингредиентов, мадмуазель."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GIFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GIFT"
msgid "Pour moi?"
msgstr "Pour moi?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GIFTWRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GIFTWRAP"
msgid "I could hide some cookies inside for the little ones."
msgstr "Можно завернуть несколько печенек для малышей."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADHOUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADHOUSE"
msgid "The piping on those roofs - magnifique!"
msgstr "Только посмотрите на эти крыши! Magnifique!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADPIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADPIG"
msgid "I can catch you, gingerbread pig!"
msgstr "Я тебя догоню, пряничная свинья!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADWARG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADWARG"
msgid "Looks sweet, but acts sour!"
msgstr "На вид такой сладкий, а так себя ведет!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GLASSBLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GLASSBLOCK"
msgid "Reminds me of the ice sculptures in the ship's dining hall."
msgstr "Напоминает мне о ледяных скульптурах в корабельной столовой."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GLASSCUTTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GLASSCUTTER"
msgid "Good for slicing and dicing!"
msgstr "Можно резать и кромсать!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GLASSSPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GLASSSPIKE"
msgid "I prefer my decor a smidge less... stabby."
msgstr "Предпочитаю не такие колючие украшения."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.GENERIC"
msgid "I think I like it."
msgstr "Пожалуй, мне нравится."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.SLEEPING"
msgid "Sleep well, mon ami."
msgstr "Спи сладко, mon ami."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.DEAD"
msgid "What a waste."
msgstr "Какая потеря."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.GENERIC"
msgid "Tres beau!"
msgstr "Очень красиво!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFUEL"
msgid "Looks like bubblegum, tastes like floor."
msgstr "На вид как жвачка, на вкус — как земля."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERWINGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERWINGS"
msgid "A tiny delicacy."
msgstr "Крошечное лакомство."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GLOWBERRYMOUSSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GLOWBERRYMOUSSE"
msgid "My own special recipe!"
msgstr "Мой собственный особый рецепт!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN"
msgid "Ha! You've no shish left to kabob with!"
msgstr "Ха! Шиш тебе, а не кебаб!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN_FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN_FOLLOWER"
msgid "I am very sorry about your horn, mon ami."
msgstr "Прости, мне жаль твой рог, mon ami."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.FOLLOWER"
msgid "You're really quite a gentle soul, aren't you mon ami?"
msgstr "У тебя такой мягкий нрав, да, mon ami?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.GENERIC"
msgid "Mon dieu, don't skewer me!"
msgstr "Mon dieu, только не протыкай меня насквозь!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL_HORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL_HORN"
msgid "I was nearly run through with that thing!"
msgstr "Да меня этой штукой чуть насквозь не проткнули!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GOATMILK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GOATMILK"
msgid "Can I make this into cheese?"
msgstr "Из этого можно сделать сыр?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHAT"
msgid "Oh. I've never considered myself fashionable before!"
msgstr "О. Никогда раньше не интересовался модой!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GOLDENAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GOLDENAXE"
msgid "A golden chopper!"
msgstr "Золотой нож для резки!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPICKAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPICKAXE"
msgid "That looks nice."
msgstr "Выглядит здорово."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPITCHFORK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPITCHFORK"
msgid "A golden fork for a giant, oui?"
msgstr "Золотая вилка для великана, да?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GOLDENSHOVEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GOLDENSHOVEL"
msgid "Shiny."
msgstr "Блестящий."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GOLDEN_FARM_HOE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GOLDEN_FARM_HOE"
msgid "Good tools do make a difference."
msgstr "С хорошими инструментами и работа спорится."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GOLDNUGGET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GOLDNUGGET"
msgid "Yolk yellow, glowing gold!"
msgstr "Желтый желток, светится золотом!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GOOSE_FEATHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GOOSE_FEATHER"
msgid "A plucked goose was here."
msgstr "Здесь был ощипанный гусь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BARREN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BARREN"
msgid "Could I get some fertilizer over here?"
msgstr "Получится ли достать немного удобрений?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BURNING"
msgid "I never burn anything in the kitchen."
msgstr "Я никогда ничего не жгу на кухне."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASED"
msgid "It's under the weather."
msgstr "Неважно себя чувствует."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASING"
msgid "It's starting to look a little funny."
msgstr "Начинает выглядеть как-то не очень."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRASS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRASS.GENERIC"
msgid "A common ingredient for success around here."
msgstr "Здешний главный ингредиент успеха."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRASS.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRASS.PICKED"
msgid "Plucked clean!"
msgstr "Выдрал с корнем!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRASS.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRASS.WITHERED"
msgid "Too hot for you."
msgstr "Слишком жарко для тебя."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRASSGATOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRASSGATOR"
msgid "He seems to be a gentle soul."
msgstr "По-моему, он очень стеснительный."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.DISEASED"
msgid "Would some nice soup make you feel better?"
msgstr "А вкусный суп тебя не утешит?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.GENERIC"
msgid "It doesn't seem dangerous."
msgstr "Не кажется опасным."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRASS_UMBRELLA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRASS_UMBRELLA"
msgid "A bit of shade is better than none."
msgstr "Небольшая тень лучше, чем никакая."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.GENERIC"
msgid "It's missing the key ingredient."
msgstr "Не хватает основного ингредиента."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.HAS_SPIRIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.HAS_SPIRIT"
msgid "It is full!"
msgstr "Теперь с начинкой!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GRAVY"
msgid "Rich and full of flavor."
msgstr "Богатый и насыщенный вкус."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GREENAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GREENAMULET"
msgid "For more savvy construction!"
msgstr "Чтобы соображать быстрее!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GREENGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GREENGEM"
msgid "Ahh, a rare attraction!"
msgstr "А-ах, редкая штучка!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GREENMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GREENMOONEYE"
msgid "So long as it doesn't blink."
msgstr "Главное, чтобы не моргал."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GREENSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GREENSTAFF"
msgid "I probably shouldn't stir soup with this."
msgstr "Пожалуй, не стоит им помешивать суп."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP"
msgid "Don't crowd the mushrooms."
msgstr "Не толпимся."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP_COOKED"
msgid "Could use a slathering of butter and chives..."
msgstr "Можно было бы густо намазать маслом и посыпать луком…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.GENERIC"
msgid "Little champignon!"
msgstr "Маленький шампиньон!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.INGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.INGROUND"
msgid "Did it eat itself...?"
msgstr "Он что, съел сам себя?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.PICKED"
msgid "I eagerly await its rebirth!"
msgstr "С нетерпением жду его возвращения!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_BIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_BIG"
msgid "My, how beautiful!"
msgstr "Вот это красота!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_SMALL"
msgid "My, how beautiful!"
msgstr "Вот это красота!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GUACAMOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GUACAMOLE"
msgid "More like Greatamole!"
msgstr "Просто Нямкамоле!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GUANO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GUANO"
msgid "Poop of the bat."
msgstr "Какашка мышелиска."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GUNPOWDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.GUNPOWDER"
msgid "Boom!"
msgstr "Бум!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_1"
msgid "These can be enjoyable, now and then."
msgstr "Иногда можно и их съесть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_10
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_10"
msgid "The younger among us would enjoy it more than me."
msgstr "Молодняку они скорее придут по душе."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_11
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_11"
msgid "There are few things I love more than milk chocolate."
msgstr "Мало что люблю так, как молочный шоколад."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_12
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_12"
msgid "I'm sure it tastes better than it looks."
msgstr "Надеюсь, на вкус они лучше, чем на вид."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_13
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_13"
msgid "It's a little too sweet for my taste."
msgstr "На мой вкус, слишком сладко."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_14
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_14"
msgid "It sticks in my teeth, but it's well worth it."
msgstr "В зубах застревает, но оно того стоит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_2"
msgid "There are better confections available, in my professional opinion."
msgstr "Как профессионал я считаю, что это не самые лучшие сладости."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_3"
msgid "It could use some butter and salt."
msgstr "Добавить бы масла и соли."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_4"
msgid "Licorice is only for the most refined palates."
msgstr "Только истинные гурманы по достоинству оценят лакрицу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_5"
msgid "The closest thing I've found to an after dinner mint."
msgstr "Самое близкое к мятным конфеткам из всего, что я смог найти."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_6"
msgid "I don't think those are fit to eat."
msgstr "Не думаю, что их можно есть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_7"
msgid "Real raisins! Think of the culinary potential."
msgstr "Настоящий изюм! Сколько всего с ним можно приготовить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_8"
msgid "I don't need the whole thing, just a couple licks."
msgstr "Мне хватит пару раз лизнуть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_9"
msgid "I wouldn't want to ruin my dinner."
msgstr "Не хочу перебивать аппетит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_BRAVERY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_BRAVERY"
msgid "I'm not convinced I want to drink it."
msgstr "Не уверен, что хочу это выпить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_POTENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_POTENT"
msgid "Oof, smells strong."
msgstr "Ох, какой сильный запах."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_WEAK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_WEAK"
msgid "I don't think it'll do much."
msgstr "Не думаю, что от него есть особый эффект."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_FIRE_FX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_FIRE_FX"
msgid "The fire has caramelized."
msgstr "Карамелизированный огонь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_MOON"
msgid "I wouldn't drink that, mon ami."
msgstr "Я бы не стал это пить, mon ami."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_1"
msgid "Fear upsets my stomach."
msgstr "У меня расстройство желудка от страха."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_2"
msgid "Its wings are so... leathery."
msgstr "Такие… кожистые крылья."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_3"
msgid "I'm afraid to touch it."
msgstr "Боюсь к этому прикасаться."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_4"
msgid "I miss calamari."
msgstr "Скучаю по кальмарам."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_5"
msgid "How creepy."
msgstr "Жуть какая."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_6"
msgid "I'd rather not eat crow."
msgstr "Не хочу есть ворон."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HAMBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HAMBAT"
msgid "Mmm, ham popsicle!"
msgstr "М-м-м, ветчина на палочке!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HAMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HAMMER"
msgid "For tenderizing boeuf!"
msgstr "Чтобы сделать мясо нежнее!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HAMMER_MJOLNIR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HAMMER_MJOLNIR"
msgid "It's a heavy duty tenderizer."
msgstr "Как же этим можно мясо-то отбить?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL"
msgid "Soft and dense, like a well-baked loaf of bread."
msgstr "Мягкая и пышная, словно свежеиспеченный хлеб."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_KELP"
msgid "Wet and unpleasant, like an old spinach salad."
msgstr "Водянистая и мерзкая, прямо как салат со шпинатом не первой свежести."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_PETALS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_PETALS"
msgid "Light and airy, like a soufflé."
msgstr "Легкая и воздушная, словно суфле."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_STEELWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_STEELWOOL"
msgid "Stiff and scratchy, like a terrible biscotti."
msgstr "Жесткая и шершавая, как сухарь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HAREBALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HAREBALL"
msgid "The thought of anyone eating this wounds me deeply."
msgstr "От одной мысли, что это кто-то съест, как ножом по сердцу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HAWAIIANSHIRT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HAWAIIANSHIRT"
msgid "When in Rome..."
msgstr "С волками жить…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE"
msgid "Soothing."
msgstr "Успокаивает."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE_ACID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE_ACID"
msgid "The worse it smells, the better it works?"
msgstr "Чем хуже пахнет, тем лучше лечит, да?.."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSTAFF"
msgid "I like this."
msgstr "Мне нравится."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.COLD"
msgid "Still cold."
msgstr "Все еще холодный."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.FROZEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.FROZEN"
msgid "Vanilla ice."
msgstr "Ванильный лед."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.GENERIC"
msgid "A temperature stone."
msgstr "Температурный камень."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.HOT"
msgid "Hot!"
msgstr "Горячо!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.WARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.WARM"
msgid "It's warming up nicely."
msgstr "Он приятно нагревается."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND"
msgid "Alors, some things in life are not as rosy as they seem."
msgstr "Alors, где роза, там и шип."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND_BUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND_BUSH"
msgid "Ah, la vie en rose."
msgstr "О, la vie en rose — жизнь в розовом цвете."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB"
msgid "She's all alone..."
msgstr "Совсем одна…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATION_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATION_KIT"
msgid "I hope Madame Pearl will like her new home."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.BUILTUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.BUILTUP"
msgid "I hope she's a bit more comfortable in there now."
msgstr "Надеюсь, теперь ей поуютней."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "That poor old woman... living here all on her own..."
msgstr "Бедная старушка… живет тут совсем одна…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE"
msgid "Not to complain, but I would have preferred a nice edible arrangement."
msgstr "Я не жалуюсь, конечно, но мне куда больше пригодилось бы что-нибудь съедобное."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE_SHELLS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE_SHELLS"
msgid "A shell stuffed with shells."
msgstr "Ракушка с начинкой из ракушек."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_CRACKED_PEARL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_CRACKED_PEARL"
msgid "Oh... oh dear..."
msgstr "Ой. О нет…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_PEARL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_PEARL"
msgid "Madame Pearl entrusted it to me."
msgstr "Мадам Жемчужина мне ее доверила."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HIVEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HIVEHAT"
msgid "The stickiness is mostly gone. Mostly."
msgstr "Уже почти не липкая. Почти."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HOME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HOME"
msgid "Who lives here?"
msgstr "Кто здесь живет?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.BURNT"
msgid "Overcooked."
msgstr "Пережарили."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.GENERIC"
msgid "What's the use in a sign around here?"
msgstr "Зачем тут вообще нужен знак?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.UNWRITTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.UNWRITTEN"
msgid "I'll write a nice note for the next person."
msgstr "Напишу что-нибудь хорошее."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HONEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HONEY"
msgid "Nectar of the gods!"
msgstr "Нектар богов!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HONEYCOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HONEYCOMB"
msgid "Just add milk!"
msgstr "Просто добавь молока!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HONEYHAM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HONEYHAM"
msgid "Comfort food!"
msgstr "Заедаем стресс!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HONEYNUGGETS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HONEYNUGGETS"
msgid "Junk food is my guilty pleasure. Shh!"
msgstr "Фастфуд — моя постыдная слабость. Ш-ш!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HORN"
msgid "There's still some hairs inside."
msgstr "Там все еще шерсть внутри."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HORRORFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HORRORFUEL"
msgid "It makes my teeth chatter."
msgstr "У меня от него зубы стучат."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HOTCHILI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HOTCHILI"
msgid "Spice up my life!"
msgstr "Добавь остроты в мою жизнь!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.BOMBED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.BOMBED"
msgid "What a nice aroma."
msgstr "Какой приятный запах."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.EMPTY"
msgid "An empty basin."
msgstr "Пустая ванна."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GENERIC"
msgid "Ah, if only I had time for a nice soak."
msgstr "Жаль, у меня нет времени поваляться в воде."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GLASS"
msgid "It looks quite pretty in the moonlight, non?"
msgstr "Как красиво смотрится в лунном свете."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HOUND"
msgid "Angry chien!"
msgstr "Злой пес!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HOUNDBONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HOUNDBONE"
msgid "Hmm, soup stock..."
msgstr "Хм-м, бульон для супа…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "I'm afraid it's for the best."
msgstr "Боюсь, это к лучшему."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "What a terrible sight!"
msgstr "Ужасное зрелище!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "It sprung back to life!"
msgstr "Она вернулась к жизни!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HOUNDMOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HOUNDMOUND"
msgid "It smells wet."
msgstr "Пахнет сыростью."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH"
msgid "Better to lose a tooth than your tongue!"
msgstr "Лучше остаться без зуба, чем без языка!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH_BLOWPIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH_BLOWPIPE"
msgid "Les dents will make a dent!"
msgstr "Сразу захотелось поработать зубами."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HOUNDWHISTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HOUNDWHISTLE"
msgid "I think I'm too old to hear it."
msgstr "Думаю, я слишком стар, чтобы это расслышать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HUMANMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HUMANMEAT"
msgid "I suppose I can't be picky with my ingredients, but..."
msgstr "Я понимаю, что не время привередничать в плане ингредиентов…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HUMANMEAT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HUMANMEAT_COOKED"
msgid "Some dishes probably shouldn't be made."
msgstr "Некоторые блюда не стоит готовить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HUMANMEAT_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HUMANMEAT_DRIED"
msgid "I think I've lost my appetite."
msgstr "Кажется, у меня пропал аппетит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HUTCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HUTCH"
msgid "Just my cute little breadbox."
msgstr "Моя маленькая милая хлебница."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.GENERIC"
msgid "He's a cheery little fishstick."
msgstr "Какая веселая рыбная палочка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.WAITING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.WAITING"
msgid "He's missing his other half."
msgstr "Потерял свою вторую половину."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ICE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ICE"
msgid "That's ice."
msgstr "Какая прохладная встреча."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.GENERIC"
msgid "Iceberg ahead!"
msgstr "Айсберг прямо по курсу!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.MELTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.MELTED"
msgid "Melted like butter!"
msgstr "Растаял как масло!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG_MELTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG_MELTED"
msgid "Melted like butter!"
msgstr "Растаял как масло!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ICEBOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ICEBOX"
msgid "The ice box, my second-most loyal culinary companion."
msgstr "Холодильник — мой второй по значимости верный кулинарный компаньон."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ICECREAM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ICECREAM"
msgid "The heat is sweetly beat!"
msgstr "Сладкая победа над жарой!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ICEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ICEHAT"
msgid "Must I wear it?"
msgstr "Должен ли я ее носить?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ICEHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ICEHOUND"
msgid "Away, frozen diable!"
msgstr "Прочь, ледяной дьявол!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ICEPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ICEPACK"
msgid "Now this I can use!"
msgstr "А вот это мне пригодится!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF"
msgid "It flash freezes poulet!"
msgstr "Он заморозит цыпленка в один момент!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ICE_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ICE_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "Frozen beef? I suppose I'll have to make do."
msgstr "Замороженная говядина? Что ж, придется работать с тем, что есть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.ACTIVE"
msgid "And I'm in!"
msgstr "А вот и я!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.INACTIVE"
msgid "Do not lick it. Your tongue will get stuck."
msgstr "Не лизать. А то язык прилипнет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESBOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESBOX"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESBOX2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESBOX2"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESHAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESHAT.GENERIC"
msgid "Winona cooked it up with some help from that strange gentleman."
msgstr "Вайнона состряпала его не без помощи загадочного джентльмена."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESHAT.MISSINGSKILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESHAT.MISSINGSKILL"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.INSPECTSELF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.INSPECTSELF"
msgid "What a tasty dish!"
msgstr "Какая вкуснятина!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.IPECACSYRUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.IPECACSYRUP"
msgid "I must respectfully decline."
msgstr "Вынужден отказаться."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.IVY_SNARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.IVY_SNARE"
msgid "It's trying to get between me and my ingredients!"
msgstr "Не смей вставать между мной и моими ингредиентами!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.JAMMYPRESERVES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.JAMMYPRESERVES"
msgid "Simple, sweet, parfait."
msgstr "Просто, сладко, превосходно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.JELLYBEAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.JELLYBEAN"
msgid "A little something sweet to brighten the day."
msgstr "Сладкое улучшает настроение."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE"
msgid "Perhaps there is something delicious hiding in its center?"
msgstr "Может, в глубине завалялось что-нибудь вкусненькое?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG"
msgid "It could topple over any minute!"
msgstr "Да она сейчас развалится!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.JUSTEGGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.JUSTEGGS"
msgid "If only I had a bit of cheese, perhaps some chives..."
msgstr "Приправить бы его еще сыром или зеленым луком..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KABOBS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KABOBS"
msgid "Opa!"
msgstr "Оп-па!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KELP"
msgid "Salad of the sea!"
msgstr "Морской салат!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KELPHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KELPHAT"
msgid "I'd rather have this in a broth than on my head."
msgstr "Лучше сделать из этого бульон, чем цеплять на голову."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KELP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KELP_COOKED"
msgid "This... could be a bit better."
msgstr "Ну… Можно быть и повкуснее."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KELP_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KELP_DRIED"
msgid "Ah, crispy!"
msgstr "О, хрустит!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.GENERIC"
msgid "Almost not worth the honey!"
msgstr "Почти не стоит меда!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.HELD"
msgid "So sassy!"
msgstr "Такая нахальная!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.BURNT"
msgid "Mon dieu, I knew I smelled something burning!"
msgstr "Mon dieu, так и знал, что что-то подгорело!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.GENERIC"
msgid "A plaything for les petits chats."
msgstr "Игрушка для petits chats."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1_KIT"
msgid "Nearly done."
msgstr "Почти готово."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.BURNT"
msgid "Ah. I don't think that was meant to be cooked."
msgstr "Ой. Термообработка тут была лишней."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.GENERIC"
msgid "They must work up quite an appetite playing all day."
msgstr "От игр на свежем воздухе они нагуливают прекрасный аппетит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2_KIT"
msgid "Now, to put the ingredients together."
msgstr "А теперь соединим все ингредиенты."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.BURNT"
msgid "Burnt to a crisp."
msgstr "До хрустящей корочки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.GENERIC"
msgid "Bonjour! Is anyone home?"
msgstr "Bonjour! Кто-нибудь дома?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK"
msgid "I don't think they're hiding in there."
msgstr "По-моему, здесь никто не прячется."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK_TIME_ALMOST_UP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK_TIME_ALMOST_UP"
msgid "My time is almost up, where could they be?"
msgstr "Время почти вышло! Где же они могут быть?.."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN_KIT"
msgid "I'll whip it together tout de suite."
msgstr "Соберу эту штуку tout de suite."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DECIDUOUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DECIDUOUS"
msgid "Bonjour petit chat!"
msgstr "Bonjour, petit chat!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DESERT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DESERT"
msgid "You're so sweet, I could just eat you up!"
msgstr "Ты такой сладенький, так бы тебя и съел!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_FOREST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_FOREST"
msgid "Bonjour petit chat!"
msgstr "Bonjour, petit chat!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_GRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_GRASS"
msgid "You're so sweet, I could just eat you up!"
msgstr "Ты такой сладенький, так бы тебя и съел!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_MARSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_MARSH"
msgid "Bonjour petit chat!"
msgstr "Bonjour, petit chat!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_MOON"
msgid "You're so sweet, I could just eat you up!"
msgstr "Ты такой сладенький, так бы тебя и съел!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_NAMETAG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_NAMETAG"
msgid "What shall I call you, mes petits chats?"
msgstr "Как бы мне вас назвать, мои petits chats?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_ROCKY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_ROCKY"
msgid "You're so sweet, I could just eat you up!"
msgstr "Ты такой сладенький, так бы тебя и съел!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_SAVANNA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_SAVANNA"
msgid "Bonjour petit chat!"
msgstr "Bonjour, petit chat!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_YOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_YOT"
msgid "You're so sweet, I could just eat you up!"
msgstr "Ты такой сладенький, так бы тебя и съел!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KLAUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KLAUS"
msgid "He doesn't look very jolly."
msgstr "Не навевает он праздничное настроение."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KLAUSSACKKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KLAUSSACKKEY"
msgid "Well, it's the key to something."
msgstr "Это ключ. От чего-то."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KLAUS_SACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KLAUS_SACK"
msgid "There might be all sorts of treats inside."
msgstr "Внутри могут быть какие угодно сладости."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT"
msgid "A tricky cheval!"
msgstr "Эта лошадка с подвохом!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_NIGHTMARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_NIGHTMARE"
msgid "Effroyable!"
msgstr "Просто ужас!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_CARCASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_CARCASS"
msgid "Sadly it is past its expiry date."
msgstr "Увы, он уже просрочен."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_SUMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_SUMMER"
msgid "Ah, you have fattened up nicely!"
msgstr "Как хорошо ты отъелся!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_WINTER"
msgid "You can't get attached to cute cuts of meat."
msgstr "Хорошие мясные вырезки не приедаются."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KOALEFIG_TRUNK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KOALEFIG_TRUNK"
msgid "I might have overdone it with the figs."
msgstr "Кажется, с инжиром я переборщил."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS"
msgid "What the devil!"
msgstr "Что за черт!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS_SACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS_SACK"
msgid "Infinite pocket space!"
msgstr "Бесконечный запас места!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LANTERN"
msgid "It is my night light."
msgstr "Мой свет в ночи."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LATKES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LATKES"
msgid "Some chives, a dollop of sour cream, c'est parfait!"
msgstr "Немного лука, сметаны, c'est parfait!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BATTLESTANDARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BATTLESTANDARD"
msgid "We must destroy it, tout suite!"
msgstr "Его надо уничтожить, tout de suite!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BOARLORD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BOARLORD"
msgid "He's the one who cooked up this whole thing."
msgstr "Это он заварил кашу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEAVYBLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEAVYBLADE"
msgid "Perfect for chopping ingredients, and enemies!"
msgstr "Идеально подходит для нарезки ингредиентов. И врагов!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE"
msgid "That's our way back."
msgstr "Путь назад."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE_FULL"
msgid "Time to leave, oui?"
msgstr "Пора уходить, oui?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LUCY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LUCY"
msgid "Lucy looks a little different, non?"
msgstr "Люси выглядит как-то иначе, non?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.GENERIC"
msgid "One day I'll find the portal that takes me home..."
msgstr "Однажды я найду портал, который вернет меня домой."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.ON"
msgid "Let's go, tout suite!"
msgstr "Вперед, tout de suite!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_SPAWNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_SPAWNER"
msgid "That's where our foes keep coming from!"
msgstr "Вот откуда приходят наши враги!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE"
msgid "You're a pretty cute little sausage link."
msgstr "Какая же ты милая сарделька."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_COCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_COCOON"
msgid "Yuck. I should wash my hands before I prepare food."
msgstr "Фу. Надо сначала помыть руки, а потом уже готовить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG.GENERIC"
msgid "Is its flavor profile comparable to a regular egg?"
msgstr "А как у него вкусовые характеристики по сравнению с обычным?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COLD"
msgid "Are you chilly, ma petite choux-fleur?"
msgstr "Замерзла, ma petite choux-fleur?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COMFY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COMFY"
msgid "Nice and cozy."
msgstr "Мило и уютно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.CONTENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.CONTENT"
msgid "Happy as a deliciously seasoned clam."
msgstr "Довольна как удав. Как раскаленный удав."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.GENERIC"
msgid "She's a fiery little one."
msgstr "Какой живчик."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.HUNGRY"
msgid "You are hungry, non? Let me whip something up."
msgstr "Проголодалась, non? Давай что-нибудь приготовлю."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.STARVING"
msgid "I should cook something for her, fast!"
msgstr "Надо что-нибудь скорее для нее приготовить!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_TOOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_TOOTH"
msgid "It came off my petite fiery friend."
msgstr "Выпал из моей маленькой огненной подружки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.COOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.COOL"
msgid "The top has cooled like a barfy crème brûlée!"
msgstr "Верхушка застыла так, как будто кого-то стошнило крем-брюле!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.HOT"
msgid "A chef-cuisinier never burns his fingers."
msgstr "Шеф-повар никогда не обжигает пальцы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND"
msgid "That looks a little toasty."
msgstr "Сейчас закипит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK"
msgid "Looks like a rock to me."
msgstr "Похоже, этот камушек как раз по мне."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LEAFLOAF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LEAFLOAF"
msgid "A basic recipe, elevated through the use of this strange meat!"
msgstr "Это странное мясо вывело простой рецепт на новый уровень!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATBURGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATBURGER"
msgid "Perhaps this is how we'll convince Mademoiselle Wigfrid to eat her vegetables?"
msgstr "Может, хоть так мы сможем уговорить мадмуазель Вигфрид есть овощи?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATSOUFFLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATSOUFFLE"
msgid "It is certainly... food."
msgstr "Это... съедобно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LEIF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LEIF"
msgid "I'm out of my element!"
msgstr "Чувствую себя не в своей тарелке!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LEIF_IDOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LEIF_IDOL"
msgid "Sometimes it's difficult to say whether he loves or hates trees."
msgstr "Иногда я не понимаю: любит он деревья или все же ненавидит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LEIF_SPARSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LEIF_SPARSE"
msgid "I'm out of my element!"
msgstr "Чувствую себя не в своей тарелке!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LICHEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LICHEN"
msgid "Really scraping the barrel for produce here."
msgstr "Придется поскрести по сусекам, чтобы что-нибудь найти."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LIFEINJECTOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LIFEINJECTOR"
msgid "It's not so bad, if you close your eyes."
msgstr "Если закрыть глаза, то не так и плохо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LIGHTBULB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LIGHTBULB"
msgid "Looks like candy."
msgstr "Похоже на конфетку."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LIGHTCRAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LIGHTCRAB"
msgid "Glowing shellfish... just imagine how beautiful it would look on a plate!"
msgstr "Светящийся краб... только представьте, как красиво он будет смотреться на тарелке!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LIGHTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LIGHTER"
msgid "This is Willow's."
msgstr "Это принадлежит Уиллоу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LIGHTFLIER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LIGHTFLIER"
msgid "Light the way, mon ami!"
msgstr "Освети путь, mon ami!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.CHARGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.CHARGED"
msgid "Goat milkshake!"
msgstr "Козий милкшейк!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.GENERIC"
msgid "I had a goat once."
msgstr "У меня когда-то была козочка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOATHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOATHORN"
msgid "For kabobs, perhaps?"
msgstr "Подойдет для кебабов?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.CHARGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.CHARGED"
msgid "Electricity!"
msgstr "Электричество!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.GENERIC"
msgid "I do feel a bit safer now."
msgstr "Теперь мне немного спокойнее."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LITTLE_WALRUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LITTLE_WALRUS"
msgid "Oh, there's a little one!"
msgstr "О, а это малыш!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LIVINGLOG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LIVINGLOG"
msgid "Magic building blocks!"
msgstr "Волшебные блоки для строительства!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE"
msgid "Tres suspicious..."
msgstr "Весьма подозрительно…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_ROOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_ROOT"
msgid "Edible roots, perhaps?"
msgstr "Может, это съедобные корни?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_SAPLING"
msgid "Just a petite bébé."
msgstr "Просто маленький bébé."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERBISQUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERBISQUE"
msgid "I've truly outdone myself!"
msgstr "Я превзошел самого себя!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERDINNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERDINNER"
msgid "No place is too remote for some fine dining!"
msgstr "Даже в самых отдаленных уголках можно устроить изысканный ужин!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LOG.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LOG.BURNING"
msgid "Soon it won't be good for much."
msgstr "Правда, скоро оно мало для чего пригодится."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LOG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LOG.GENERIC"
msgid "An important aspect of my art."
msgstr "Важный аспект моего искусства."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LORDFRUITFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LORDFRUITFLY"
