#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUCKY_GOLDNUGGET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUCKY_GOLDNUGGET"
msgid "It's nice to have a bit of luck."
msgstr "Немного удачи никогда не помешает."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUCY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUCY"
msgid "Bonjour, mademoiselle."
msgstr "Bonjour, mademoiselle."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUMPY_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUMPY_SAPLING"
msgid "Just a petite bébé."
msgstr "Просто маленький bébé."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUNARFROG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUNARFROG"
msgid "I can't help but wonder how it might taste fried in butter."
msgstr "Не могу отделаться от мысли, какой она будет на вкус, пожаренная в сливочном масле."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANTHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANTHAT"
msgid "An extra layer for my head."
msgstr "Защитный слой для моей головы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_HUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_HUSK"
msgid "Ah, raw ingredients!"
msgstr "О, сырые ингредиенты!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_KIT"
msgid "I usually whip things up from scratch."
msgstr "Не люблю заготовки, предпочитаю все свежее."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_CRYSTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_CRYSTAL"
msgid "Tres beau!"
msgstr "Очень красиво!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_PORTAL"
msgid "Ah, zut! It will not let me through."
msgstr "Ох, zut! Меня на ту сторону не пропустит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT"
msgid "Go away, you plant thief!"
msgstr "Отстань, сорняк-воришка!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT_VINE_END
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT_VINE_END"
msgid "I'm afraid it won't give up without a fight."
msgstr "Боюсь, без боя эта мерзость не сдастся."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE"
msgid "What shall I cook up with this?"
msgstr "Так, ну и что мне тут приготовить?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE_KIT"
msgid "I'll whip it up tout de suite!"
msgstr "Состряпаю все, что нужно, tout de suite!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_GRAZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_GRAZER"
msgid "It's like a living gelatin... but it lacks the sweetness."
msgstr "Будто ожившее желе... только несладкое."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_SEED"
msgid "This is its essence."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANT"
msgid "How alluring."
msgstr "Как соблазнительно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANTBULB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANTBULB"
msgid "Growing meat from the ground? Now I've seen it all..."
msgstr "Выращивать мясо на грядках? Теперь я видел все…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUTEFISK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LUTEFISK"
msgid "A traditional Scandinavian holiday recipe."
msgstr "Традиционный скандинавский праздничный рецепт."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MADSCIENCE_LAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MADSCIENCE_LAB"
msgid "Chemistry is just fancy cooking, non?"
msgstr "Химия по сути своей тоже кулинарная наука, non?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MAGICIAN_CHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MAGICIAN_CHEST"
msgid "Are you certain that whatever you put in there will come back?"
msgstr "А оттуда точно вернется все, что туда положишь?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS"
msgid "Très mal, indeed."
msgstr "Très mal, в самом деле."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_BEAK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_BEAK"
msgid "I'm sure I could find a use for this."
msgstr "Полагаю, я найду для этого применение."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHER"
msgid "\"Alouette, je te plumerai.\""
msgstr "«Alouette, je te plumerai»."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHERED_WEAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHERED_WEAVE"
msgid "This fabric is light as a feather!"
msgstr "Ткань легкая как перышко!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MALE_PUPPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MALE_PUPPET"
msgid "Free him!"
msgstr "Отпусти его!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE"
msgid "Have I discovered a new root vegetable?!"
msgstr "Неужели я нашел новый корнеплод?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKESOUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKESOUP"
msgid "What an otherworldly flavor!"
msgstr "Какой-то потусторонний вкус!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_ACTIVE"
msgid "How chatty you are, hm, bébé?"
msgstr "Какая ты разговорчивая, bébé!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_COOKED"
msgid "Could use... an explanation..."
msgstr "Сюда можно… добавить разъяснений…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_PLANTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_PLANTED"
msgid "I could always use more fresh veg."
msgstr "Никогда не откажусь от свежих овощей."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MANRABBIT_TAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MANRABBIT_TAIL"
msgid "The texture is exceptionally comforting."
msgstr "Фактура очень приятная."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MAPSCROLL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MAPSCROLL"
msgid "A blank map. Full of potential."
msgstr "Чистая карта. Нераскрытый потенциал."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MARBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MARBLE"
msgid "Would make a nice counter top."
msgstr "Хорошая бы получилась столешница."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN"
msgid "I don't think this bean is edible."
msgstr "Не думаю, что этот боб съедобный."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN_SAPLING"
msgid "Just a petite marble bébé."
msgstr "Просто маленький мраморный bébé."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MARBLEPILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MARBLEPILLAR"
msgid "I wonder how many counter tops I could get out of this..."
msgstr "Интересно, сколько кухонных стоек я мог бы из этого сделать…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MARBLESHRUB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MARBLESHRUB"
msgid "If marble beans can grow, maybe they can be eaten."
msgstr "Если мраморные бобы можно вырастить, то, вероятно, их можно и съесть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MARBLETREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MARBLETREE"
msgid "How supremely unnatural!"
msgstr "В высшей степени неестественно!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNING"
msgid "It burns like any other bush."
msgstr "Горит так же, как и любой другой куст."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNT"
msgid "Burned to ash."
msgstr "Сгорел дотла."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.GENERIC"
msgid "A prickly customer."
msgstr "Колкий клиент."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.PICKED"
msgid "Not sure I want to do that again."
msgstr "Не уверен, что я хочу это повторить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT"
msgid "I wonder if it is edible."
msgstr "Интересно, съедобно ли это."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNING"
msgid "You will not be missed."
msgstr "По тебе никто не будет скучать."

