msgstr "Какой ужасный торговец рыбой!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD_LUNAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD_LUNAR"
msgid "The merms have been looking a little... different lately."
msgstr "Тритоны в последнее время какие-то... другие."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD_SHADOW"
msgid "Not exactly a comforting sight..."
msgstr "Не очень приятное зрелище..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERMHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERMHAT"
msgid "Mon dieu, must I dress as a frog?"
msgstr "Mon dieu, а мне обязательно наряжаться в лягушку?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.BURNT"
msgid "I think it needs to burned again! Pee-eew!"
msgstr "Думаю, его нужно еще разок сжечь! Ф-ф-фу-у-у-у-у!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.GENERIC"
msgid "Its odor is not improving with time..."
msgstr "И запах лучше не становится…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.BURNT"
msgid "That fire got the smell out."
msgstr "Этот огонь выжег весь запах."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "Fisherfolk live here. I can smell it."
msgstr "Здесь живут рыбаки. Я прям чую."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.BURNT"
msgid "Quel dommage, she worked so hard on it..."
msgstr "Quel dommage, а она так старалась…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.GENERIC"
msgid "Oh! It looks... very nice!"
msgstr "О! Выглядит… отлично!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERMKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERMKING"
msgid "A real frog prince!"
msgstr "Настоящий принц-лягушка!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.BURNT"
msgid "The throne has been charbroiled!"
msgstr "Трон обжарили на углях!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.GENERIC"
msgid "Très royal!"
msgstr "Très по-королевски!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.BURNT"
msgid "It's been burnt to a crisp!"
msgstr "Сожжен дотла!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.GENERIC"
msgid "You have all the ingredients you need?"
msgstr "У тебя есть все нужные ингредиенты?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_NOKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_NOKING"
msgid "They don't look so friendly now..."
msgstr "Выглядят не очень дружелюбно…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_REGULAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_REGULAR"
msgid "At least they seem friendly!"
msgstr "По крайней мере, выглядят дружелюбно!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY"
msgid "The fishmongers seem to be doing quite well for themselves."
msgstr "Хорошо живут эти их рыбы-торговцы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY_UPGRADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY_UPGRADED"
msgid "The fishmongers seem to be doing quite well for themselves."
msgstr "Хорошо живут эти их рыбы-торговцы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERM_LUNAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERM_LUNAR"
msgid "The merms have been looking a little... different lately."
msgstr "Тритоны в последнее время какие-то... другие."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERM_PRINCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MERM_PRINCE"
