msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_32"
msgid "I see right through this sort of stuff."
msgstr "Вижу насквозь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_33
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_33"
msgid "It wouldn't go with my look."
msgstr "Не в моем стиле."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_34
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_34"
