msgstr "По-моему, чуток пережарено."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG"
