msgstr "Вот и среднее звено."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.CRITTERLAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.CRITTERLAB"
