msgstr "Хм, куда бы их посадить…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET_RARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET_RARE"
msgid "We wonder what's gonna grow!"
msgstr "Интересно, что из них вырастет?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR"
msgid "Grab onto the sea floor real tight, okay?"
msgstr "Схвати морское дно покрепче, ладно?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR_ITEM"
msgid "That's for making an anchor."
msgstr "Из этого можно сделать якорь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "This makes us sad."
msgstr "Нам от этого очень грустно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "We think it wants burnt stuff!"
msgstr "Кажется, оно хочет что-то сгоревшее!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "We love making things!"
msgstr "Мы любим делать всякие штуки!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTD_OAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTD_OAR"
msgid "We wish our claws were this big."
msgstr "Вот бы нам такие когтищи."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL"
msgid "Can we steer for the race? Pleeeaase?"
msgstr "Можно мы поведем? На одну гонку, ну пожа-а-алуйста!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM"
msgid "That's for making a steering wheel."
msgstr "Из этого можно сделать руль."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD1"
msgid "Yummy!"
msgstr "Вкуснятина!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD2"
msgid "Mmmmmm."
msgstr "М-м-м-м-м-м-м…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD3"
msgid "Smells good."
msgstr "Пахнет вкусно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.GENERAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.GENERAL"
msgid "It makes us feel safe and cozy."
msgstr "В ее свете мы чувствуем себя уютно и безопасно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.OUT"
msgid "We still like it, even without the light!"
msgstr "Она нам нравится даже без огонька!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1_ITEM"
msgid "It'd be a good night light."
msgstr "Из нее выйдет неплохой ночник."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.GENERAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.GENERAL"
msgid "It makes us feel safe and cozy."
msgstr "В ее свете мы чувствуем себя уютно и безопасно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.OUT"
msgid "We still like it, even without the light!"
msgstr "Она нам нравится даже без огонька!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2_ITEM"
msgid "It'd be a good night light."
msgstr "Из нее выйдет неплохой ночник."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.GENERIC"
msgid "Let's start a pillow fight!"
msgstr "Давайте драться подушками!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.PLAYING"
msgid "We want to play too!"
msgstr "Мы тоже хотим поиграть!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_KIT"
msgid "It's okay Ms. Wickerbottom, we'll only be fighting with pillows!"
msgstr "Не переживайте, Мисс Уикерботтом, мы будем драться только подушками!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD1"
msgid "It looks like cake, but it smells like veggies..."
msgstr "Выглядит как торт, а пахнет овощами..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD2"
msgid "Mmm, the moon is tasty!"
msgstr "М-м-м, а луна, оказывается, вкусная!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD3"
msgid "We kinda want to poke it."
msgstr "Мы хотим в него потыкать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD4"
msgid "We can eat one puff, and share the rest with our friends!"
msgstr "Можно съесть один шарик и поделиться остальными с друзьями!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Oh no!"
msgstr "О нет!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "Please don't bite us, we'll find something tastier for you to eat!"
msgstr "Мы найдем для тебя что-нибудь повкуснее, только не кусайся!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "Do you have any fun things for us to play with?"
msgstr "А у тебя есть для нас игрушки?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_TOKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTR_TOKEN"
msgid "We shouldn't start fights... but do pillow fights count?"
msgstr "Теперь мы должны подраться... Бой подушками считается?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.BURNT"
msgid "Aw. It burned."
msgstr "Эх, догорел."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.GENERIC"
msgid "Fancy!"
msgstr "Модно!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST_ITEM"
msgid "We can build it!"
msgstr "Такое мы построим!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "It wasn't us."
msgstr "Это не мы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "What do we give it?"
msgstr "Что бы нам ему дать?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "A surprise for us!"
msgstr "Мы хотим сюрприз!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTS_WORM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOTS_WORM"
msgid "You'll never catch us, worm!"
msgstr "А вот и не поймаешь, червячок!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "I guess not everyone likes catcoons..."
msgstr "Видимо, енотокотов не все любят..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "What could we offer it? Something from a bird?"
msgstr "Что бы нам ему дать? Частичку птички?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "What a nice tribute!"
msgstr "Какое милое святилище!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE_GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE_GENERIC"
msgid "Can we play with it?"
msgstr "А с ним можно играть?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE_PLANTHAPPY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE_PLANTHAPPY"
msgid "A happy plant."
msgstr "Это растение счастливо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSED"
msgid "Aw, this plant doesn't look very happy..."
msgstr "Ой, это растение не кажется счастливым..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORFAMILY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORFAMILY"
msgid "Maybe it would be happier if it wasn't alone?"
msgstr "Может, ему будет лучше рядом с друзьями?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORHAPPINESS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORHAPPINESS"
msgid "Aww, do you need someone to talk to?"
msgstr "Ой, тебе не с кем поговорить?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORKILLJOYS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORKILLJOYS"
msgid "We should do some weeding... even if we don't like to."
msgstr "Надо заняться прополкой... Пусть даже нам это и не нравится."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORMOISTURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORMOISTURE"
msgid "We should give it some water."
msgstr "Нужно его полить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORNUTRIENTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORNUTRIENTS"
msgid "Maybe it needs some better dirt?"
msgstr "Может, ему нужна грязь получше?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSOROVERCROWDING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSOROVERCROWDING"
msgid "We packed too many plants too close together!"
msgstr "Мы посадили здесь слишком много растений!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORSEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORSEASON"
msgid "We don't think it likes this weather very much."
msgstr "Не думаем, что ему по душе эта погода."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE_PLANTVERYSTRESSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE_PLANTVERYSTRESSED"
msgid "This plant looks miserable!"
msgstr "Это растение совсем несчастно!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE_SMOLDERING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE_SMOLDERING"
msgid "Uh-oh. I smell burning!"
msgstr "Ой-ой. Пахнет горелым!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE_TOODARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE_TOODARK"
msgid "All our eyes stopped working!"
msgstr "Наши глаза ничего не видят!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.EAT_FOOD.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.EAT_FOOD.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED"
msgid "What if it hatches in our belly?"
msgstr "А что, если оно вылупится у нас в животе?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.EAT_FOOD.WINTERSFEASTFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.EAT_FOOD.WINTERSFEASTFUEL"
msgid "It... reminds me of mom's cooking..."
msgstr "Напоминает мамину еду…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_LOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_LOSE"
msgid "Don't eat us!"
msgstr "Не ешь нас!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_MEALBURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_MEALBURNT"
msgid "Oh no! We burnt it!"
msgstr "О нет! Сгорело!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_NOTRECIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_NOTRECIPE"
msgid "Oh no! That wasn't a recipe!"
msgstr "О нет! Неправильный рецепт!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_WIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_WIN"
msgid "I'm ready to go home now!"
msgstr "Я готов идти домой!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.WENDY_SKILLTREE_EASTEREGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.WENDY_SKILLTREE_EASTEREGG"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr "only_used_by_wendy"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.CARNIVAL_HOST_HERE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.CARNIVAL_HOST_HERE"
msgid "Mr. Raven? Are you here?"
msgstr "Мистер Ворон? Вы здесь?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.EMPTY_CATCOONDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.EMPTY_CATCOONDEN"
msgid "Abandoned. Left to the flies."
msgstr "Теперь это приют для червей и мух."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.HOSTBUSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.HOSTBUSY"
msgid "I suppose he has more important things to do."
msgstr "Полагаю, у него есть дела поважнее."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDERS"
msgid "If we play now, they will stand no chance at winning."
msgstr "Если начать игру сейчас, у них не будет шансов на победу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDING_SPOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDING_SPOTS"
msgid "If we play now, they won't find a place to hide."
msgstr "Если начать игру сейчас, им негде будет прятаться."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_ONE_GAME_PER_DAY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_ONE_GAME_PER_DAY"
msgid "If we play more, Abigail will get tired."
msgstr "Абигейл устала и не хочет больше играть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.LOCKED_GATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.LOCKED_GATE"
msgid "I can't open it without a key."
msgstr "Я не могу открыть это без ключа."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.MANNEQUIN_EQUIPSWAPFAILED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.MANNEQUIN_EQUIPSWAPFAILED"
msgid "No. That would be silly."
msgstr "Ну нет, это как-то глупо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOCARNIVAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOCARNIVAL"
msgid "The ravens have deserted this place... I think I'll miss them."
msgstr "Вороны улетели отсюда... Я буду по ним скучать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOKELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOKELP"
msgid "only_used_by_wurt"
msgstr "only_used_by_wurt"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMERM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMERM"
msgid "They only answer to Wurt."
msgstr "Они слушаются только Вурт."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMYBERNIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMYBERNIE"
msgid "It's doing what it does best."
msgstr "Он делает то, что умеет лучше всего."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.PILLOWFIGHT_NO_HANDPILLOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.PILLOWFIGHT_NO_HANDPILLOW"
msgid "I don't even have a pillow to fight with..."
msgstr "У меня даже подушки нет..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYELIXIR.NO_ELIXIRABLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYELIXIR.NO_ELIXIRABLE"
msgid "I need Abby's flower to pour it on."
msgstr "Нужно полить им цветок Аби."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYELIXIR.TOO_SUPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYELIXIR.TOO_SUPER"
msgid "It's too much."
msgstr "Это уже слишком."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYMODULE.COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYMODULE.COOLDOWN"
msgid "only_used_by_wx78"
msgstr "only_used_by_wx78"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYMODULE.NOTENOUGHSLOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYMODULE.NOTENOUGHSLOTS"
msgid "only_used_by_wx78"
msgstr "only_used_by_wx78"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.APPRAISE.NOTNOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.APPRAISE.NOTNOW"
msgid "Oh. I suppose he's too busy..."
msgstr "О. Полагаю, он слишком занят..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.ATTUNE.NOHEALTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.ATTUNE.NOHEALTH"
msgid "I can't... I don't feel so good..."
msgstr "Я не могу… Мне нехорошо…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.ALREADY_BOMBED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.ALREADY_BOMBED"
msgid "It's already been done."
msgstr "Все уже случилось."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.GLASSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.GLASSED"
msgid "It's covered in glass..."
msgstr "Все покрыто стеклом…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.BEGIN_QUEST.ONEGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.BEGIN_QUEST.ONEGHOST"
msgid "I can only ferry one soul to their destination at a time..."
msgstr "Я могу взять с собой только одну душу за раз…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.BUSY_STATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.BUSY_STATION"
msgid "I have to wait."
msgstr "Придется ждать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.HASPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.HASPET"
msgid "I can only have one..."
msgstr "У меня может быть только один…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.MOUNTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.MOUNTED"
msgid "I can't place that from this lofty position."
msgstr "Слишком высоко, не могу поставить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.TICOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.TICOON"
msgid "The more friends you have, the shallower they are."
msgstr "Чем больше у тебя друзей, тем меньше им можно доверять."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.CARNIVALGAME_FEED.TOO_LATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.CARNIVALGAME_FEED.TOO_LATE"
msgid "I was too late..."
msgstr "Я опоздала..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.CARVEPUMPKIN.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.CARVEPUMPKIN.BURNING"
msgid "It's burning."
msgstr "Она горит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ACTIONFAIL.CARVEPUMPKIN.INUSE
