msgstr "Минералоядный брюхоногий моллюск."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHAT"
