#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTERHAT"
msgid "It's not warm enough for my liking."
msgstr "Как по мне, недостаточно теплая."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.BURNT"
msgid "If you'd measured fire, maybe you woulda been prepared!"
msgstr "Если бы ты умел измерять огонь, он бы тебя не убил!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.GENERIC"
msgid "It would be better if it measured fire."
msgstr "Лучше бы им можно было измерить огонь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTFUEL"
msgid "Reminds me of sitting by the fire on cold winter nights."
msgstr "Напоминает о долгих зимних вечерах у камина."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.ALMOST_DONE_COOKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.ALMOST_DONE_COOKING"
msgid "Is it done yet?!"
msgstr "Ну что, не готово там еще?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.COOKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.COOKING"
msgid "Ugh, this is the most boring part."
msgstr "Самая скучная часть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.DISH_READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.DISH_READY"
msgid "Mmmm, you can still taste the fire!"
msgstr "М-м-м, все еще пахнет огнем!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm on board with anything that involves fire."
msgstr "Если там есть огонь, то я — за."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD1"
msgid "Honestly, who DOESN'T eat the head first?"
msgstr "А теперь честно, кто НЕ откусывает голову в первую очередь?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD2"
msgid "Doesn't look too bad, considering!"
msgstr "В общем, выглядит неплохо!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD3"
msgid "Gimme two of 'em and I can do a MacTusk impression."
msgstr "Дайте мне две таких, и я буду похожа на МакБивня."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD4"
msgid "Anyone else sense the overpowering stench of evil?"
msgstr "Я что, одна ощущаю запах непреодолимого зла?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD5"
msgid "A log for eating, not for burning."
msgstr "Полено, чтобы есть, а не жечь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD6"
msgid "I'm gonna totally stuff my face!!"
msgstr "Я просто нырну в него лицом!!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD7"
msgid "Sure beats rainwater!"
msgstr "Точно, на вкус как дождик!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD8"
msgid "I only like it when it's SCALDING."
msgstr "Вкуснее, когда оно ОБЖИГАЮЩЕ горячее."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD9"
msgid "Who knew stuff from a bird's butt could be so tasty?"
msgstr "Кто знал, что нечто из птичьей задницы может быть таким вкусным?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENT"
msgid "Bibble-ty bauble-ty boo!"
msgstr "Бу-сы пове-сили, крибле-крабле-бумс!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTBOSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTBOSS"
msgid "Woah, shiny! Nice!"
msgstr "Ух ты, блестит! Здорово!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTFORGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTFORGE"
msgid "I should toast this over an open fire."
msgstr "Это стоит поджарить на открытом огне."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTGORGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTGORGE"
msgid "So cute I don't even wanna burn it."
msgstr "Так мило, что даже не хочется сжигать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTLIGHT"
msgid "It's like a fire, but without the burning!"
msgstr "Почти как огонь, только без поджигания!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNING"
msgid "Now we're celebrating!"
msgstr "А вот теперь можно праздновать!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNT"
msgid "Happy Winter's Feast, everybody."
msgstr "Всем счастливого Зимнего пира."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.CANDECORATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.CANDECORATE"
msgid "Looks great!"
msgstr "Выглядит отлично."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.YOUNG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.YOUNG"
msgid "It's a bit shrimpy."
msgstr "Оно еще не совсем окрепшее."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.BURNT"
msgid "Happy Winter's Feast, everybody."
msgstr "Всем счастливого Зимнего пира."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.GENERIC"
msgid "Are we gonna grow a tree?"
msgstr "Мы собираемся вырастить дерево?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_DEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_DEN"
msgid "Come on out little guys, I just want to roast ya!"
msgstr "Вылезайте, ребята, а я вас поджарю!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_MOONGLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_MOONGLASS"
msgid "They still taste the same, right? Right...?"
msgstr "Вкус-то у них не изменился, да?.."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER"
msgid "I could go for some flame-roasted wobster."
msgstr "Я бы не отказалась от вобстера на гриле."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD"
msgid "Edible in a pinch."
msgstr "Можно слопать по кусочку."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD_COOKED"
msgid "Lobster for dinner! Pinch me!"
msgstr "Лобстер на ужин! Ущипните меня!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOBYBIG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOBYBIG.1"
msgid "She's just a big pushover."
msgstr "Ты просто большая трусишка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOBYBIG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOBYBIG.2"
msgid "She's just a big pushover."
msgstr "Ты просто большая трусишка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOBYSMALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOBYSMALL.1"
msgid "She's a smelly, weird little dog. I like her!"
msgstr "Маленькая вонючая псинка. А ты мне нравишься!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOBYSMALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOBYSMALL.2"
msgid "She's a smelly, weird little dog. I like her!"
msgstr "Маленькая вонючая псинка. А ты мне нравишься!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOBY_TREAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOBY_TREAT"
msgid "Honestly, I've eaten worse."
msgstr "Честно, я пробовала еду и похуже."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s! Take it easy, big guy!"
msgstr "%s! Полегче, здоровяк!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Don't hurt yourself, big guy."
msgstr "Не обожгись, здоровяк."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GENERIC"
msgid "Hi %s!"
msgstr "Привет, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GHOST"
msgid "Hey %s, did you know the heart's a muscle?"
msgstr "Эй, %s, а ты знал, что сердце — это мышца?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.MURDERER"
msgid "Burn the murderer!"
msgstr "Сжечь убийцу!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.REVIVER"
msgid "Woah! %s ripped a spirit straight out of the afterlife!"
msgstr "Ого! Дух %s прямо-таки вырвало из загробной жизни!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG_WHISTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG_WHISTLE"
msgid "I can't NOT listen to him when he's holding a shiny whistle!"
msgstr "Меня БЕСИТ, когда он командует и размахивает свистком!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.ATTACKER"
msgid "Careful, I think it's rabid!"
msgstr "Осторожно! По-моему, у него бешенство!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Heh. Good monkey."
msgstr "Ха. Хорошая обезьянка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GENERIC"
msgid "I swear this monkey's following me."
msgstr "Клянусь, эта обезьяна меня преследует."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GHOST"
msgid "What happened? Did you fall out of a tree?"
msgstr "Что случилось? Ты упал с дерева?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.MURDERER"
msgid "That thing's dangerous! Burn it!"
msgstr "Эта тварь опасна! Сжечь ее!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.REVIVER"
msgid "You're pretty smart for a stinky monkey."
msgstr "А мозги-то у тебя на месте, хоть ты и грязная обезьяна."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOODCARVEDHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOODCARVEDHAT"
msgid "Oooh, what a flammable- I mean, fancy hat!"
msgstr "Такая шапка будет отлично гореть... то есть, сидеть!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.ATTACKER"
msgid "You're only fueling the fire, %s!"
msgstr "Ты только подливаешь масло в огонь, %s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVER"
msgid "Calm down, %s. Wanna borrow Bernie?"
