#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND.4"
