#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.SEED_MED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.SEED_MED"
