msgstr "Нет, не мое — вот и трогать не буду."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUCKY_GOLDNUGGET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUCKY_GOLDNUGGET"
msgid "I could use a bit of prosperity."
msgstr "Можно использовать для будущего процветания."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUCY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUCY"
msgid "You're alright for an axe."
msgstr "Для топора ты очень даже ничего."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUMPY_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUMPY_SAPLING"
msgid "I don't know how it got here, but good on it."
msgstr "Я не знаю, как оно сюда попало, но хорошо, что попало."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNARFROG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNARFROG"
msgid "Hop along now, lil' freakshow."
msgstr "Скачи отсюда, страшилище."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANTHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANTHAT"
msgid "It should keep my noggin' nice and safe."
msgstr "Хорошая защита для моего котелка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_HUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_HUSK"
msgid "That's tough stuff!"
msgstr "Прочная штуковина!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_KIT"
msgid "Never hurts to keep a repair kit handy."
msgstr "Ремкомплект нужно держать под рукой."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_CRYSTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_CRYSTAL"
msgid "It's about the prettiest tripping hazard you'll ever see."
msgstr "Самое прекрасное препятствие, которое только можно представить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_PORTAL"
msgid "That tear's a bit beyond what my trusty tape can fix."
msgstr "Изолентой такую прореху не залепить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT"
msgid "It thinks this is its turf!"
msgstr "Это растение думает, что дерн принадлежит только ему!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT_VINE_END
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT_VINE_END"
msgid "You think you wanna tangle with me?"
msgstr "Ты правда хочешь со мной сцепиться?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE"
msgid "It's givin' me some bright ideas."
msgstr "У меня есть несколько блестящих идей..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE_KIT"
msgid "Let's get this thing up and running!"
msgstr "Ну что, подготовим эту штуковину к работе?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_GRAZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_GRAZER"
msgid "I'm not about to let it catch me sleepin'!"
msgstr "Никакого сна на рабочем месте!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_SEED"
msgid "We busted'em down to the baubles."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANT"
msgid "That doesn't look right at all."
msgstr "Кажется, что-то совсем не так."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANTBULB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANTBULB"
msgid "That is not a comforting texture!"
msgstr "Текстура не больно-то успокаивает!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUTEFISK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LUTEFISK"
msgid "That doesn't look half bad!"
msgstr "Выглядит более чем вкусно!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MADSCIENCE_LAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MADSCIENCE_LAB"
msgid "I can do some experimentin' with that."
msgstr "Тут можно заняться экспериментами."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MAGICIAN_CHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MAGICIAN_CHEST"
msgid "I dunno if I want to stick my hand in there."
msgstr "Что-то неохота туда руки совать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS"
msgid "Yeesh, you're a big fella!"
msgstr "Ух, ну и огромная же птица."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_BEAK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_BEAK"
msgid "How come I got left to pick up the bill? Ha!"
msgstr "Вот тут-то жареный петух меня и клюнул, ха."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHER"
msgid "I'll find a practical use for this."
msgstr "Я найду ему применение."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHERED_WEAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHERED_WEAVE"
msgid "Now that's some fancy fabric."
msgstr "Вот это всем тканям ткань."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MALE_PUPPET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MALE_PUPPET"
msgid "He doesn't look none too happy."
msgstr "Он совсем не выглядит счастливым."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE"
msgid "Dead as a doornail."
msgstr "Пациент скорее мертв, чем мертв."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKESOUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKESOUP"
msgid "It's vegetable soup, now."
msgstr "А теперь это овощной суп."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_ACTIVE"
msgid "This is exactly what having a little sister's like."
msgstr "Это совсем как иметь младшую сестру."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_COOKED"
msgid "Dead as several doornails."
msgstr "Мертвецки мертв."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_PLANTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_PLANTED"
msgid "That's a weird shrub."
msgstr "Какой-то странный куст."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MANRABBIT_TAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MANRABBIT_TAIL"
msgid "This piece fell off. Shoddy craftsmanship."
msgstr "А эта часть отвалилась. Обычная фальшивка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MAPSCROLL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MAPSCROLL"
msgid "There's nothin' on it."
msgstr "Тут ничего нет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARBLE"
msgid "This marble's real fancy."
msgstr "Этот кусок мрамора очень даже ничего."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN"
msgid "That couldn't possibly work."
msgstr "Это вообще не работает."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN_SAPLING"
msgid "Uh, it's growing? Maybe?"
msgstr "Оно… растет? Чего?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARBLEPILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARBLEPILLAR"
msgid "Fancy."
msgstr "Красиво."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARBLESHRUB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARBLESHRUB"
msgid "That came in pretty nicely."
msgstr "Получилось довольно мило."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARBLETREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARBLETREE"
msgid "How does that work?"
msgstr "Как вообще это работает?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNING"
msgid "It's on fire."
msgstr "Оно горит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNT"
msgid "Nothin' but cinders."
msgstr "Остался один лишь пепел."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.GENERIC"
msgid "Gnarly little bush."
msgstr "Шишковатый маленький куст."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.PICKED"
msgid "Gotta wait a bit."
msgstr "Надо маленько подождать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT"
