msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.GENERIC"
msgid "Wouldn't want to take a sip of that stuff."
msgstr "Не горю желанием пробовать это на вкус."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.SPOILED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.SPOILED"
msgid "That looks like some strong stuff."
msgstr "Выглядит ядрено."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.STALE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.STALE"
msgid "This stuff sure takes a while to do its thing."
msgstr "Долго же оно там варится."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER_FERMENTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER_FERMENTED"
msgid "I don't think it can smell any worse, must mean it's done!"
msgstr "Не уверена, что оно может вонять еще хуже. Наверное, готово!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPAT"
msgid "Looks like the old foreman. Ha!"
msgstr "Выглядит, как пожилой начальник цеха. Ха!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPEAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPEAR"
msgid "So crude."
msgstr "Такой грубый."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_GUNGNIR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_GUNGNIR"
msgid "Pretty snazzy weapon there!"
msgstr "Оружие — просто шик!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_LANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_LANCE"
msgid "Check out this drill bit!"
msgstr "Вы только гляньте на это сверло!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR"
msgid "This would never pass inspection."
msgstr "Он никогда не пройдет проверку."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR_LIGHTNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR_LIGHTNING"
msgid "A lightning spear? What will they think of next?"
msgstr "Копье с молниями? До чего еще они додумаются?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPICEPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPICEPACK"
msgid "Say, this is some fine bit of engineering!"
msgstr "Какая тонкая инженерная работа!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPICE_CHILI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPICE_CHILI"
msgid "Just smelling it is making my eyes water."
msgstr "У меня от одного запаха глаза слезятся."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPICE_GARLIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPICE_GARLIC"
msgid "Hooboy. That's some smelly dust."
msgstr "Ух! Вот это запашок!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SALT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SALT"
msgid "I could really go for some potato chips."
msgstr "Сейчас бы чипсов пожевать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SUGAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SUGAR"
msgid "Now all I need is some pancakes to pour this over."
msgstr "Осталось только оладий напечь и полить сверху."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.DEAD"
msgid "No sleeping on the job!"
msgstr "Не спать на рабочем месте!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.GENERIC"
msgid "I don't like you."
msgstr "Ты мне не нравишься."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.SLEEPING"
msgid "Get back to work!"
msgstr "Возвращаемся к работе!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN"
msgid "I'd rather not mess with that."
msgstr "Я не стану впутываться в это."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN_BEDAZZLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN_BEDAZZLER"
msgid "Doing some home improvements, kiddo?"
msgstr "Обустраиваешься тут, парниша?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDEREGGSACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDEREGGSACK"
msgid "I think it'd be unwise to plant this."
msgstr "Думаю, будет глупо сажать это."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERGLAND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERGLAND"
msgid "Ha! How indecent."
msgstr "Ха! Как неприлично."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHAT"
msgid "This is disgusting."
msgstr "Это отвратительно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE"
msgid "A rock filled with spiders. Great."
msgstr "В этой скале полно пауков. Отлично."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE_ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE_ROCK"
msgid "A rock filled with spiders. Great."
msgstr "В этой скале полно пауков. Отлично."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEEN"
msgid "Better stay out of her way."
msgstr "Лучше держаться подальше от нее."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_DROPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_DROPPER"
msgid "That's a nasty looking spider!"
msgstr "Какой противный вид у этого паука!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER"
msgid "You're a real stinker, you know that?"
msgstr "Ты в курсе, что от тебя за километр несет?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER_ITEM"
msgid "Doesn't look like good eatin' to me."
msgstr "По-моему, для людей это несъедобно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HIDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HIDER"
msgid "You know I can see you, right?"
msgstr "Ты ведь знаешь, что я вижу тебя, да?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.DEAD"
msgid "Don't get back up."
msgstr "Вот таким и оставайся."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.GENERIC"
msgid "Urgh! What's wrong with it??"
msgstr "Черт, да что с тобой не так?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.SLEEPING"
msgid "Down and out. For now."
msgstr "В отключке, но ненадолго."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_REPELLENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_REPELLENT"
msgid "Guess it can only be used by a spider specialist."
msgstr "Видимо, использовать ее может только специалист по паукам."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_SPITTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_SPITTER"
msgid "Pfft, I can spit further than that!"
msgstr "Пф-ф-ф, я плюну дальше, чем ты!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.DEAD"
msgid "It's just trying to get out of work."
msgstr "Это просто попытка сбежать от работы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.GENERIC"
msgid "You'll look better on the underside of my workboot."
msgstr "Ты будешь выглядеть лучше под подошвой моих ботинок."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.SLEEPING"
msgid "Lazy spider."
msgstr "Ленивый паук."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WATER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WATER"
msgid "You and your creepy long legs better stay far away from me!"
msgstr "Держи свои мерзкие длинные лапы от меня подальше!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WHISTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WHISTLE"
msgid "Sure wish that kid would hang around a better crowd."
msgstr "Жаль, что пацану больше не с кем тут поговорить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FISH"
msgid "Such a shame to let good food go to waste."
msgstr "Какая жалость, хорошая ведь была еда."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FOOD"
msgid "Wouldn't touch that with a ten foot pole."
msgstr "Не стала бы трогать это даже десятифутовым шестом."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.GENERIC"
msgid "I've breathed in worse stuff at work."
msgstr "На работе и не такой гадостью дышать приходилось."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.HELD"
msgid "Never hurts to have extra light."
msgstr "Дополнительный источник света никогда не помешает."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MOON"
msgid "Yeesh, that's gotta be a health hazard."
msgstr "Это определенно опасно для здоровья."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.GENERIC"
msgid "I've breathed in worse stuff at work."
msgstr "На работе и не такой гадостью дышать приходилось."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.HELD"
msgid "Never hurts to have extra light."
msgstr "Дополнительный источник света никогда не помешает."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.GENERIC"
msgid "I've breathed in worse stuff at work."
msgstr "На работе и не такой гадостью дышать приходилось."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.HELD"
msgid "Never hurts to have extra light."
msgstr "Дополнительный источник света никогда не помешает."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SQUID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SQUID"
msgid "Jeepers, those peepers move fast!"
msgstr "Чего глазами рыскаешь, а?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STAFFCOLDLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STAFFCOLDLIGHT"
msgid "That's real pretty."
msgstr "Это очень мило."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STAFFLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STAFFLIGHT"
msgid "No time for star gazin'."
msgstr "Нет времени пялиться на звезды."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STAFF_LUNARPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STAFF_LUNARPLANT"
msgid "Another magical doodad?"
msgstr "Очередная магическая побрякушка?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STAFF_TORNADO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STAFF_TORNADO"
msgid "All bluster, no bite."
msgstr "Столько шума и ничего."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.AWAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.AWAKE"
msgid "Shoo!"
msgstr "Брысь отсюда!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.HIDING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.HIDING"
msgid "Why's this table givin' me the creeps?"
msgstr "Почему от этого стола у меня мурашки?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.SITTING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.SITTING"
msgid "Why's this table givin' me the creeps?"
msgstr "Почему от этого стола у меня мурашки?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.STANDING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.STANDING"
msgid "Shoo!"
msgstr "Брысь отсюда!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE"
msgid "Yep, yep. It's a rock."
msgstr "Да, да. Это камень."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL"
msgid "Ah! A rock."
msgstr "А! Камень."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STALKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STALKER"
msgid "That thing's terrifying!"
msgstr "Эта вещь ужасна!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STALKER_ATRIUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STALKER_ATRIUM"
msgid "You got a bone to pick with me, bub? Ha!"
msgstr "Хочешь пересчитать мне кости, старина? Ха!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STALKER_MINION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STALKER_MINION"
msgid "I don't want that anywhere near me!"
msgstr "Лучше этой фиговине не приближаться ко мне!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STASH_MAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STASH_MAP"
msgid "Might find some loot if I follow this."
msgstr "Эта карта приведет меня к чему-нибудь ценному."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.EMPTY"
msgid "The materials were worth more than the statue."
msgstr "Материалы стоили больше, чем сама статуя."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.GENERIC"
msgid "One weird sculpture."
msgstr "Очередная дурацкая скульптура."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP"
msgid "I don't know. Some fancy thing."
msgstr "Не знаю. Какая-то красивая вещица."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP_HEDGESPAWNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP_HEDGESPAWNER"
msgid "Yeesh, this place needs a good pruning."
msgstr "Эти заросли не помешало бы подрезать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STATUEMAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STATUEMAXWELL"
msgid "So THIS is \"Maxy\"."
msgstr "Итак, ЭТО «Макси»."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.GENERIC"
msgid "A bit snooty."
msgstr "Капельку высокомерный."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE1"
msgid "This is too strange."
msgstr "Это очень странно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE2"
msgid "We thought she was gone..."
msgstr "Мы думали, она исчезла…"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE3"
msgid "Too artsy fartsy for me."
msgstr "Выпендрежно больно для меня."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL"
msgid "At least there's SOME steel around here."
msgstr "По крайней мере, здесь есть НЕМНОГО стали."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL"
msgid "I'm ready for a sea adventure."
msgstr "Я готова к морским приключениям."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM"
msgid "That steering wheel ain't gonna assemble itself."
msgstr "Руль сам себя не соберет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STINGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STINGER"
msgid "I don't see the point. Oh wait, there it is."
msgstr "Колись, в чем смысл. Ой, колется."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.GENERIC"
msgid "Looks sturdy enough."
msgstr "Выглядит довольно крепкой."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.OCCUPIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.OCCUPIED"
msgid "Looks like that seat's spoken for."
msgstr "Это место уже забито."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.GENERIC"
msgid "I don't care if it's fancy, just solidly built."
msgstr "Модно или не модно — лишь бы было качественно сделано."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.HAS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.HAS_ITEM"
msgid "It's doin' what tables do."
msgstr "Этот стол выполняет свое предназначение."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.BROKEN"
msgid "Poor lil' guy is all busted."
msgstr "Бедняга совсем расклеился."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.GENERIC"
msgid "Industrious lil' fella."
msgstr "Ну какой работяжка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STRAWHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STRAWHAT"
msgid "Keeps the sun outta your eyes."
msgstr "Убирает солнце с ваших глаз."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STUFFEDEGGPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STUFFEDEGGPLANT"
msgid "It's practically bursting."
msgstr "Оно фактически разрывается."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STUFFING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.STUFFING"
msgid "I could eat this for days!"
msgstr "Я бы всю жизнь этой штукой питалась!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED"
msgid "It's been picked."
msgstr "Его сорвали."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PLANT"
msgid "This plant don't give up easy."
msgstr "Это растение так просто не сдается."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_POTTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_POTTED"
msgid "It's in a pot now."
msgstr "Теперь оно в горшке."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "Here's hoping I never have to tussle with a live one."
msgstr "Надеюсь, мне не придется с ним бороться."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.LOCKED"
msgid "Can't seem to get it open."
msgstr "Не понимаю, как его открыть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SUPERTACKLECONTAINER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SUPERTACKLECONTAINER"
msgid "I'll never say no to havin' more room for my tools!"
msgstr "Большая коробка для инструментов? Дайте две!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR"
msgid "Looks like it could use some repairs."
msgstr "Ее бы не помешало чутка подлатать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_BROKEN"
msgid "I'd better roll up my sleeves and get to rebuildin'."
msgstr "Ну что, пора закатать рукава и все починить?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_COMPLETE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_COMPLETE"
msgid "Good and sturdy!"
msgstr "Надежная и прочная!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE"
msgid "Looks like it could use some repairs."
msgstr "Ее бы не помешало чутка подлатать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_BROKEN"
msgid "Well don't just look at it. Let's get to fixin'."
msgstr "Что толку стоять и глазеть? Надо чинить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_COMPLETE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_COMPLETE"
msgid "Now that's one mean lookin' pillar!"
msgstr "Эта колонна выглядит по-настоящему зловеще!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_SCAFFOLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_SCAFFOLD"
msgid "Looks like there's some buildin' to be done!"
msgstr "Похоже, тут надо что-то построить!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_SCAFFOLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_SCAFFOLD"
msgid "Looks like there's some buildin' to be done!"
msgstr "Похоже, тут надо что-то построить!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SURFNTURF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SURFNTURF"
msgid "Now THAT'S a meal!"
msgstr "Вот это я понимаю — настоящая еда!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SWEATERVEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SWEATERVEST"
msgid "A vest fit for an egghead."
msgstr "Жилет подойдет яйцеголовому."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SWEETPOTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SWEETPOTATO"
msgid "Sticks to yer ribs!"
msgstr "Отправляется прямиком на бока!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SWEETTEA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SWEETTEA"
msgid "I've got no time for tea! There's work to be done, like... er..."
msgstr "Некогда мне чаи гонять! Работа не ждет. Вот, например... эм..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SWORD_LUNARPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SWORD_LUNARPLANT"
msgid "It's a cut above most other swords I've seen. Ha!"
msgstr "Режу правду-матку: это один из лучших мечей, что я видела."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.BURNT"
msgid "A darn shame."
msgstr "Ужасно жалко."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.GENERIC"
msgid "Now that's a sturdy table!"
msgstr "Как только стол все это выдерживает?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.HAS_FOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.HAS_FOOD"
msgid "When do we eat?"
msgstr "Когда можно будет приступать?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.WRONG_TYPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.WRONG_TYPE"
msgid "Whoops! That doesn't go here."
msgstr "Ой, это блюдо не отсюда."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TACKLECONTAINER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TACKLECONTAINER"
msgid "Gotta keep your tools organized!"
msgstr "Инструменты нужно держать в порядке!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TACKLESKETCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TACKLESKETCH"
msgid "Hey! This will come in real handy next time I go fishin'!"
msgstr "О, это мне пригодится, когда в следующий раз рыбачить пойду."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TACKLESTATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TACKLESTATION"
msgid "Need the right tool for the job!"
msgstr "Для всякой работы есть свой инструмент."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TAFFY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TAFFY"
msgid "Proper treats stick to your teeth."
msgstr "Настоящие сладости прилипают к зубам."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD"
msgid "Look at the legs on that one!"
msgstr "Только взгляни на его ноги!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG"
msgid "You wanna be an omelet, don'tcha?"
msgstr "Хочешь быть омлетом, не так ли?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_COOKED"
msgid "Dinner!"
msgstr "Ужин!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.COLD"
msgid "This egg's gonna freeze over."
msgstr "Это яйцо замерзнет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.GENERIC"
msgid "This one just might hatch."
msgstr "А вот это может вылупиться."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.HOT"
msgid "It's sweating buckets."
msgstr "Это потеющие ведра."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.LONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.LONG"
msgid "You've got your work cut out for ya, lil guy."
msgstr "Эта работа создана для тебя, дружок."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.SHORT"
msgid "I can see the beak!"
msgstr "Я вижу клюв!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.GENERIC"
msgid "That looks mighty tasty."
msgstr "Выглядит весьма вкусно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.PICKED"
msgid "Someone's an empty nester."
msgstr "Чье-то гнездо опустело."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TALLEGGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TALLEGGS"
msgid "What's this, some kinda fancy boiled egg?"
msgstr "Это какое-то навороченное вареное яйцо?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TAMALES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TAMALES"
msgid "Now that'll warm ya right up!"
msgstr "Согревает отлично!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.GENERIC"
msgid "We all go through that awkward stage."
msgstr "Мы все проходим через этот сложный этап."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.HUNGRY"
msgid "Are you ever not-hungry?!"
msgstr "Ты когда-нибудь бываешь не голодным?!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.SLEEPING"
msgid "Sleep well, awkward fluffnugget."
msgstr "Хороших снов, неуклюжий комок шерсти."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.STARVING"
msgid "Stop whining, I'll feed you when I can!"
msgstr "Прекращай ныть, я кормлю тебя, когда могу!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.GEMS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.GEMS"
msgid "Still gotta tinker with it a bit."
msgstr "Надо бы еще немного подколотить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.VALID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.VALID"
msgid "Fully operational."
msgstr "Полностью работоспособен."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.ACTIVE"
msgid "That did it."
msgstr "Так-то лучше."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.GENERIC"
msgid "That gadget has my name on it."
msgstr "На этом устройстве есть мое имя."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.LOCKED"
msgid "Still needs a bit of tinkering."
msgstr "Все еще нуждается в небольшой починке."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.PARTIAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.PARTIAL"
msgid "Coming along real nice."
msgstr "Здорово подходит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BOX"
msgid "Pulling the lever makes me feel better."
msgstr "Тяну за рычаг — и так хорошо становится!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_CRANK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_CRANK"
msgid "Let's get cranky. Ha!"
msgstr "Давайте все свихнемся. Ха!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO"
msgid "Yuck. Handmade."
msgstr "Фи. Ручная работа."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_RING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_RING"
msgid "Nice little metal doodad."
msgstr "Хорошая маленькая металлическая штуковина."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TELESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TELESTAFF"
msgid "So you're telling me this stick is \"magic\"?"
msgstr "Так, вы хотите сказать, что эта палочка «волшебная»?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TENT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TENT.BURNT"
msgid "Yup. Just like camping."
msgstr "Да. Совсем как отдыхать на природе."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TENT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TENT.GENERIC"
msgid "Putting the tent together is the best part of camping."
msgstr "Ставить палатку — это лучшая часть похода."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE"
msgid "Hands off!"
msgstr "Руки прочь!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPIKE"
msgid "A real good whackin' stick."
msgstr "Хорошая палка для битья."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPOTS"
msgid "Looks a bit spotty to me! Ha!"
msgstr "Выглядят пестровато для меня! Ха!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN"
msgid "Is there no end to these things?"
msgstr "Этому вообще есть конец?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR"
msgid "Don't even think about touching me."
msgstr "Даже не думай прикасаться ко мне."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_ARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_ARM"
msgid "Hands off, buddy."
msgstr "Руки прочь, парень."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_HOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_HOLE"
msgid "I've done worse jobs."
msgstr "Я делала работу и похуже."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.COOLDOWN"
msgid "Guess it's on its lunch break."
msgstr "У него, видать, перерыв на обед."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.CRIMSON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.CRIMSON"
msgid "Yeesh, that little tree sure isn't looking good."
msgstr "Фу, что-то деревцу этому изрядно поплохело."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.ENABLED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.ENABLED"
msgid "Yikes! A power surge!"
msgstr "Черт! Короткое замыкание!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.GENERIC"
msgid "Something feels off about this... sure is pretty, though."
msgstr "Что-то с ним не так... Но все равно красиво."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.SPAWN_DISABLED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.SPAWN_DISABLED"
msgid "Looks like it's out of order."
msgstr "Похоже, оно сломалось."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.WAITING_FOR_DARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.WAITING_FOR_DARK"
msgid "It's working up to something..."
msgstr "Странные тут дела творятся..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.BURNT"
msgid "Easy come, easy go."
msgstr "Легко пришло, легко ушло."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "Well, a free chest's a free chest."
msgstr "Бесплатному сундуку под крышку не смотрят."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.SHIMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.SHIMMER"
msgid "Why does that chest look like it's short-circuiting?"
msgstr "Почему этот сундук выглядит так, будто его закоротило?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.THULECITE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.THULECITE"
msgid "I love working with new materials."
msgstr "Мне нравится работать с новыми материалами."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.THULECITEBUGNET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.THULECITEBUGNET"
msgid "The old stuff was built to last."
msgstr "Вот раньше качественно делали."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.THULECITE_PIECES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.THULECITE_PIECES"
msgid "Just needs a spit shine."
msgstr "Надо поплевать и протереть для блеска."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.THURIBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.THURIBLE"
msgid "Smells kinda like gasoline."
msgstr "Что-то бензином попахивает."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.ABANDONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.ABANDONED"
msgid "Looks like I'm finding them on my own."
msgstr "Сдается, придется самой искать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.GENERIC"
msgid "Huh. Never thought I'd see the day when the fat cats work for ME."
msgstr "Ха. Вот уж не думала, что на меня будет такая важная шишка работать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.LOST_TRACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.LOST_TRACK"
msgid "Looks like someone else got to this kit first."
msgstr "Похоже, этого котенка уже кто-то забрал."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NEARBY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NEARBY"
msgid "I get the feelin' there's a kitcoon around here."
msgstr "Енотокотенок где-то здесь, я уверена."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NOTHING_TO_TRACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NOTHING_TO_TRACK"
msgid "He's not catchin' any more scent trails."
msgstr "Больше он ничьих следов не чует."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.SUCCESS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.SUCCESS"
msgid "Good eye, big guy!"
msgstr "А у тебя острый глаз, здоровяк!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TARGET_TOO_FAR_AWAY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TARGET_TOO_FAR_AWAY"
msgid "Might be a bit too far."
msgstr "Как-то слишком уж далеко."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING"
msgid "Oh, he's caught a scent."
msgstr "О, он почуял запах."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING_NOT_MINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING_NOT_MINE"
msgid "That one's workin' for someone else."
msgstr "Этот здоровяк работает на кого-то еще."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED"
msgid "Stubborn rascals."
msgstr "Упрямые, заразы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TILLWEEDSALVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TILLWEEDSALVE"
msgid "Glad to have found a use for those weeds."
msgstr "Хорошо, что сорняки получилось пустить в дело."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.GENERIC"
msgid "I don't got this!"
msgstr "Этого я не поняла!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.RAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.RAGE"
msgid "He's tougher than he looks... but so am I!"
msgstr "А он сильнее, чем кажется… но и я не промах!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.EMPTY"
msgid "Hole lotta nothing."
msgstr "Целая куча ничего."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.GENERIC"
msgid "I got this."
msgstr "Я разберусь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.INGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.INGROUND"
msgid "Something's in there."
msgstr "Тут что-то есть."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TOMATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TOMATO"
msgid "Gotta appreciate havin' fresh vegetables."
msgstr "Стоит ценить то, что мне доступны свежие овощи."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_COOKED"
msgid "I prefer'em fried and green."
msgstr "Жареные зеленые мне нравятся больше."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_OVERSIZED"
msgid "You could make a lot of spaghetti with that."
msgstr "Сколько же с ним спагетти можно сделать?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_SEEDS"
msgid "I got no idea what they'd grow into."
msgstr "Понятия не имею, что из этого вырастет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT"
msgid "How bourgeoisie."
msgstr "Как буржуазно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT_MAGICIAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT_MAGICIAN"
msgid "Max is a little too good at keepin' things under his hat."
msgstr "У Макса всегда все шито-крыто."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TORCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TORCH"
msgid "There's beauty in a simple design."
msgstr "Красота в простоте дизайна."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TOURTIERE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TOURTIERE"
msgid "Now that's a good meat pie!"
msgstr "Вот это я понимаю — мясной пирог!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.ACTIVE"
msgid "Rarin' to go."
msgstr "Полна рвения, чтобы идти."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.GENERIC"
msgid "It runs on \"magic\" instead of electricity."
msgstr "Работает на «магии» вместо электричества."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.ACTIVE"
msgid "Let's get a move on."
msgstr "Поехали."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.GENERIC"
msgid "It's uh, a rock. Mhm."
msgstr "Это, э-эм, камень. М-м-м."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRAILMIX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRAILMIX"
msgid "All the energy you need for a long day at work."
msgstr "Вся эта энергия понадобится тебе для долгого рабочего дня."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRAILS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRAILS"
msgid "He's justa big meathead."
msgstr "Да он просто тупая дубина!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRANSISTOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRANSISTOR"
msgid "A thing of beauty."
msgstr "Вещица из красивых."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRAP"
msgid "All the trappings of a good dinner. Ha!"
msgstr "Вот они, хитрые уловки вкусного ужина. Ха!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRAP_BRAMBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRAP_BRAMBLE"
msgid "That lil plant fella whipped it up."
msgstr "Это наш цветочный друг поставил."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.CLOSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.CLOSED"
msgid "That thing's a workplace hazard."
msgstr "На рабочем месте я бы такое не допустила."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.GENERIC"
msgid "Watch yer step."
msgstr "Смотри под ноги."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH"
msgid "Gnarly gnashers."
msgstr "Кривые зубы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH_MAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH_MAXWELL"
msgid "That's a safety hazard."
msgstr "Опасная штука."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.BURNT"
msgid "Hope there was nothin' good inside."
msgstr "Надеюсь, внутри не было ничего полезного."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "Handmade, so you know it's not up to snuff."
msgstr "Ручной работы, так что, знаешь, лучше не принюхиваться."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE"
msgid "It's new and improved."
msgstr "Лучше прежнего."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_TRAP"
msgid "I don't need to be concerned about that."
msgstr "Мне не стоит беспокоиться об этом."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TREECLUMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TREECLUMP"
msgid "A big clump of tree."
msgstr "Огромные заросли деревьев."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TREEGROWTHSOLUTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TREEGROWTHSOLUTION"
msgid "Alright trees, come get your grub!"
msgstr "Ну, деревья, давайте в очередь за пайком!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRIDENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRIDENT"
msgid "I ain't afraid to make waves! Ha!"
msgstr "Я не боюсь пускать волны и ветра, ха!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_1"
msgid "I was never much into marbles."
msgstr "Никогда не любила шары катать."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_10
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_10"
msgid "All bite and no bark. Ha!"
msgstr "Не лает, но кусает. Ха!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_11
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_11"
msgid "Maybe this bot'll let me poke around its insides."
msgstr "Может, этот робот даст мне покопаться в его внутренностях."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_12
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_12"
msgid "Hey Willow! Dare ya ta eat it!"
msgstr "Эй, Уиллоу! Слабо сожрать это?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_13
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_13"
msgid "Looks like my old landlord. Ha!"
msgstr "Похож на моего старого домовладельца. Ха!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_14
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_14"
msgid "Tea's not really my taste."
msgstr "Я не очень-то люблю чай."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_15
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_15"
msgid "A bit highbrow, don'tcha think?"
msgstr "Немного снобит, как думаешь?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_16
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_16"
msgid "A bit highbrow, don'tcha think?"
msgstr "Немного снобит, как думаешь?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_17
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_17"
msgid "A waste of good metal."
msgstr "Пустая трата отличного металла."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_18
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_18"
msgid "Handcrafted. Blech."
msgstr "Ручной работы. Буэ-э-э."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_19
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_19"
msgid "This is why we need production standards."
msgstr "Вот зачем нам нужны производственные стандарты."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_2"
msgid "It's got no film to make a sound."
msgstr "Черт знает, как отсюда звук извлечь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_20
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_20"
msgid "I can reach my own back! Watch!"
msgstr "Я могу дотянуться до собственной спины! Гляди!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_21
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_21"
msgid "Nice and mechanical."
msgstr "Здорово и механично."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_22
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_22"
msgid "I got no use for that."
msgstr "Для меня это бесполезно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_23
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_23"
msgid "I prefer to break workboots in myself."
msgstr "Я предпочитаю сама изнашивать свою рабочую обувь."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_24
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_24"
msgid "The reliable quality of a mass manufactured product!"
msgstr "Надежное качество для массового промышленного продукта."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_25
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_25"
msgid "Ha! Nasty!"
msgstr "Ха! Гадость!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_26
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_26"
msgid "That thing's an affront to manufacturing."
msgstr "Эта штуковина бросает вызов производству."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_27
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_27"
msgid "Not a lotta use for that out here."
msgstr "Тут от нее не слишком много толку."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_28
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_28"
msgid "That's a rook."
msgstr "Это фигура ладьи."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_29
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_29"
msgid "That's a rook."
msgstr "Это фигура ладьи."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_3"
msgid "Everyone's been real good at showin' me the ropes. Ha!"
msgstr "Ну теперь-то я не запутаюсь. Ха!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_30
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_30"
msgid "That's a knight."
msgstr "Это фигура коня."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_31
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_31"
msgid "That's a knight."
msgstr "Это фигура коня."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_32
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_32"
msgid "It's not the real thing."
msgstr "Он не настоящий."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_33
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_33"
msgid "It's a plastic creepy crawly."
msgstr "Это жуткая ползучая штука из пластика."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_34
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_34"
msgid "I wish for more wishes."
msgstr "Желаю больше желаний."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_35
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_35"
msgid "Someone drank it already."
msgstr "Кто-то уже все выпил."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_36
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_36"
msgid "Chomp chomp."
msgstr "Хрум-хрум."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_37
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_37"
msgid "Doesn't seem worth fixing."
msgstr "И чинить не стоит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_38
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_38"
msgid "Hope no one's been snoopin' on us."
msgstr "Надеюсь, за нами не идет слежка."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_39
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_39"
msgid "That just ain't right - it's left! Ha!"
msgstr "Ну право же, это лево! Ха!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_4"
msgid "We're not goin' gnome anytime soon. Ha! ...Oh."
msgstr "Гномы мне не пригодятся в ближайшее время. Ха! …Ох."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_40
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_40"
msgid "Not sure what to do with it. I'm weighing my options."
msgstr "Не знаю, что делать с этим. Нужно оценить все мои возможности."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_41
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_41"
msgid "Not sure what this was for."
msgstr "Не знаю точно, для чего эта штука была предназначена."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_42
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_42"
msgid "Cute little toy, hey?"
msgstr "Эй, милая маленькая игрушка?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_43
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_43"
msgid "Blech. Handmade."
msgstr "Буэ-э-э. Ручная работа."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_44
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_44"
msgid "Nope. Can't fix that."
msgstr "Не-а. Не могу это починить."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_45
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_45"
msgid "I'm not messing with anymore radios."
msgstr "Больше не связываюсь с радио."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_46
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_46"
msgid "That might be fun to take apart."
msgstr "Будет весело разобрать его по частям."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_5"
msgid "Handcrafted. Yuck."
msgstr "Ручной работы. Фи."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_6"
msgid "The copper's probably valuable."
msgstr "Медь, возможно, пригодится."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_7"
msgid "Was this whittled... by hand? Blech!"
msgstr "Это было выстругано… рукой? Буэ-э-э!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_8
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_8"
msgid "No bathtub in sight."
msgstr "Не вижу ванны на горизонте."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_9
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_9"
msgid "Where's all this junk coming from?"
msgstr "Откуда взялся весь этот мусор?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNING"
msgid "Yikes! That fish scale's in some hot water!"
msgstr "Ой! У нее чешуя кипящей водой покрыта!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNT"
msgid "Looks like someone was a sore loser."
msgstr "Кажется, кое-кто — последний неудачник."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.GENERIC"
msgid "A challenge, huh?"
msgstr "Вот так-так."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.HAS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.HAS_ITEM"
msgid "Weight: {weight}\nCaught by: {owner}"
msgstr "Вес: {weight}\nПоймано: {owner}"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.HAS_ITEM_HEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.HAS_ITEM_HEAVY"
msgid "Weight: {weight}\nCaught by: {owner}\nWoo-wee, that's a big one!"
msgstr "Вес: {weight}\nПоймано: {owner}\nХороший улов, внушительный!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.OWNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.OWNER"
msgid "Weight: {weight}\nCaught by: {owner}\nHeh. No big deal."
msgstr "Вес: {weight}\nПоймано: {owner}\nНичего особенного, хе-хе."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.OWNER_HEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.OWNER_HEAVY"
msgid "Weight: {weight}\nCaught by: {owner}\nAll it took was patience and hard work."
msgstr "Вес: {weight}\nПоймано: {owner}\nВсего-то и нужно было, что немного терпения и много тяжелой работы."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNING"
msgid "I knew that thing looked like a fire hazard waiting to happen..."
msgstr "Я так и знала, что когда-нибудь оно загорится..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNT"
msgid "Alright everyone, back to it!"
msgstr "Чего пялимся, народ? За работу!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.GENERIC"
msgid "What is this, a county fair?"
msgstr "У нас тут что, деревенская ярмарка?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM"
msgid "Weight: {weight}\nHarvested on day: {day}\nPretty good!"
msgstr "Вес: {weight}\nДень сбора: {day}\nОчень даже!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM_HEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM_HEAVY"
msgid "Weight: {weight}\nHarvested on day: {day}\nWhat a whopper!"
msgstr "Вес: {weight}\nДень сбора: {day}\nВот это урожай!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM_LIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM_LIGHT"
msgid "Hey, a lot of hard work went into growing that thing!"
msgstr "Эй, на это мы тоже много сил потратили!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_SUMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_SUMMER"
msgid "They weren't kidding about the breeze."
msgstr "А они не шутили насчет ветра."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_WINTER"
msgid "I wish it had sleeves."
msgstr "Хотелось бы иметь рукава."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_COOKED"
msgid "Singed the nosehairs right off."
msgstr "Прямо подпалило волосы в носу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_SUMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_SUMMER"
msgid "I'll eat it. Don't think I won't."
msgstr "Я съем это. Не сомневайся."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_WINTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_WINTER"
msgid "I'll eat it. Don't think I won't."
msgstr "Я съем это. Не сомневайся."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TUMBLEWEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TUMBLEWEED"
msgid "Rollin' along the road of life."
msgstr "Катись себе дальше."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TURFCRAFTINGSTATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TURFCRAFTINGSTATION"
msgid "Better pound the pavement! Ha!"
msgstr "Всегда нужно твердо стоять на ногах, ха!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TURF_ARCHIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TURF_ARCHIVE"
msgid "That's a well made chunk of ground."
msgstr "Кусок земли очень высокого качества."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TURF_BADLANDS
