msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_TASER"
msgid "They've really gotta start takin' better care of themselves."
msgstr "Ему бы не помешало начать заботиться о себе."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.WX78_MODULEREMOVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.WX78_MODULEREMOVER"
msgid "Sheesh, they could just ask for my help!"
msgstr "Пф-ф, мог бы и просто у меня помощи попросить!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.GENERIC"
msgid "Keepin' busy, Jimmy?"
msgstr "Весь в делах, да, Джимми?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.HUNTING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.HUNTING"
msgid "Keepin' busy, Jimmy?"
msgstr "Весь в делах, да, Джимми?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.SCANNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.SCANNING"
msgid "Keepin' busy, Jimmy?"
msgstr "Весь в делах, да, Джимми?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER_ITEM"
msgid "Must be on break."
msgstr "У него перерыв."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER_SUCCEEDED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER_SUCCEEDED"
msgid "He's signalling his supervisor."
msgstr "Подает сигнал своему начальнику."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YELLOWAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YELLOWAMULET"
msgid "Useful little tool."
msgstr "Полезный маленький инструмент."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YELLOWGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YELLOWGEM"
msgid "I like gems best before they're cut."
msgstr "Я люблю самоцветы до обработки."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YELLOWMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YELLOWMOONEYE"
msgid "Quit staring."
msgstr "Хватит пялиться."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YELLOWSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YELLOWSTAFF"
msgid "I'm not fully grasping this whole \"magic\" thing."
msgstr "Я не до конца понимаю эту «магическую» штуковину."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "It's not good for much now."
msgstr "Сейчас от него никакого толку."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "I bet I could find some beefalo fluff to give it."
msgstr "С шерстью бифало проблем точно не возникнет."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.GENERIC"
