#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.FIRESTARTER"
