#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WX78_MODULEREMOVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WX78_MODULEREMOVER"
msgid "Guess that's one way to do it."
msgstr "Видимо, ничего другого не оставалось."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.GENERIC"
msgid "Whew... almost mistook you for a bird, little fella."
msgstr "Уф... я тебя чуть за птицу не принял, малыш."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.HUNTING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.HUNTING"
msgid "Whew... almost mistook you for a bird, little fella."
msgstr "Уф... я тебя чуть за птицу не принял, малыш."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.SCANNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.SCANNING"
msgid "Whew... almost mistook you for a bird, little fella."
msgstr "Уф... я тебя чуть за птицу не принял, малыш."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER_ITEM"
msgid "Catching some zeds."
msgstr "Знай себе подушку давит."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER_SUCCEEDED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER_SUCCEEDED"
msgid "Trying to get someone's attention, eh?"
msgstr "Внимание к себе привлекаешь, да?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.YELLOWAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.YELLOWAMULET"
msgid "I could cut wood at night with this."
msgstr "С этой штуковиной я смогу рубить деревья даже ночью."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.YELLOWGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.YELLOWGEM"
msgid "I can see the stars in it."
msgstr "Я вижу в нем звезды."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.YELLOWMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.YELLOWMOONEYE"
msgid "It's rude to stare."
msgstr "Пялиться невежливо."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.YELLOWSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.YELLOWSTAFF"
msgid "Useful in a pinch!"
msgstr "Для экстренных мер!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Easy come, easy go eh?"
msgstr "Легко пришло, легко ушло, да?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "That beefalo's missing something."
