#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST_ITEM"
msgid "Better get to it, eh?"
msgstr "Надо бы установить это дело, ага."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE"
