msgstr "Давай-ка соберем эту машинку, угу."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE"
