msgstr "Какая-то странная эта будка, конечно."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE_ITEM"
