msgstr "Поможет держать лодку на плаву... какое-то время."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOATRACE_CHECKPOINT_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOATRACE_CHECKPOINT_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT"
msgid "It's not the destination, it's the journey."
msgstr "Нет цели, есть только путь."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT"
msgid "One person's buoy is another's barrier."
msgstr "Что одному ориентир, то другому помеха."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOATRACE_START_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOATRACE_START_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT"
msgid "Ready, set, boat!"
msgstr "На старт, внимание, отдать швартовы!"

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOAT_BUMPER_KELP_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOAT_BUMPER_KELP_KIT"
msgid "Protect your boat - with kelp!"
msgstr "Укрепите свою лодку водорослями!"

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOAT_BUMPER_SHELL_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOAT_BUMPER_SHELL_KIT"
msgid "Protect your boat - with shells!"
msgstr "Укрепите свою лодку ракушками!"

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOAT_BUMPER_YOTD_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOAT_BUMPER_YOTD_KIT"
msgid "No one will mess with a dragon that's bared its fangs."
msgstr "Никому не захочется лезть к обнажившему клыки дракону."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOAT_CANNON_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOAT_CANNON_KIT"
msgid "It blows the competition out of the water."
msgstr "Соперники просто взорвутся от негодования."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOAT_GRASS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOAT_GRASS_ITEM"
msgid "Fun for a quick weekend getaway."
msgstr "Для коротких путешествий."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOAT_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOAT_ITEM"
msgid "Let the seas be your domain."
msgstr "И пусть моря станут вашим домом."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOAT_MAGNET_BEACON
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOAT_MAGNET_BEACON"
msgid "Draw in any comically oversized magnets that might be nearby."
msgstr "Притягивает комично огромные магниты, оказавшиеся рядом."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOAT_MAGNET_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOAT_MAGNET_KIT"
msgid "Your personality isn't the only thing that's magnetic."
msgstr "Притягательность свойственна не только вам."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOAT_ROTATOR_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOAT_ROTATOR_KIT"
msgid "Row, row, rotate your boat."
msgstr "Кручу, верчу, доплыть хочу."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BODYPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BODYPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL"
msgid "Beef up your pillow defenses."
msgstr "Прошерстите свою защиту."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BODYPILLOW_KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BODYPILLOW_KELP"
msgid "A soggy suit of pillow armor."
msgstr "Отличное оправдание ваших влажных ручонок."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BODYPILLOW_PETALS
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BODYPILLOW_PETALS"
msgid "It offers minimal protection, but hopefully you'll still come out smelling like a rose."
msgstr "Не самая лучшая защита, зато вы будете хорошо пахнуть даже к концу боя."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BODYPILLOW_STEELWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BODYPILLOW_STEELWOOL"
msgid "A wearable pillow that is as effective as it is unpleasant."
msgstr "Неприятная, зато эффективная."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOMB_LUNARPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOMB_LUNARPLANT"
msgid "Use unstable lunar energy for explosive results."
msgstr "Используйте взрывной эффект нестабильной лунной энергии."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOKSTATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOKSTATION"
msgid "All books must be arranged using the Dewey Decimal System."
msgstr "Книги должны стоять в соответствии с десятичной системой Дьюи."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOK_BEES
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOK_BEES"
msgid "Learn the ABC's of beekeeping."
msgstr "Научитесь азам пчеловодства."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOK_BIRDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOK_BIRDS"
msgid "1000 species: habits, habitats, and calls."
msgstr "1000 видов: привычки, ареалы обитания и пение."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOK_BRIMSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOK_BRIMSTONE"
msgid "The world will end in fire and tribulation!"
msgstr "Мир сгинет в горе и огне!"

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOK_FIRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOK_FIRE"
msgid "Use these simple techniques to defuse any fiery situation."
msgstr "Простые способы остудить чей-нибудь пылкий нрав."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOK_FISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOK_FISH"
msgid "Fishing, made easy!"
msgstr "О рыбалке доступным языком!"

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOK_GARDENING
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOK_GARDENING"
msgid "On the care and feeding of plants."
msgstr "Об уходе за растениями."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOK_HORTICULTURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOK_HORTICULTURE"
msgid "On the care and feeding of crops."
msgstr "Об уходе за растениями и их питании."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOK_HORTICULTURE_UPGRADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOK_HORTICULTURE_UPGRADED"
msgid "Expert analysis on advanced crop care."
msgstr "Экспертный анализ продвинутых методов ухода за растениями."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOK_LIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOK_LIGHT"
msgid "An illuminating read."
msgstr "Ученье — свет."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOK_LIGHT_UPGRADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOK_LIGHT_UPGRADED"
msgid "This complete edition far outshines its predecessor."
msgstr "Затмила предыдущее издание."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOK_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOK_MOON"
msgid "Summon the power of the moon."
msgstr "Взывайте к силам луны."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOK_RAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOK_RAIN"
msgid "Save it for a rainy day, whenever you decide that will be."
msgstr "Пригодится после дождичка в четверг. Или для него."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOK_RESEARCH_STATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOK_RESEARCH_STATION"
msgid "A complete guide to everything from A to Z."
msgstr "Исчерпывающее руководство по всему на свете, от А до Я."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOK_SILVICULTURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOK_SILVICULTURE"
msgid "A guide to branch management."
msgstr "Разветвленный справочник."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOK_SLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOK_SLEEP"
msgid "Soothing tales to send you off to dreamland."
msgstr "Убаюкивающие истории, под которые ты провалишься в сон."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOK_TEMPERATURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOK_TEMPERATURE"
msgid "Keep your personal climate under control with these easy steps."
msgstr "Держите свой климат под контролем благодаря этим простым действиям."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOK_TENTACLES
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOK_TENTACLES"
msgid "Let's learn about our subterranean friends!"
msgstr "Ну, что там пишут про наших подземных друзей…"

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOK_WEB
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOK_WEB"
msgid "You don't know someone until you walk a mile in their webs."
msgstr "Чужая душа — потемки, ну или огромная паутина..."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOMERANG
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BOOMERANG"
msgid "It comes from a land down under."
msgstr "Австралийская игрушка."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BRUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BRUSH"
msgid "Relieve beefalo of their hair buildup."
msgstr "Освободи бифало от его шевелюры."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BUGNET
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BUGNET"
msgid "Catch bugs."
msgstr "Ловить жучков."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BUNDLEWRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BUNDLEWRAP"
msgid "Part and parcel to bundling your stuff."
msgstr "Без этого свои пожитки в кучу не соберешь."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BUSHHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BUSHHAT"
msgid "Good for hiding!"
msgstr "Помогает спрятаться!"

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BUTTERFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BUTTERFLY"
msgid "Help them relive their glory."
msgstr "Пусть они вновь переживут момент славы."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BUTTERFLY_SKETCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.BUTTERFLY_SKETCH"
msgid "Let the moon send you visions of butterflies."
msgstr "Да ниспошлет луна на вас видение бабочек."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CAMPFIRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CAMPFIRE"
msgid "Provides light while burning."
msgstr "Светит, пока горит."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CANDYBAG
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CANDYBAG"
msgid "Only carries Hallowed Nights goodies."
msgstr "Только для угощений в Ночь всех святых."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CANE
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CANE"
msgid "Trot on with speed and poise."
msgstr "Шагай быстро и уверенно."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CANNONBALL_ROCK_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CANNONBALL_ROCK_ITEM"
msgid "It's sure to make a splash."
msgstr "Точно сделает плюх."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVALCANNON_CONFETTI_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVALCANNON_CONFETTI_KIT"
msgid "Start things off with a bang!"
msgstr "Праздника без шума не бывает!"

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVALCANNON_SPARKLE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVALCANNON_SPARKLE_KIT"
msgid "Add some sparkle to your surroundings."
msgstr "Добавит блеска окружающей среде."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVALCANNON_STREAMER_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVALCANNON_STREAMER_KIT"
msgid "Create an explosion... of fun!"
msgstr "Целый взрыв веселья!"

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER_KIT"
msgid "Take a shine to some bauble-strung branches."
msgstr "Веткам тоже не помешает добавить блеска."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE1_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE1_KIT"
msgid "A cracking addition to your decor."
msgstr "Хрупкий элемент декора."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE2_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE2_KIT"
msgid "Pint-sized eggcitement!"
msgstr "Веселье — в яйце, яйцо — на ярмарке!"

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE3_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE3_KIT"
msgid "Get in the swing of summer fun!"
msgstr "Вихрь летних развлечений!"

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE4_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE4_KIT"
msgid "The new height of Cawnival decor."
msgstr "Высокое искусство Галкарнавала."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT"
msgid "What could be inside this mysterious green box?"
msgstr "Что может быть внутри этой загадочной зеленой коробки?"

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT_SEASON2
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT_SEASON2"
msgid "What could be inside this mysterious gold box?"
msgstr "Что может быть внутри этой загадочной золотой коробки?"

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVALDECOR_LAMP_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVALDECOR_LAMP_KIT"
msgid "A dreamy light for summer nights."
msgstr "Лампа для сна в летнюю ночь."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVALDECOR_PLANT_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVALDECOR_PLANT_KIT"
msgid "A little piece of the Cawnival."
msgstr "Маленький кусочек Галкарнавала."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVALFOOD_CORNTEA
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVALFOOD_CORNTEA"
msgid "Surprisingly refreshing!"
msgstr "На удивление хорошо освежает!"

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_KIT"
msgid "Let them eat grubs!"
msgstr "Пусть заморят червячка!"

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_KIT"
msgid "Whisk back runaway eggs."
msgstr "Будем сбивать непослушные яйца в омлет."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_KIT"
msgid "Count your eggs before they hatch."
msgstr "Птенцов по скорлупкам считают."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVALGAME_PUCKDROP_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVALGAME_PUCKDROP_KIT"
msgid "Bounce the ball safely to its nest."
msgstr "Верните шарик обратно в гнездо."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_KIT"
msgid "Keep pests from bugging the nest."
msgstr "Держите жуков в узде, не место им в гнезде."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_KIT"
msgid "Spinning and winning in equal measure."
msgstr "Крутите и выигрывайте."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVAL_BALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVAL_BALL"
msgid "You're guaranteed to have a ball!"
msgstr "С мячиком веселье гарантировано!"

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVAL_GAMETOKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVAL_GAMETOKEN"
msgid "Buy tokens, play games, win prizes!"
msgstr "Жетоны для игр, игры — для призов!"

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVAL_GAMETOKEN_MULTIPLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVAL_GAMETOKEN_MULTIPLE"
msgid "Why buy one when you could buy three?"
msgstr "Зачем один, если можно купить три?"

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVAL_PLAZA_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVAL_PLAZA_KIT"
msgid "The centerpiece of every Cawnival."
msgstr "Главное украшение Галкарнавала."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVAL_POPCORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVAL_POPCORN"
msgid "Perfect for munching on while spectating."
msgstr "Закуска для зевак."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVAL_PRIZEBOOTH_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVAL_PRIZEBOOTH_KIT"
msgid "See what prizes are in store."
msgstr "Интересно, какие там призы?"

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVAL_SEEDPACKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVAL_SEEDPACKET"
msgid "A crunchy Cawnival favorite."
msgstr "Популярное угощение на Галкарнавале."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVAL_VEST_A
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVAL_VEST_A"
msgid "A whimsical scarf of foraged leaves."
msgstr "Чудесный шарф из опавших листьев."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVAL_VEST_B
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVAL_VEST_B"
msgid "It's truly something to crow about."
msgstr "Можно ходить с задранным клювом."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVAL_VEST_C
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARNIVAL_VEST_C"
msgid "The customary capelet of a Cawnival-goer."
msgstr "Классический галкарнавальный наряд."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARPENTRY_BLADE_MOONGLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARPENTRY_BLADE_MOONGLASS"
msgid "For when a regular blade just won't cut it."
msgstr "Придет на помощь, когда обычная пила не справляется."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARPENTRY_STATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARPENTRY_STATION"
msgid "Quit horsing around and make some furniture."
msgstr "Отлично пилит как рамы, так и другие деревянные изделия."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARRAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARRAT"
msgid "Nimble, clever, and rich in beta carotene."
msgstr "Проворная, умная и богатая бета-каротином."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARTOGRAPHYDESK
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CARTOGRAPHYDESK"
msgid "Show everyone exactly where you've been."
msgstr "Покажи всем, где ты побывал."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CATCOONHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CATCOONHAT"
msgid "For those who value warmth over friends."
msgstr "Для тех, кому собственная шкура дороже друзей."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CATTOY_MOUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CATTOY_MOUSE"
msgid "Start a game of cat and mouse."
msgstr "Поиграйте в кошки-мышки."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CHESSPIECE_ANCHOR_BUILDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CHESSPIECE_ANCHOR_BUILDER"
msgid "Ground your base with a stone anchor."
msgstr "Бросьте каменный якорь на землю."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CHESSPIECE_ANCHOR_SKETCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CHESSPIECE_ANCHOR_SKETCH"
msgid "A sculpture sketch of an anchor."
msgstr "Эскиз статуи якоря."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CHESSPIECE_ANTLION_BUILDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CHESSPIECE_ANTLION_BUILDER"
msgid "Ain't this Antlion beautiful?"
msgstr "Разве этот Муравьиный лев не прелесть?"

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER_BUILDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER_BUILDER"
msgid "A stone reminder of a grizzly autumn."
msgstr "Каменное напоминание о медвежьей спячке."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER_MUTATED_BUILDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER_MUTATED_BUILDER"
msgid "A soul-bearing rendition of a ferocious favorite."
msgstr "Оголенная медвежья душа всеми любимого яростного зверя."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CHESSPIECE_BEEFALO_BUILDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CHESSPIECE_BEEFALO_BUILDER"
msgid "A beauteous beefalo bust."
msgstr "Бесподобный бюст бифало."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CHESSPIECE_BEEFALO_SKETCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CHESSPIECE_BEEFALO_SKETCH"
msgid "A sculpture sketch of a charming beefalo."
msgstr "Эскиз статуи очаровательного бифало."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CHESSPIECE_BEEQUEEN_BUILDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CHESSPIECE_BEEQUEEN_BUILDER"
msgid "More regal than real."
msgstr "Еще величественнее, чем в реальности."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP_BUILDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP_BUILDER"
msgid "A chesspiece with a checkered past."
msgstr "Шахматная фигура с черно-белым прошлым."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CHESSPIECE_BUTTERFLY_BUILDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CHESSPIECE_BUTTERFLY_BUILDER"
msgid "This sculpture's a moth-have."
msgstr "Изящная бабочка из неуклюжего камня."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CHESSPIECE_BUTTERFLY_SKETCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CHESSPIECE_BUTTERFLY_SKETCH"
msgid "A sculpture sketch of a Moon Moth."
msgstr "Эскиз статуи лунного мотылька."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CHESSPIECE_CARRAT_BUILDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CHESSPIECE_CARRAT_BUILDER"
msgid "A winsome sculpture of a champion."
msgstr "Очаровательная статуя чемпионки."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CHESSPIECE_CARRAT_SKETCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CHESSPIECE_CARRAT_SKETCH"
msgid "A sculpture sketch of a victorious carrat."
msgstr "Эскиз статуи моркрысы-победительницы."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CHESSPIECE_CATCOON_BUILDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CHESSPIECE_CATCOON_BUILDER"
msgid "A curious statue for a curious creature."
msgstr "Любопытная статуя любопытного существа."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CHESSPIECE_CATCOON_SKETCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CHESSPIECE_CATCOON_SKETCH"
msgid "A sculpture sketch of a playful catcoon."
msgstr "Эскиз статуи игривого енотокота."

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CHESSPIECE_CLAYHOUND_BUILDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.CHESSPIECE_CLAYHOUND_BUILDER"
msgid "It ain't nothing but a clay hound dog."
