msgid "An enchanting bush for growing berries on a moonlit night."
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.birdcage_adventure
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.birdcage_adventure"
msgid "This cage's bold design will impress even the bird it imprisons."
msgstr "Смелый дизайн этой клетки приятно удивит даже пойманную в нее птицу."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.birdcage_circus
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.birdcage_circus"
msgid "Circus freak not included."
msgstr "Цирковой чудак в комплект не входит."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.birdcage_curly
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.birdcage_curly"
msgid "Maybe a pretty cage will help the bird come to terms with its imprisonment. Probably not though."
msgstr "Может, в красивой клетке птица быстрее смирится с потерей свободы. Хотя, наверно, нет."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.birdcage_gothic
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.birdcage_gothic"
msgid "Trap birds in a prison of their own making."
msgstr "Заманивай птиц в тюрьму, созданную ими же."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.birdcage_gothicp
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.birdcage_gothicp"
msgid "Trap birds in a prison of their own making."
msgstr "Заманивай птиц в тюрьму, созданную ими же."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.birdcage_ornamental
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.birdcage_ornamental"
msgid "Imprison a bird in a wreath of seasonal cheer."
msgstr "Посади птицу в эту веселенькую тюрьму из рождественского венка."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.birdcage_pirate
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.birdcage_pirate"
msgid "The birds' swashbuckling days are over, thanks to this pirate-themed birdcage."
msgstr "Кончились вольные птичьи деньки, все из-за этой пиратской клетки."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.birdcage_romantic
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.birdcage_romantic"
msgid "Perhaps the bird will enjoy its stay."
msgstr "Надеюсь, птичке понравится ее новое жилище."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.birdtrap_an
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.birdtrap_an"
msgid "A cage even the birds will admire."
msgstr "В такой клетке птички не прочь сидеть."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.boat_grass_pirate
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.boat_grass_pirate"
msgid "A bare-bones design for the penny-pinchin' privateer."
msgstr "Примитивное судно для скупого корсара."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.boat_grass_pirate_item
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.boat_grass_pirate_item"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.boat_nautical
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.boat_nautical"
msgid "No one knows how long this boat has been lost at sea, or what became of its crew."
msgstr "Никто не знает, сколько времени это судно пробыло в море и что стало с его экипажем."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.boat_nautical_item
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.boat_nautical_item"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.boat_pirate_skin
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.boat_pirate_skin"
msgid "Terrorize the high seas with swashbuckling style."
msgstr "Покажите всем, кто тут гроза морей."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.boat_pirate_skin_item
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.boat_pirate_skin_item"
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "n/a"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.boat_wagstaff
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.boat_wagstaff"
msgid "Why use wood when you can build a boat with sturdy, dependable metal?"
msgstr "Зачем использовать дерево, если можно сделать лодку из прочного, надежного металла?"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.boat_wagstaff_item
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.boat_wagstaff_item"
msgid "n/a"
